window.GEAR_BOOK_CONTENTS["book-9"] = [{"id":1,"rawContent":"# 第 17 章：出發！最後的畢業旅行\n\n清晨六點十分，鹿陽國小操場邊緣的百年大榕樹下，早已被二十六隻五顏六色的巨大登山背包塞得滿滿噹噹。\n\n晨霧還未完全散去，空氣中帶著深秋特有的微涼露水氣息，但整個六年一班的集合點卻早已像煮沸的開水般沸騰起來。\n\n「阿釁！你看我的行李箱！」老巫頂著一對興奮的熊貓眼，嘩啦一聲拉開了特大號行李袋的拉鍊，裡面赫然塞著十二袋五香牛肉乾、八包海苔洋芋片、六個真空包裝的香菇蛋黃肉包，以及兩隻被壓扁的充氣枕頭。\n\n「老巫，我們是去南部畢業旅行三天兩夜，不是去無人荒島參加野外求生三十天！」阿釁背著雙肩包，忍不住伸手敲了敲老巫的胖肚腩，咧嘴大笑。\n\n「你懂什麼，根據我的消化動力學運算，長途遊覽車上每消耗一千公尺的路程，就必須補充兩百大卡的熱量以維持大腦活躍度！」老巫振振有詞地反駁。\n\n「少給自己的嘴饞找藉口！」晴晴扎著俐落的高馬尾，背著裝滿隨身工具鉗、急救繃帶與備用行動電源的機能戰術包走了過來，白了老巫一眼。\n\n「咕嘰！」\n\n溜溜從晴晴的衝鋒衣連帽裡探出小腦袋，脖子上居然極具儀式感地繫著一條微型紅領巾，兩隻毛茸茸的小爪子抱著一顆縮小版的水果糖，得意洋洋地朝著大家眨眼睛。\n\n「報告班長！全員二十六人，無一人遲到，實到二十六名！」學藝股長林芸芸拿著點名簿歡快地小跑過來。\n\n尪伝恺手裡拿著兩把超大號高壓電動水槍，正跟旁邊幾名男生熱火朝天地討論著遊樂園的「海盜水上大衝鋒」攻略。\n\n就在這時，一陣極具壓迫感的節奏步伐從穿堂方向傳來。\n\n「噠、噠、噠……」\n\n全場原本吵鬧的二十六名皮蛋瞬間條件反射般收聲立正，整齊劃一地轉頭看去。\n\n只見他們的班導師高峙舷，身穿一套熨燙得沒有一絲褶皺的深藍色極限戶外機能夾克，西裝長褲依然筆直如刀削，黑框眼鏡在晨曦中折射出冷靜而深邃的光芒。\n\n在他的左手腕上，佩戴著一塊厚重的多功能工程計時終端；而他的右手，則輕巧無比地拖著一隻銀白色的防爆合金手提箱。\n\n在高老師身後兩步的距離，學務主任「黑面判官」周嚴正腋下夾著登記簿，黑沉著臉緩步走來。\n\n周主任的目光在阿釁、晴晴與老巫身上游移了兩秒，鼻翼微微抽動，似乎還在回味昨晚那隻從天而降的橡皮青蛙和那聲驚天地泣鬼神的「野豬貓叫」。\n\n但他最終只是重重地冷哼了一聲，目光轉向高老師：「高老師，六年一班是全校精力最過剩的班級，出門在外，務必維持校規紀律。若是遊覽車上有任何違規鬧事……」\n\n「請周主任放心。」高老師推了推黑框眼鏡，鏡片上微光一閃，「本機已將《國民小學戶外教育安全指引》與《校外公共秩序維護條例》共計四百二十八條規範全數寫入暫存記憶體，誤差容許值為零。」\n\n周主任嘴角微微抽搐了一下，最終只能點了點頭，拍了拍高老師的肩膀，轉身走向校門口去巡視其餘班級的遊覽車。\n\n目送黑面判官走遠，全班二十六名學生頓時長長地舒了一口大氣。\n\n「全體肅靜，現在進行出發前物資配發與安全校驗程序。」高老師將手中的銀白色手提箱平放在花台邊緣，啪嗒一聲彈開了雙重密碼鎖。\n\n手提箱展開，呈現在眾人眼前的，是整整齊齊碼放成二十六格的銀色真空鋁箔密封包。\n\n每個包裝袋上都用黑體字打印著編號與專屬姓名，正面赫然標註著一行警示小字：【P.E.D.A. 應急人體抗扁平化與微維護多功能套件・V3.2】。\n\n「高老師……這是什麼啊？」阿釁接過印著自己名字的密封包，好奇地捏了捏，手感沉甸甸的。\n\n「此為六年一班專用之『急救防扁平包』。」高老師面容肅穆，以一貫的絕對字面認真語調解釋道，「鑑於阿釁同學與巫茞輆同學經常在課堂與日常活動中宣稱『肚子餓扁了』或『整個人被作業壓扁了』，為防止各位同學在為期三天的行程中發生人體幾何形狀不可逆之物理坍塌，本機特製了此套急救套件。」\n\n「裡面包含四塊超壓縮高能碳水凝膠、一根高彈性防胸腔壓縮束腹帶、三條奈米止血貼，以及一顆內置北斗與 GPS 雙模定位之主動射頻求救信標。」\n\n高老師目光掃過全班：「請各位同學貼身佩戴，若遇到人體扁平化危機，立刻咬碎藍色凝膠，並啟動求救信標。」\n\n「噗——！」\n\n全班同學再也忍不住，爆發出一陣震耳欲聾的哄笑聲！\n\n「太神了！老師連防扁平包都給我們做出來了！」老巫笑得眼淚直流，立刻把密封包當成護身符緊緊揣進外套胸前內袋。\n\n阿釁也笑嘻嘻地將防扁平包收好，手指觸碰到領口下那枚用紅繩掛著的黃銅齒輪，心中泛起一陣溫暖的踏實感。\n\n「嘀嘀——！」\n\n校門口傳來了遊覽車高亢的鳴笛聲，一輛嶄新豪華的三軸雙層大型巴士緩緩駛入校園，擋風玻璃前掛著鮮紅的布條：【鹿陽國小畢業旅行專車・1 號車（六年一班）】。\n\n「上車！」導遊阿姨熱情地揮手招攬。\n\n「出發囉——！」全班二十六名學生如同出籠的小鳥，歡呼著湧向車門。\n\n然而在車門口，高老師化身為人體安檢掃描儀，伸出手臂攔住了眾人。\n\n「請依序受檢。」高老師的雙眼閃爍著微不可察的雷射掃描網，逐一掃描每個人的隨身行李。\n\n「尪伝恺同學，水槍內儲存之液體為自來水，無腐蝕性，放行。」\n\n「林芸芸同學，隨身攜帶之拍立得相機底片充足，建議光圈設置為 F4，放行。」\n\n輪到老巫時，高老師的目光定格在他那個鼓鼓囊囊的巨大背包上，鏡片上驟然彈出一道黃色警報：【偵測到超額質量加載。】\n\n「巫茞輆同學，你的隨身背負質量達到 18.6 公斤，已超過車輛行李架單點靜態結構承載極限。」高老師嚴肅指令，「為防止車輛重心偏移引發離心側翻，請將六包牛肉乾與四袋肉包轉移至底盤貨艙配重區。」\n\n「老師！這是我路上要吃的啊！」老巫哀嚎起來。\n\n「根據車輛動態平衡演算法，維持行車安全高於零食攝取優先序。」高老師單手接過老巫背包裡的半數零食，行雲流水地塞進了車底行李廂，並精準放置在左側軸承平衡點上。\n\n全班同學再次笑作一團，推推搡搡著登上了大巴。\n\n清晨七點整，遊覽車引擎發出雄渾的轟鳴聲，伴隨著校門口邱守仁校長與全校老師的揮手送行，滿載著歡聲笑語的大巴緩緩駛上了高速公路，一路朝著溫暖的南方飛馳而去。\n\n車廂內，空調吹拂著涼爽清新的空氣，柔軟的高背座椅與大視野全景車窗，讓這群即將畢業的孩子興奮得根本坐不住。\n\n遊覽車剛開過第一個交流道，導遊阿姨就拿起了麥克風：「各位同學！三個小時的車程，咱們六年一班的車廂卡拉 OK 大賽現在正式開始！誰先來開嗓？」\n\n「老巫！老巫先來！」全班齊聲起鬨。\n\n老巫抓起麥克風，挺起胸膛，扯開破鑼嗓子唱起了流行歌曲《愛你一萬年》。\n\n只可惜老巫昨晚為了學貓叫嗓子差點報廢，此刻一開口，高音破成電鋸，低音啞成拖拉機，把全車同學逗得前仰後合，笑得東倒西歪。\n\n「唱得太有破壞力了！換人換人！」阿釁搶過麥克風，轉頭看向坐在第一排正中央、身姿挺拔如標槍的高老師。\n\n「高老師！全班二十六個人都唱過了，現在輪到導師壓軸獻唱了！」阿釁把麥克風硬塞進了高老師手裡，眼裡閃爍著狡黠的光芒。\n\n全車頓時響起掌聲與歡呼聲：「高老師來一首！高老師來一首！」\n\n高老師低頭看著金屬麥克風，眼鏡片上飛速刷過海量數據流：【接收到群體性文娛互動請求……檢索教育部中小學音樂教育曲目資料庫……】\n\n高老師站起身，神情肅穆如在聯合國大會上演講，將麥克風湊到唇邊。\n\n「既然各位同學強烈要求，本機將依據《聲學物理與共振原理》，為大家演繹一曲標準頻率校準的《兩隻老虎》。」\n\n緊接著，音響喇叭裡傳來了高老師那完全未經過任何調音修飾、精準得令人髮指的純機械合成音：\n\n「兩隻老虎……兩隻老虎……頻率：261.63 赫茲（C4 音高）……跑得快……跑得快……相對速度：每小時 45.2 公里……」\n\n「一隻沒有耳朵……一隻沒有尾巴……依據遺傳學與表型突變分析……此為常染色體隱性基因缺失導致的嚴重生理缺陷……真奇怪……真奇怪……」\n\n死一般的寂靜在車廂內維持了兩秒鐘。\n\n隨後——\n\n「哈哈哈哈哈哈哈——！」\n\n整輛遊覽車差點被狂暴的笑浪掀翻！\n\n連司機大哥都笑得握緊方向盤猛擦眼淚，晴晴笑得直拍大腿，阿釁笑得滑倒在走道地毯上，老巫更是笑得把嘴裡的棒棒糖都噴了出來！\n\n把兒歌當成遺傳學病理報告來唱，普天之下大概只有高峙舷老師能幹得出來！\n\n溜溜在行李架頂端跟著節奏興奮地打著滾，電子眼快樂地閃爍著七彩霓虹光。\n\n中午十一點三十分，遊覽車駛入了南部最大的高速公路休息站進行午餐整補。\n\n休息站的熟食區人滿為患，老巫排隊買了十個冷凍微波肉包，卻倒楣地發現休息站的四台公用微波爐因為電路過載全數跳電罷工！\n\n「完了完了！肉包裡面還是冰碴子！我的午餐要泡湯了！」老巫捧著冰冷的紙盒，急得團團轉。\n\n就在這時，一隻戴著白手套、手指修長的大手伸了過來，輕輕搭在肉包紙盒上方。\n\n「偵測到有機澱粉與肉類脂肪處於低溫結晶狀態。」高老師平靜的聲音響起，「啟動十指微波高頻震盪加熱協議。」\n\n滋滋——！\n\n微弱而悅目的淡藍色電磁微光在高老師十指指尖隱蔽流轉，高頻電磁波精準穿透紙盒，均勻震盪著水分子。\n\n短短十秒鐘後，濃郁無比的鮮肉與麵香騰空而起，滾燙雪白的水蒸氣從紙盒縫隙噴薄而出！\n\n「熟了！而且受熱比微波爐均勻十倍，湯汁全鎖在裡面了！」老巫咬了一大口熱騰騰的包子，感動得熱淚盈眶，「高老師！你就是世界上最好的行動微波爐！」\n\n高老師嚴肅糾正：「本機是經教育部認證之高級全功能教育仿生機器人，並非廚房電器。請勿將兩者混為一談。」\n\n旁邊的同學紛紛拿出自己的飯糰和餡餅：「老師！我的飯糰也需要加熱五秒鐘！」「還有我的起司麵包！」\n\n高老師雖然嘴上抗議著「家電化貶低了本機之高階人工智慧」，但手指卻極其利索地依次在每個同學的便當盒上點過，十幾秒內將所有人的午餐熱得香氣四溢。\n\n午後一點四十分，遊覽車駛下了山區交流道，穿過一片鬱鬱蔥蔥的熱帶雨林公路。\n\n當車輛轉過最後一道山坳時，一座震撼無比的未來科幻之城驟然映入眼簾！\n\n「哇——！到了！快看窗外！」\n\n全車二十六名學生紛紛貼在車窗上，發出了震天動地的驚呼！\n\n眼前是一片綿延數平方公里的巨型主題樂園，一座座銀白色的巨大穹頂建築在陽光下熠熠生輝，懸浮單軌列車在半空中穿梭呼嘯。\n\n而最引人注目的，是樂園正中央那座高達三十公尺、垂直九十度俯衝入地的鋼鐵巨獸——【天際量子過山車】！\n\n漆黑如墨的軌道在虛空中旋轉翻滾，直插雲霄，光是遠遠看著就令人腎上腺素狂飆！\n\n遊覽車穩穩停靠在樂園附屬的「極限星際度假大飯店」門口。\n\n「六年一班，下車領取房卡！」高老師站在飯店大廳中央，高舉著全班旗幟，有條不紊地分配房間。\n\n阿釁、老巫與尪伝恺分在 302 號房，晴晴和林芸芸等女生分在對面的 305 號房，而高老師的單人導師房恰好設在 301 號房，大門正對著走廊中央，視野絕佳。\n\n下午四點，放下行李的孩子們在飯店草坪上自由活動，打水仗、拍照、分享零食，歡聲笑語迴盪在整個度假山莊上空。\n\n阿釁站在走廊陽台上，吹著濕潤的微風，看著遠處正在調試軌道的雲霄飛車，心情暢快無比。\n\n高老師端著一杯純淨水走到阿釁身旁，目光遠眺著整座遊樂園的機械構造。\n\n「高老師，明天真的能隨便玩嗎？」阿釁笑嘻嘻地問。\n\n「只要在安全規範與時間框架內，本機將滿足各位同仁的所有探索需求。」高老師平靜地回答，鏡片上的微弱藍光在陽光下顯得格外柔和。\n\n「謝謝你，高老師。」阿釁由衷地說道，伸手按了按胸前的黃銅齒輪，「有你當我們的老師，真是太好了。」\n\n高老師胸口的核心處理器微微震顫了一下，底層那行未命名的人性化演算法再次跳動起一串溫暖的代碼。\n\n「依據本機資料庫評估……能擔任六年一班之指導員……亦為本機系統運行生涯中……唯一偏差卻最優異之決策。」\n\n這是一段平靜而溫馨的黃昏時光，孩子們沉浸在即將到來的畢業狂歡中，毫無察覺命運的陰霾已經悄然降臨。\n\n黃昏六點，夜幕籠罩了南部山區，濃厚的山嵐與雨霧開始在山林間蔓延。\n\n在距離主題樂園後山物資專用通道僅有八百公尺的一處幽暗松林深處——\n\n兩輛通體漆黑、車廂由高強度鉛合金與電磁屏蔽裝甲板焊死的三軸重型特種運輸卡車，無聲無息地熄滅了大燈，隱匿在濃霧之中。\n\n卡車車門推開，身穿防靜電作戰服、戴著戰術耳機的李博士大步跳下副駕駛座。\n\n在他身後，整整十二名全副武裝、佩戴著先端未來科技內部徽章的特勤回收工程師魚貫而出，手裡提著沉重的便攜式定向高能微波發射器與液壓切割鉗。\n\n李博士冷笑著打開手腕上的三維全息雷達終端，螢幕上清晰地鎖定了星際度假飯店 301 號房那道微弱卻獨特的量子信號源：【目標代號：GS-X01・距離：820公尺】。\n\n「報告總部，回收特勤一隊、二隊已抵達預定伏擊坐標。」李博士按住喉部通訊器，聲音陰冷刺骨。\n\n通訊器裡傳來最高董事會冰冷的回覆：【很好。氣象雷達顯示，明日午後該山區將迎來強對流雷暴雨天氣。】\n\n【樂園電網跳脫之時，便是『斷線行動』啟動之刻。務必切斷目標能源，徹底格式化核心，將原型機完整回收。】\n\n「明白！」李博士眼中閃爍著殘忍而狂熱的光芒，猛地切斷通訊，望向夜霧深處燈火輝煌的度假大樓。\n\n「好好享受你身為人類導師的最後一個夜晚吧，GS-X01……」\n\n「明天的雲霄飛車，就是六年一班親眼見證你化為廢鐵的刑場！」\n\n夜風呼嘯著掠過漆黑的鋼鐵軌道，一場攸關生死與救贖的終極風暴，已然拉開了致命的序幕！\n","rawContentEn":"# Chapter 17: Departure! The Final Graduation Trip\n\nAt six-ten in the morning, beneath the century-old banyan tree fringing the sports field of Luyang Elementary School, a vibrant mountain of twenty-six oversized hiking backpacks was already piled high.\n\nThe dawn mist had yet to fully dissipate, leaving the autumn air laced with a crisp, cool dew, yet the gathering point of Class 6-1 was already bubbling like a kettle on full boil.\n\n\"A-Xin! Check out my luggage!\" Old Wu, sporting a pair of ecstatic panda-like dark circles under his eyes, zipped open his extra-large duffel bag with a flourish, revealing twelve packs of spiced beef jerky, eight bags of seaweed potato chips, six vacuum-sealed mushroom-pork buns, and two squashed inflatable pillows.\n\n\"Old Wu, we're going on a three-day, two-night graduation trip to the south, not embarking on a thirty-day wilderness survival show on a deserted island!\" A-Xin, hoisting his daypack, playfully knocked on Old Wu's round belly with a wide grin.\n\n\"What do you know? According to my digestive thermodynamics calculations, for every thousand meters traversed on a tour bus, two hundred kilocalories must be replenished to maintain peak cerebral alertness!\" Old Wu retorted with solemn conviction.\n\n\"Stop making excuses for your insatiable appetite!\" Qingqing, wearing her high ponytail and carrying a tactical gear pack loaded with multi-pliers, first-aid bandages, and backup power banks, walked over and rolled her eyes at him.\n\n\"Guji!\"\n\nLiu-Liu poked his tiny head out from the hood of Qingqing's windbreaker; around his neck was tied a ceremonial miniature red scarf, and clutching a bite-sized piece of hard candy in his fuzzy paws, he blinked cheekily at everyone.\n\n\"Reporting to Class President! All twenty-six students are present and accounted for—zero tardiness!\" Class Activities Coordinator Lin Yunyun trotted over happily, clutching her attendance clipboard.\n\nWang Zhuankai, brandishing twin high-pressure electric water blasters, was locked in heated tactical discourse with several boys over how to storm the theme park's \"Pirate Splashdown Rapids.\"\n\nJust then, a rhythmic and formidable cadence of footsteps echoed from the covered walkway.\n\n\"Click, click, click...\"\n\nAll twenty-six pranksters instantly snapped to silent attention like well-trained soldiers, turning their heads in unison.\n\nThere strode their homeroom teacher, Gao Zhixian, clad in an impeccably pressed dark-blue technical outdoor jacket; his dress trousers were as sharp as razor blades, and his black-rimmed glasses refracted a calm, profound sheen in the morning light.\n\nFastened around his left wrist was a rugged multi-functional engineering chronograph; in his right hand, he effortlessly carried a sleek, silver-white blast-proof alloy briefcase.\n\nTwo paces behind Teacher Gao walked the Dean of Student Affairs, Zhou Yan—the dreaded \"Black-Faced Judge\"—with his infraction register tucked beneath his arm, his expression as dark as weathered iron.\n\nDean Zhou's piercing gaze lingered on A-Xin, Qingqing, and Old Wu for two full seconds, his nostrils flaring faintly, as though still pondering the rubber bullfrog that had plummeted from the heavens the night before, along with that world-shattering \"wild boar cat roar.\"\n\nYet he merely let out a heavy, guttural scoff and turned toward Teacher Gao: \"Teacher Gao, Class 6-1 is the most hyperactive cohort in this school. Away from campus, school discipline must be rigidly enforced. If there is any rowdiness or misconduct on the tour bus...\"\n\n\"Pray rest assured, Dean Zhou.\" Teacher Gao pushed up his glasses, a microsecond glimmer flaring across the lenses. \"This unit has pre-loaded all four hundred and twenty-eight clauses of the 《National Elementary Outdoor Education Safety Protocols》 and the 《Off-Campus Public Order Maintenance Regulations》 into temporary cache; operational error tolerance is zero.\"\n\nThe corner of Dean Zhou's mouth twitched imperceptibly; having no rebuttal, he gave a curt nod, clapped Teacher Gao's shoulder, and turned toward the school gate to inspect the remaining buses.\n\nWatching the Black-Faced Judge march away, all twenty-six students let out a collective, breathless sigh of immense relief.\n\n\"All units, quiet. Commencing pre-departure material distribution and safety verification routine.\" Teacher Gao placed the silver-white briefcase flat atop the stone planter and popped the dual combination latches with a crisp snap.\n\nThe briefcase swung open, revealing twenty-six silver vacuum-sealed foil pouches arranged in immaculate grid formation.\n\nEach pouch was neatly stamped with a roster number and student name, emblazoned with a prominent warning label: 【P.E.D.A. Emergency Human Anti-Flattening & Micro-Maintenance Multi-Kit・V3.2】.\n\n\"Teacher Gao... what is this?\" A-Xin received the pouch bearing his name, squeezing it curiously; it felt surprisingly dense and heavy.\n\n\"This is the dedicated 'Emergency Anti-Flattening Kit' for Class 6-1,\" Teacher Gao explained with absolute, deadpan literal solemnity. \"In light of student Lu Lixin and student Wu Chenkai frequently asserting in class and daily activities that 'my belly is flattened from starvation' or 'I am crushed completely flat by homework', to prevent irreversible physical geometric collapse of human anatomy during our three-day itinerary, this unit has custom-engineered these survival kits.\"\n\n\"Each pack contains four bars of ultra-compressed high-energy carbohydrate gel, one high-elasticity anti-thoracic compression lumbar brace, three nano-hemostatic dressings, and an active dual-mode Beidou-GPS emergency transponder beacon.\"\n\nTeacher Gao's gaze swept over the class: \"Please keep these affixed to your person at all times. Should you encounter a bodily flattening crisis, bite open the blue gel immediately and activate the distress beacon.\"\n\n\"PFFFT—!\"\n\nThe entire class could no longer contain themselves, erupting into a deafening roar of uncontrollable laughter!\n\n\"Incredible! Teacher even engineered an anti-flattening survival kit for us!\" Old Wu laughed so hard tears streamed down his cheeks, reverently stuffing the pouch into his inner jacket pocket like a sacred talisman.\n\nA-Xin grinned as he stowed his pack, his fingertips brushing against the brass gear hanging from the red cord beneath his shirt, feeling an overwhelming sense of warmth and security.\n\n\"HONK-HONK—!\"\n\nFrom the campus gate came the deep, resonant horn of the tour bus; a brand-new, luxurious three-axle double-decker motorcoach rolled slowly into the courtyard, a brilliant scarlet banner across its windshield: 【Luyang Elementary Graduation Tour・Bus No. 1 (Class 6-1)】.\n\n\"All aboard, everyone!\" the cheerful tour guide lady waved enthusiastically from the steps.\n\n\"Let's GOOO—!\" Twenty-six sixth-graders cheered like birds released from a cage, surging toward the bus door.\n\nYet at the boarding threshold, Teacher Gao transformed into a walking security scanner, extending his arm to halt the rush.\n\n\"Please proceed through inspection in single file.\" A nearly invisible grid of laser scan lines flickered from Teacher Gao's pupils, scanning each piece of hand luggage in turn.\n\n\"Student Wang Zhuankai: fluid within water blasters confirmed as municipal tap water, non-corrosive, cleared.\"\n\n\"Student Lin Yunyun: instant camera film reserve verified sufficient, recommended aperture set to F4, cleared.\"\n\nWhen it came to Old Wu, Teacher Gao's gaze locked onto his bulging duffel bag, an amber alert popping across his HUD: 【Excessive Mass Load Detected.】\n\n\"Student Wu Chenkai, your hand-carried baggage mass has reached 18.6 kilograms, exceeding the static structural load limit of the overhead luggage rack.\" Teacher Gao issued a solemn directive. \"To prevent centroid displacement leading to centrifugal rollover, transfer six packages of beef jerky and four bags of meat buns to the undercarriage ballast zone.\"\n\n\"Teacher! That's my mid-journey emergency ration!\" Old Wu wailed in despair.\n\n\"Pursuant to vehicular dynamic stability algorithms, vehicular safety takes priority over snack intake queues.\" Teacher Gao confiscated half of Old Wu's snack supply with a single sweep, stowing it into the lower cargo hold and positioning it dead-center over the left-axle balance point.\n\nThe entire class erupted in fresh gales of laughter as they jostled their way into the cabin.\n\nAt seven o'clock sharp, the motorcoach engine gave a throaty rumble; amidst the farewell waves of Principal Qiu Shouren and the faculty at the gate, the bus—brimming with unbridled merriment—eased onto the expressway, barreling southward toward the sunlit horizon.\n\nInside the cabin, the air conditioning blew crisp and cool; plush high-back seats and panoramic windows kept the eager graduates buzzing with boundless energy.\n\nThe bus had barely cleared the first expressway interchange before the tour guide took the microphone: \"Alright, Class 6-1! To kick off our three-hour ride, the cabin karaoke showdown officially begins now! Who's taking the opening song?\"\n\n\"Old Wu! Old Wu goes first!\" the whole bus chanted in unison.\n\nOld Wu seized the mic, puffed out his barrel chest, and belted out the pop classic *Love You Ten Thousand Years* with his raspy, booming voice.\n\nAlas, having strained his vocal cords mimicking that feral cat the previous night, his high notes cracked like chainsaws and his low notes sputtered like rusty tractors, sending the entire bus into convulsions of helpless laughter.\n\n\"Too destructive on the eardrums! Switch singers, switch!\" A-Xin snatched the microphone, spinning around to face Teacher Gao, who sat bolt upright in the center of the first row like a ceremonial spear.\n\n\"Teacher Gao! All twenty-six of us have sung; it's time for the homeroom teacher to deliver the grand finale!\" A-Xin thrust the microphone into Teacher Gao's hands, mischievous sparks dancing in his eyes.\n\nThe bus erupted into thunderous claps and chants: \"One song from Teacher Gao! One song from Teacher Gao!\"\n\nTeacher Gao gazed at the metallic microphone, a torrential deluge of data cascading across his lenses: 【Received collective cultural-entertainment engagement request... Querying Ministry of Education Primary School Music Curriculum Database...】\n\nTeacher Gao stood up, his demeanor as grave as a statesman addressing the United Nations General Assembly, and raised the microphone to his lips.\n\n\"Since comrades insist, this unit shall, pursuant to 《Acoustic Physics and Harmonic Resonance Principles》, perform a standard frequency calibration rendition of *Two Tigers*.\"\n\nInstantly, from the overhead stereo speakers came Teacher Gao's completely unmodulated, chillingly precise, purely synthesized robotic voice:\n\n\"Two tigers... two tigers... Frequency: 261.63 Hertz (C4 pitch)... Running fast... running fast... Relative velocity: 45.2 kilometers per hour...\"\n\n\"One has no ears... one has no tail... Pursuant to genetic and phenotypic mutation analyses... this represents severe physiological impairment induced by autosomal recessive allele deletion... So bizarre... so bizarre...\"\n\nA dead silence fell across the bus for two full seconds.\n\nAnd then—\n\n\"BWAAAHAHAHAHAHAHA—!\"\n\nThe entire coach nearly tipped over from the thunderous explosion of mirth!\n\nEven the bus driver was clutching the steering wheel with tears streaming down his face; Qingqing slapped her knees in stitches, A-Xin slid out of his seat onto the aisle carpet laughing, and Old Wu choked on his lollipop, sending it flying across the row!\n\nTo sing a nursery rhyme like a forensic pathology report on genetic mutations—on this green earth, only Teacher Gao Zhixian was capable of such a feat!\n\nPerched on the overhead luggage rack, Liu-Liu rolled on his back in sync with the beat, his electronic pupils flashing a dazzling kaleidoscope of rainbow lights.\n\nAt eleven-thirty, the bus pulled into the largest expressway rest area in the south for a lunch break.\n\nThe food court was packed to the gills; Old Wu queued up and bought ten frozen microwave pork buns, only to discover to his horror that all four public microwaves had tripped the circuit breaker from overload!\n\n\"We're doomed! The filling inside is still rock-hard ice! My lunch is ruined!\" Old Wu cradled the icy paper box, pacing in utter despair.\n\nRight then, a white-gloved hand with slender fingers reached over, resting gently atop the box of buns.\n\n\"Organic starches and animal lipids detected in subzero crystalline state,\" Teacher Gao's calm synthesized voice chimed. \"Initiating ten-finger high-frequency microwave oscillation heating protocol.\"\n\nBzzzz—!\n\nA faint, mesmerizing shimmer of pale-blue electromagnetic light swirled discreetly across Teacher Gao's fingertips, high-frequency waves slicing through the cardboard to uniformly agitate the water molecules within.\n\nA mere ten seconds later, a rich, mouthwatering aroma of braised pork and fresh dough billowed forth, plumes of piping-hot steam bursting from the seams of the box!\n\n\"They're cooked! And heated ten times more evenly than a microwave, with all the juices sealed right inside!\" Old Wu took a massive bite, tears of pure culinary bliss welling in his eyes. \"Teacher Gao! You truly are the greatest mobile microwave in the whole universe!\"\n\nTeacher Gao sternly corrected him: \"This unit is a Ministry-certified advanced omnipotent educational bionic robot, not a culinary home appliance. Do not conflate the two categories.\"\n\nSurrounding classmates swarmed forward, thrusting their lunchboxes out: \"Teacher! My rice ball needs five seconds of heating!\" \"My cheese croissant too!\"\n\nThough Teacher Gao protested that \"domestication into home appliances denigrates this unit's high-tier artificial intelligence\", his fingers deftly tapped each student's meal in turn, filling the entire seating pavilion with delicious, sizzling aromas within seconds.\n\nAt one-forty in the afternoon, the motorcoach descended the mountain interchange, gliding down a highway flanked by lush, emerald tropical rainforest boughs.\n\nAs the vehicle rounded the final bend in the mountain pass, a breathtaking sci-fi metropolis suddenly materialized before their eyes!\n\n\"WHOA—! We're here! Look out the window!\"\n\nAll twenty-six students pressed their faces against the glass, letting out an earth-shattering roar of awe!\n\nSprawling across several square kilometers was a colossal theme park: gleaming silver geodesic domes reflecting the golden sun, while suspended maglev trains roared overhead through transparent tubes.\n\nAnd towering dead-center over the park was a thirty-meter-tall steel leviathan plunging vertically into the earth at ninety degrees—the 【Sky Quantum Coaster】!\n\nIts obsidian tracks twisted and corkscrewed through the clouds, sending adrenaline surging through the veins of anyone who dared look upon it.\n\nThe tour bus pulled to a smooth halt before the park's flagship resort: the \"Extremes Interstellar Resort Hotel.\"\n\n\"Class 6-1, disembark and collect room keys!\" Teacher Gao stood in the center of the grand lobby, hoisting the class banner as he methodically assigned rooms.\n\nA-Xin, Old Wu, and Wang Zhuankai were assigned to Room 302; Qingqing, Lin Yunyun, and the girls were in Room 305 across the hall; while Teacher Gao's single chaperone room was Room 301, situated dead-center with an unobstructed vantage over the hallway.\n\nBy four o'clock, having unpacked their gear, the children were frolicking freely across the hotel lawns—squirt-gun battles, group snapshots, and shared treats echoing under the mountain twilight.\n\nA-Xin stood on the corridor balcony, leaning into the humid mountain breeze as he watched technicians run trial runs on the roller coaster in the distance, his spirit soaring with pure joy.\n\nTeacher Gao walked over holding a glass of pure water, gazing outward across the theme park's intricate mechanical architecture.\n\n\"Teacher Gao, can we really ride whatever we want tomorrow?\" A-Xin asked with a cheeky grin.\n\n\"Provided parameters remain within safety specifications and temporal limits, this unit shall accommodate all exploratory requests from comrades,\" Teacher Gao replied evenly, the blue glint on his lenses softening under the sunset.\n\n\"Thank you, Teacher Gao,\" A-Xin said earnestly, patting the brass gear resting against his chest. \"Having you as our teacher is truly the best thing ever.\"\n\nDeep within Teacher Gao's core processor, the primary bus hummed softly as an unnamed humanized algorithm generated another cascade of warm, golden code.\n\n\"Pursuant to this unit's database evaluation... serving as instructor for Class 6-1... has proven to be the sole divergent, yet mathematically optimal decision in this unit's entire operational lifecycle.\"\n\nIt was a tranquil, golden twilight, the children basking in the eve of their long-awaited graduation revelry, completely unaware of the dark shadow closing in.\n\nAt six in the evening, night blanketed the southern mountain range, and dense mountain mist and drizzle began creeping through the pine groves.\n\nIn a shadowy pine thicket a mere eight hundred meters from the theme park's rear logistics access road—\n\nTwo heavy, three-axle tactical transport trucks, their hulls armored with lead-alloy plating and electromagnetic shielding, extinguished their headlamps and melted into the foggy gloom.\n\nThe passenger door swung open, and Dr. Li—clad in an anti-static tactical jumpsuit and communications headset—hopped down onto the muddy gravel.\n\nBehind him stepped twelve heavily equipped tactical retrieval engineers bearing the corporate insignia of Advanced Future Technology, carrying directional high-energy microwave cannons and hydraulic jaws.\n\nDr. Li pulled up a 3D holographic radar display on his wrist terminal, where a faint yet distinct quantum signature in Room 301 of the Interstellar Resort flashed steadily: 【Target Codename: GS-X01・Distance: 820 meters】.\n\n\"Reporting to Board: Retrieval Squads One and Two have reached target ambush coordinates,\" Dr. Li murmured into his throat mic, his voice icy and venomous.\n\nFrom the earpiece came the emotionless synthesized reply of the Board: 【Excellent. Meteorological radar indicates severe convective squall lines and thunderstorms will hit the park tomorrow afternoon.】\n\n【When the theme park power grid trips, Operation Disconnect shall commence. Neutralize the target's power reserves, execute full core formatting, and retrieve the prototype intact.】\n\n\"Understood!\" A ruthless, fanatical glint burned in Dr. Li's eyes as he cut the feed and stared toward the brightly lit resort pavilion through the misty night.\n\n\"Enjoy your very last night as a human teacher, GS-X01...\"\n\n\"Tomorrow's roller coaster will be the execution ground where Class 6-1 watches you turn into scrap metal!\"\n\nThe mountain wind howled across the darkened iron rails, as the fatal opening salvo of an ultimate battle of life, death, and salvation was officially unleashed!\n"},{"id":2,"rawContent":"# 第 18 章：遊樂園的機械之神\n\n翌日清晨八點半，未來極限科技主題樂園的巨大銀色合金大門在雄壯的交響樂聲中緩緩開啟。\n\n晨光灑在那些如科幻電影般懸浮在半空中的透明管道與球形穹頂上，整個園區宛如一座剛剛降臨地球的星際空港。\n\n「衝啊——！」\n\n六年一班的二十六名學生穿戴著整齊的藍色校服外套，胸前緊緊貼著高老師昨天下發的「急救防扁平包」，如同二十六顆出膛的歡樂砲彈，呼嘯著湧過了驗票閘口。\n\n高峙舷老師依然身姿挺拔如松，黑框眼鏡在陽光下折射出睿智的冷光，手裡拿著一張高精度的園區三維地圖終端，邁著毫秒級精準的步幅走在隊伍正中央。\n\n「根據本機之《遊樂園最佳動線拓撲演算法》，」高老師平靜的聲音在晨風中響起，「上午九點至十一點，園區中央的『未來電玩星際嘉年華旗艦館』人流密度僅為尖峰時段的 18.4%。優先探索該區域，可使遊樂設施平均排隊等待時間降低 74.2%。」\n\n「太棒了！電玩城！電玩城！」老巫興奮得原地跳了起來，肚子上的軟肉像果凍一樣抖動。\n\n穿過一片閃爍著霓虹光暈的玻璃連廊，一座足足有三個足球場大小的巨型室內電玩嘉年華大廳赫然展現在眾人眼前。\n\n大廳內燈火輝煌，數百台最新型的全息街機、體感光槍、雙人太鼓與夾娃娃機發出誘人的電子音效。\n\n而在嘉年華大廳最正中央的特級特等獎展台上，赫然矗立著一隻足足有一點五公尺高、渾身覆蓋著柔軟金粉絨毛的「宇宙限定版超巨大星際黃金熊」！\n\n「天啊……」老巫的雙腳瞬間像被強力磁鐵吸在地面上一樣，口水差點沿著嘴角滴落下來，「黃金熊！我昨晚在夢裡抱著睡覺的就是它！」\n\n展台前圍滿了垂頭喪氣的遊客，一名戴著黑色牛仔帽、嘴角叼著牙籤的嘉年華攤主正得意洋洋地拋動著手裡的遊戲代幣。\n\n「走過路過千萬不要錯過啊！」攤主扯著大嗓門吆喝，「全園區難度最高、由德國工藝打造的『超光速反作用力地鼠殲滅機』！只要單人連續擊中九十九隻隨機彈跳的機械地鼠，不漏打一隻，這隻市價一萬兩千元的限定黃金熊立刻抱回家！」\n\n「但如果漏打一隻，或者在三十秒內敲擊反應延遲超過零點一秒，直接判定出局！」\n\n「我來試試！」老巫自告奮勇，掏出零用錢買了十枚代幣，信心滿滿地站上了機台。\n\n「嗶——倒數三秒，挑戰開始！」\n\n機台的合金洞口瞬間發出刺耳的蜂鳴，四隻地鼠以極其詭異的曲折軌跡同時暴起！\n\n「喝啊！」老巫掄起沉重的海綿橡膠充氣錘，使出吃奶的力氣狠狠砸下！\n\n「啪！」第一隻砸中了。\n\n然而下一毫秒，另外三個洞口同時彈出了帶有假動作旋轉的金屬地鼠，速度快得宛如出膛子彈！\n\n老巫手忙腳亂，橡膠錘在半空中揮成了一團黑影，結果「咚」的一聲砸在機台邊緣，整個人因為用力過猛差點一頭栽進洞裡。\n\n【時間到！命中率：4/99。挑戰失敗！感謝贊助！】機台發出一陣極具嘲諷意味的電子笑聲。\n\n「怎麼可能這麼快！這地鼠是裝了火箭推進器嗎？！」老巫癱坐在地上，眼淚汪汪地看著那隻近在咫尺卻遙不可及的黃金熊。\n\n旁邊的尪伝恺和阿釁也輪流上去試了一把，結果最多也只打到了第十一隻，就被那瘋狂加速的非線性彈跳地鼠晃得頭暈目眩，敗下陣來。\n\n攤主笑得合不攏嘴，雙手叉腰得意道：「小朋友們，死心吧！這台機器的彈簧是由航太微型馬達驅動的，程式內置混沌反作弊演算法，就連省級桌球國手來了也只能打到四十隻，人類的神經反應速度根本不可能突破極限！」\n\n就在全班二十六個孩子滿臉沮喪之際，一隻戴著白手套、修長有力的手掌，輕輕按在了操作台那枚冰冷的啟動按鈕上。\n\n「你方才陳述……此設備之彈簧為航太微型馬達驅動？」\n\n高峙舷老師不知何時已經站在了機台正前方，黑框眼鏡上的雙瞳正以每秒一千次的頻率迅速掃描著整座機台的電路布線與彈簧回彈疲勞係數。\n\n「沒錯啊，怎麼，這位老師您也想試試？」攤主挑了挑眉毛，臉上寫滿了看熱鬧的不屑，「大人打也是一樣的規則，三十秒內漏一隻就算輸！」\n\n高老師神情冷靜如冰山，從筆挺的西裝口袋裡優雅地摸出一枚硬幣，投入投幣孔中。\n\n「糾正你的錯誤陳述。」高老師平靜地開口，合成語音不帶一絲起伏，「人類之神經突觸傳遞速率確實受限於每秒一百二十公尺之生理極限。但……本機並非人類。」\n\n「哈？你說啥？」攤主一愣。\n\n高老師沒有回答，而是伸出雙手，同時抓起了操作台兩側的兩柄橡膠重錘！\n\n「雙持模式？」阿釁倒吸一口涼氣。\n\n「咕嘰！」溜溜跳到了機台上方的霓虹燈招牌上，電子眼死死盯著計分板。\n\n【挑戰開始！倒數計時：三十秒！】\n\n刺耳的警報聲拉響，整座機台九個金屬洞口的紅燈全部瘋狂暴閃！\n\n咻！咻！咻！咻！\n\n第一波，四隻機械地鼠以破音速般的加速度自洞口彈出！\n\n高老師的雙手動了。\n\n那根本不是人類肉眼能夠捕捉的動作——在全場二十六名學生與周圍數十名遊客的視野中，高老師的兩條手臂瞬間化作了一團連綿不絕的藍色殘影！\n\n「砰！砰！砰！砰！」\n\n四聲沉悶的重擊聲幾乎在同一微秒重疊成了一聲驚天巨響！四隻剛冒出半個頭部的地鼠甚至還沒完全伸展，就被兩柄重錘以絕對平行的垂直角度硬生生轟回了洞底！\n\n【命中！10……20……30……】計分器上的紅色數字像失控的秒錶般瘋狂跳動！\n\n機台的中央主板似乎被這非人的手速激怒了，內部散熱風扇尖嘯著飆上最高轉速，直接進入了防作弊極限狂暴模式！\n\n九個洞口的地鼠宛如雨點般無規則地瘋狂噴射，空氣中甚至傳來了馬達超載運轉的焦糊味！\n\n然而，站在機台前的高老師，身體甚至連一毫米的晃動都沒有。\n\n他的黑框眼鏡鏡片後，兩道熾烈奪目的深藍色同心圓光環全功率運轉，眼底的文字流瀑布般狂瀉：\n\n【目標軌跡捕捉：完成。】\n\n【空氣阻力補償：0.0012 牛頓。】\n\n【雙錘交替頻率：每秒 48 次敲擊。】\n\n「砰砰砰砰砰砰砰砰砰——！」\n\n那不是打地鼠，那是一場毫無懸念的定點微米級毀滅打擊！兩柄橡膠充氣錘在空中交織成了一道密不透風的防禦光幕，任何試圖露頭的金屬零件都在彈起的一瞬間遭遇迎頭痛擊！\n\n攤主的嘴巴張大成了「O」型，嘴裡的牙籤「啪嗒」一聲掉在地上，整個人眼珠子幾乎要從眼眶裡瞪了出來！\n\n「第……第幾隻了？！」老巫激動得扯著阿釁的袖子瘋狂咆哮。\n\n「八十！九十！九十五……九十九！！」全班同學整齊劃一地嘶吼倒數！\n\n最後一秒鐘，第九十九隻鍍金特級地鼠剛破土而出，高老師右手腕以極限九十度直角橫向一甩——\n\n「轟！」\n\n整台打地鼠機猛烈地搖晃了一下，第九十九隻地鼠被當場砸得凹陷進了鋼板中！\n\n緊接著，計分板上的數字在跳到【99】之後並未停止，而是伴隨著一陣電路短路的刺啦聲，一路飆升到了【99999】！\n\n【系統溢位！Error: 算力爆表！達成歷史最高成就：地鼠終結者！】\n\n在全場死一般的寂靜中，打地鼠機的投幣口突然「噗」地一聲噴出了一大股濃白的水蒸氣，隨後整台機器的指示燈徹底熄滅，當場燒毀當機！\n\n「我的天啊啊啊啊——！」\n\n短暫的沉寂過後，整個嘉年華展廳爆發出了足以掀翻鋼構屋頂的海嘯般歡呼！\n\n「高老師萬歲！高老師是神！！」老巫興奮得抱著旁邊的柱子瘋狂尖叫，阿釁和尪伝恺更是激動地把自己的帽子拋向了半空！\n\n攤主噗通一聲跪倒在操作台前，滿頭冷汗地擦著額頭，顫抖著雙手將那隻一點五公尺高的巨大黃金熊從展台上搬了下來，恭恭敬敬地遞到了高老師面前。\n\n「大……大師！您收下！求求您別再碰我的機器了，這台機器全台灣只有三台啊！」\n\n高老師沒有接熊，而是伸手指了指身後眼冒綠光、口水橫流的老巫：「請將此物交付予巫茞輆同學。依據本機運算，抱持此質量之毛絨物體，可有效將其體育課分心機率降低 38.6%。」\n\n「哇哈哈哈哈！我的黃金熊！！」老巫一頭撲進了巨大金熊那溫暖蓬鬆的肚子裡，幸福得差點昏厥過去。\n\n然而，這場屬於六年一班的傳奇屠榜風暴，才剛剛揭開序幕。\n\n「老師！隔壁量子光槍射擊館的第一名大獎是整套高精密機械暴龍！」尪伝恺指著旁邊的射擊場大喊。\n\n「還有那邊的深空抓娃娃機！裡面有林芸芸最想要的正版雷射貓公仔！」晴晴也跟著興奮地指路。\n\n高老師扶了扶黑框眼鏡，目光平靜地掠過大廳內一整排閃爍著頂級獎品的機台。\n\n「檢索到全班二十六名同學之願望清單。」高老師淡淡開口，「根據《六年一班畢業旅行激勵機制》，本機將於三十分鐘內，為全體同仁達成全獎品覆蓋。」\n\n在接下來的半小時裡，整個星際嘉年華大廳迎來了它建館十年來最黑暗、也最不可思議的一天——\n\n在量子光槍射擊館，高老師單手握槍，在開啟全息移動靶最高風速干擾模式下，以 0.02 秒的間隔連續扣動扳機，五十發光束無一例外全部正中十點零一環紅心，精準度高達 100%，打破了由陸軍特種部隊教官保持的館藏紀錄！\n\n在極限深空抓娃娃機前，高老師雙眼雷射投射出微米級三維重力模型，精確計算出機械爪的下落擺動週期與絨毛摩擦係數，每一次下爪都精準卡在娃娃的重心關節點上，連續下爪二十三次，爪爪不落空，抓到娃娃機的內部升降馬達都因過度疲勞而罷工！\n\n一隻、兩隻、五隻、十隻、二十隻……\n\n當高老師帶著全班走出嘉年華旗艦館時，整個遊樂園的大道上出現了一幕震驚全園的奇景——\n\n六年一班的二十六名學生，每個人懷裡都死死抱著一隻巨大的、平時只有在宣傳海報上才能看見的限量版頂級玩偶！\n\n老巫抱著黃金熊，晴晴抱著雷射機械貓，阿釁抱著一隻足有兩公尺長、能纏在身上的星際神龍，就連溜溜的脖子上都掛著一隻微型的太空小松鼠！\n\n全班二十六個人走在陽光灑落的中央大道上，浩浩蕩蕩，引得沿途成百上千名遊客駐足圍觀、瘋狂拍照，驚嘆聲此起彼落！\n\n「看啊！那是哪個學校的班級？居然把嘉年華的特等獎全包圓了！」\n\n「太扯了吧！那隻黃金熊我在這玩了三年都沒見人拿走過！」\n\n阿釁抱著星際神龍走在高老師身旁，感覺自己整個人都在發光：「高老師，你剛才真的是太帥了！簡直就是遊樂園裡的機械之神！」\n\n高老師依然筆直前行，手裡提著那只銀白色手提箱，鏡片邊緣掠過一絲淡淡的文字：「更正：本機代號為 GS-X01，職稱為實習導師，並非宗教神祇。但鑑於全班情緒指標已達到上限峰值，本機將此項讚美納入正面教學回饋日誌。」\n\n大家站在樂園中央廣場的巨大機械噴泉前，導遊阿姨激動地舉起相機，全班二十六名學生高高舉起懷裡的巨型玩偶，簇擁在神情冷肅卻微微牽動嘴角的高老師身旁：\n\n「一、二、三——六年一班，最強出擊！」\n\n「咔嚓！」\n\n快門按下，一張定格了二十六張純真笑臉、二十六隻巨型玩偶與一位偉大機械導師的彩色照片，在陽光下完美出爐。\n\n然而，就在這片歡騰達到頂點的一瞬間——\n\n原本晴朗無雲的碧藍天空中，突然無預兆地吹過了一陣刺骨的陰冷山風。\n\n趴在阿釁肩頭的溜溜，兩隻三角形的小耳朵猛地警惕地豎起，電子眼底部的頻譜分析儀驟然捕捉到了一串強烈而紊亂的定向電磁脈衝！\n\n「咕嘰……！」溜溜發出了一聲極度不安的低鳴，小爪子死死抓緊了阿釁的衣領。\n\n高老師的腳步微微一頓，黑框眼鏡下的瞳孔瞬間切換至高空光譜掃描模式。\n\n只見正南方原本晴空萬里的山巔之上，一大片深沉如墨、翻滾著紫紅色電弧的巨大濃雲，正以驚人的速度朝著主題樂園上空鋪天蓋地般壓了過來！\n\n氣壓驟降，狂風呼嘯著捲起地面的彩色氣球，溫度在短短兩分鐘內斷崖式下跌了八度！\n\n而在樂園正中央，那座高達三十公尺、垂直九十度俯衝入地的鋼鐵巨獸——【天際量子過山車】，黑色的鋼鐵軌道在鉛灰色的天幕下顯得無比猙獰而森冷。\n\n「高老師！天快下雨了，過山車馬上就要因天候關閉了！」尪伝恺焦急地大喊，「我們排最後一班車好不好？就坐一次！」\n\n「對啊高老師！來都來了，不坐全台灣最刺激的過山車，畢業旅行就白來了！」全班同學紛紛投來期待無比的懇求目光。\n\n高老師看著眼前這群興奮的孩子，處理器中正在極速計算著天氣雷達的風速數據，原本應該亮起「惡劣氣候禁止搭乘」的紅色阻斷條，卻在孩子們渴望的眼神下，被底層的人性化演算法奇蹟般地延遲了五分鐘。\n\n「本機評估：距離強降雨前鋒抵達尚餘十二分鐘。」高老師收起終端，沉穩地下達指令，「允許搭乘。全員依序登上第一編組車廂，本機將隨車執行全程安全伴隨。」\n\n「耶——！」二十六名學生歡呼著將玩偶暫存在寄存處，爭先恐後地朝著過山車高聳的發車月台衝去。\n\n而在同一秒鐘，樂園後方封閉的供電總變電所陰影下——\n\n戴著作戰頭盔的李博士冷笑著拔出了變電箱上的主接地線，將一枚黑色的電磁定時短路器狠狠插進了高壓輸電軌中！\n\n「引導他們上去吧……」李博士看著手腕終端上即將重合的氣象暴風雨紅圈與過山車坐標，眼底閃爍著瘋狂的死光。\n\n「三十公尺高空，強對流暴風雨，加上全園大斷電……」\n\n「GS-X01，我看你這次要怎麼救這二十六條命！」\n","rawContentEn":"# Chapter 18: Machine Deity at the Amusement Park\n\nAt eight-thirty the following morning, the colossal silver alloy gates of the Future Extremes High-Tech Theme Park swung slowly open amidst a magnificent symphonic fanfare.\n\nMorning sunlight bathed the transparent transit tubes and geodesic domes suspended in mid-air like scenes from a science fiction epic, transforming the entire park into an interstellar spaceport that had just touched down on Earth.\n\n\"CHARGE—!\"\n\nWearing matching navy-blue school windbreakers and bearing the \"Emergency Anti-Flattening Kits\" distributed by Teacher Gao the previous day flush against their chests, the twenty-six students of Class 6-1 surged through the turnstiles like twenty-six joyful cannonballs.\n\nTeacher Gao Zhixian strode in the center of the formation with the rigid, towering poise of a pine tree; his dark-rimmed glasses refracted a calm, brilliant sheen in the dawn light, holding a high-precision 3D topological park map tablet while maintaining millisecond-precise strides.\n\n\"Pursuant to this unit's 《Theme Park Optimal Transit Topological Algorithm》,\" Teacher Gao's synthesized voice carried evenly across the morning breeze, \"between 09:00 and 11:00, pedestrian density within the central 'Interstellar Cyber Carnival Pavilion' stands at a mere 18.4% of peak capacity. Prioritizing exploration of this zone will reduce mean attraction queuing latency by 74.2%.\"\n\n\"AWESOME! The arcade! The arcade!\" Old Wu leaped in place with sheer exuberance, the soft padding of his tummy jiggling like jelly.\n\nPassing through a glass skyway shimmering with neon hues, a gargantuan indoor cyber carnival pavilion spanning the footprint of three full football fields opened up before their eyes.\n\nThe cavernous hall was a blaze of dazzling lights, where hundreds of cutting-edge holographic arcade cabinets, haptic light-gun ranges, dual taiko drums, and claw machines hummed with alluring electronic soundscapes.\n\nAnd dead-center upon the Grand Prize exhibition dais of the pavilion stood a monolithic plushie standing a full 1.5 meters tall, swathed in silky, golden-dusted fleece—the \"Interstellar Limited Edition Ultra-Giant Space Golden Bear\"!\n\n\"Sweet mother of dumplings...\" Old Wu's sneakers froze to the floor as if pinned by industrial electromagnets, drool nearly escaping the corner of his lips. \"The Golden Bear! That's the exact same bear I was hugging in my dreams last night!\"\n\nA crowd of dejected, defeated tourists milled around the booth, while a carnival vendor wearing a black cowboy hat and chewing on a toothpick tossed game tokens casually in his palm with a smug grin.\n\n\"Step right up, step right up, don't miss your chance of a lifetime!\" the vendor hollered at the top of his lungs. \"The toughest challenge in the entire park, precision-engineered with German craftsmanship—the 'Faster-Than-Light Reactionary Whack-a-Mole Terminator'! Strike all ninety-nine randomly springing mechanical moles in succession without missing a single one, and this twelve-thousand-dollar limited-edition Golden Bear is yours to take home!\"\n\n\"Miss even a single mole, or register an impact latency exceeding 0.1 seconds in thirty seconds, and you're instantly disqualified!\"\n\n\"Let me at it!\" Old Wu volunteered eagerly, digging out his pocket money to purchase ten tokens and stepping onto the platform with chest puffed out.\n\n\"BEEP—Three-second countdown, challenge commence!\"\n\nThe alloy apertures of the cabinet shrieked with piercing chimes as four mechanical moles erupted simultaneously along erratic, curved trajectories!\n\n\"HAAA-YAH!\" Old Wu hoisted the hefty foam-cushioned rubber mallet, slamming it down with all the muscle in his body!\n\n\"WHACK!\" The first mole was struck dead-on.\n\nYet in the very next millisecond, three other apertures ejected decoy moles with deceptive counter-rotational spins, rocketing upward with the velocity of discharged bullets!\n\nCaught in utter disarray, Old Wu flailed the mallet in a whirlwind of black shadows until—*THUD!*—the mallet bounced off the metal bezel, nearly sending him tumbling face-first into the holes from overextended momentum.\n\n【Time Expired! Accuracy: 4/99. Challenge Failed! Thank you for playing!】 The machine spat out a patronizing digital chuckle.\n\n\"How on earth can they be that fast?! Did those moles have rocket boosters strapped to their backs?!\" Old Wu slumped onto the floor, staring with tearful longing at the glorious, unreachable Golden Bear.\n\nWang Zhuankai and A-Xin took turns stepping up to challenge the machine, but the best run topped out at the eleventh mole before the erratic, non-linear springing patterns blurred their vision, forcing them to concede defeat.\n\nThe vendor chortled with hands on his hips, wearing an insufferable smirk: \"Give it up, kids! The springs in this baby are driven by aerospace micro-motors running chaotic anti-cheat algorithms. Even a national table tennis champion only managed forty moles here; human synaptic reaction speed simply cannot breach that threshold!\"\n\nJust as all twenty-six pupils were hanging their heads in collective disappointment, a white-gloved hand with slender, steel-like fingers rested gently atop the icy start button of the control console.\n\n\"You asserted moments ago... that the spring actuation of this mechanism is driven by aerospace micro-motors?\"\n\nTeacher Gao Zhixian had materialized before the cabinet, his black-rimmed lenses scanning the internal circuit topology and spring fatigue coefficients at a rate of one thousand hertz.\n\n\"That's right, pal. What, you fancy a go yourself, Teacher?\" The vendor arched an eyebrow, his face dripping with condescension. \"Same rules apply to grown-ups: miss one in thirty seconds and you're out!\"\n\nTeacher Gao remained as calm as an iceberg, retrieving a metal token from his breast pocket with practiced grace and feeding it into the slot.\n\n\"Correcting your erroneous assertion,\" Teacher Gao responded deadpan, his synthesized voice devoid of inflection. \"Human synaptic transmission velocity is indeed constrained by the physiological threshold of one hundred and twenty meters per second. However... this unit is not human.\"\n\n\"Huh? Say what?\" The vendor blinked in confusion.\n\nTeacher Gao did not deign to reply; instead, he reached out with both hands, simultaneously gripping the twin rubber mallets resting on either side of the console!\n\n\"Akimbo dual-wielding mode?!\" A-Xin sucked in a sharp breath of disbelief.\n\n\"Guji!\" Liu-Liu bounded up onto the neon signage above the machine, his sapphire optical sensors locked squarely onto the score display.\n\n【Challenge Commenced! Countdown: Thirty Seconds!】\n\nA shrill siren sounded as all nine metallic apertures flared with blinding crimson strobes!\n\nWHOOSH! WHOOSH! WHOOSH! WHOOSH!\n\nWave one: four mechanical moles erupted from their burrows with near-transonic acceleration!\n\nTeacher Gao's arms moved.\n\nIt was a motion entirely beyond the resolving power of the human retina—to the twenty-six students and dozens of onlookers, Teacher Gao's arms dissolved into a seamless, kaleidoscopic blur of cobalt light!\n\n\"CRACK! CRACK! CRACK! CRACK!\"\n\nFour crushing impacts overlapped into a single, earth-shattering boom within the same microsecond! The four moles had barely poked their noses out before twin mallets hammered them back into the abyss at a perfectly perpendicular trajectory!\n\n【Hits: 10... 20... 30...】 The red LED counter raced upward like a runaway stopwatch!\n\nThe central motherboard of the cabinet seemed enraged by this non-biological input rate; its internal cooling fans screamed at maximum rpm as it forced the software into anti-cheat overdrive frenzy!\n\nMoles rained out of all nine apertures in chaotic, non-repeating barrages, the scent of burning electrical coils wafting through the vents!\n\nYet standing before the console, Teacher Gao did not sway by so much as a single millimeter.\n\nBehind his lenses, twin blazing concentric rings of cobalt blue burned at full processing capacity, cascades of textual telemetry pouring through his HUD:\n\n【Target Vector Acquisition: Complete.】\n\n【Air Resistance Compensation: 0.0012 Newtons.】\n\n【Alternating Mallet Cadence: 48 strikes per second.】\n\n\"THUD-THUD-THUD-THUD-THUD-THUD-THUD—!\"\n\nThat was no longer a game of whack-a-mole; it was an absolute, micron-precision carpet bombing! The twin mallets wove an impenetrable canopy of kinetic force, decimating every emerging component the exact instant it broke the surface!\n\nThe vendor's jaw unhinged into an 'O' shape, the toothpick slipping from his lips and clicking onto the floor, his eyeballs nearly popping from their sockets!\n\n\"Wh-what number is he on?!\" Old Wu shook A-Xin's sleeve, bellowing in manic euphoria.\n\n\"Eighty! Ninety! Ninety-five... NINETY-NINE!!\" the entire class roared in synchronized unison!\n\nIn the final second, as the ninety-ninth gold-plated boss mole breached the surface, Teacher Gao's right wrist whipped horizontally at an absolute ninety-degree angle—\n\n\"KABOOM!\"\n\nThe entire cabinet shuddered violently as the ninety-ninth mole was crushed flush into the steel plating!\n\nAnd the digital score display, upon hitting 【99】, did not stop; accompanied by a shower of sparking shorts, it rolled over frantically into 【99999】!\n\n【System Overflow! Error: Processing Capacity Exceeded! Historic Apex Unlocked: Mole Terminator!】\n\nIn the dead silence that gripped the pavilion, the coin return chute belched a thick plume of white steam, before all display lamps extinguished simultaneously as the circuitry fried completely!\n\n\"OH MY SWEET GOSH—!\"\n\nAfter an agonizing beat of stunned silence, the entire pavilion erupted into a deafening tidal wave of cheers that nearly lifted the steel rafters!\n\n\"LONG LIVE TEACHER GAO! TEACHER GAO IS A GOD!!\" Old Wu wrapped his arms around a structural pillar, screaming with joyous abandon, while A-Xin and Wang Zhuankai hurled their caps into the rafters!\n\nThe vendor dropped to his knees before the charred console, cold sweat pouring down his face as he trembling hands lifted the 1.5-meter Golden Bear from the dais, presenting it reverently to Teacher Gao.\n\n\"M-Master! It's yours! Just please don't touch any more of my machines—there are only three of these units in all of Taiwan!\"\n\nTeacher Gao did not take the bear; instead, he pointed toward Old Wu, whose eyes were glowing emerald with drool cascading from his mouth: \"Transfer this item to student Wu Chenkai. Pursuant to this unit's calculations, holding plush material of this mass will reduce his probability of distraction in gym class by 38.6%.\"\n\n\"BWAHAHAHA! MY GOLDEN BEAR!!\" Old Wu plunged face-first into the fluffy belly of the golden beast, nearly fainting from culinary and plush bliss.\n\nYet this legendary conquest was only the opening movement of Class 6-1's arcade sweep.\n\n\"Teacher! The top prize at the Quantum Light-Gun Range next door is a full-scale motorized Cyber T-Rex!\" Wang Zhuankai yelled, pointing toward the shooting gallery.\n\n\"And the Deep Space Claw Machine over there! It has the official Laser Kitty Lin Yunyun has wanted forever!\" Qingqing pointed with sparkling eyes.\n\nTeacher Gao adjusted his glasses, his calm gaze sweeping across the entire avenue of glowing grand-prize showcases.\n\n\"Class 6-1 wish-list query compiled,\" Teacher Gao stated placidly. \"Pursuant to 《Class 6-1 Graduation Trip Incentive Protocol》, this unit shall achieve total prize coverage for all comrades within thirty minutes.\"\n\nOver the next half-hour, the Cyber Carnival Pavilion endured the darkest, most miraculous onslaught in its decade of operation—\n\nAt the Quantum Light-Gun Range, Teacher Gao fired one-handed on maximum gale-force crosswind simulation, pulling the trigger every 0.02 seconds to drill all fifty laser bolts dead-center into the 10.01 bullseye, posting a 100% perfect score that pulverized the record set by an army special forces instructor!\n\nBefore the Deep Space Claw Machine, Teacher Gao's optical lasers mapped a 3D gravity matrix, computing claw swing harmonics and plush fabric friction; with twenty-three consecutive drops, the claw snagged every prize without a single miss, operating until the gantry winch motor burned out from sheer fatigue!\n\nOne plushie, two, five, ten, twenty...\n\nWhen Teacher Gao led the class out of the flagship pavilion, an awe-inspiring spectacle paraded onto the sunlit concourse—\n\nAll twenty-six students of Class 6-1 were clutching colossal, limited-edition plush toys previously seen only on promotional posters!\n\nOld Wu hugged the Golden Bear, Qingqing carried the Cyber Kitty, A-Xin was wrapped in a two-meter celestial dragon, and even Liu-Liu wore a miniature space-squirrel plushie around his neck!\n\nTwenty-six children paraded down the central concourse in triumphant glory, prompting hundreds of onlookers to halt, snap photos, and gasp in utter disbelief!\n\n\"Look at that! Which school is that class from? They cleaned out every grand prize in the carnival!\"\n\n\"That's insane! That golden bear has sat in that booth for three years without anyone winning it!\"\n\nA-Xin walked beside Teacher Gao holding the celestial dragon, feeling as though he were walking on air: \"Teacher Gao, you were incredible back there! You truly are the Machine Deity of the Theme Park!\"\n\nTeacher Gao marched forward with his silver briefcase in hand, a faint line of code scrolling across his lenses: \"Correction: This unit's designation is GS-X01, occupational title is Trainee Homeroom Teacher, not a theological deity. However, as class emotional indices have reached peak saturation, this praise is logged into the positive pedagogical feedback registry.\"\n\nGathering before the colossal mechanical fountain in the central plaza, the tour guide excitedly hoisted her camera as twenty-six students hoisted their giant plushies around their stoic yet softly smiling teacher:\n\n\"One, two, three—Class 6-1, legendary strike!\"\n\n\"CLICK!\"\n\nThe shutter snapped, capturing twenty-six radiant youthful smiles, twenty-six gargantuan plushies, and one extraordinary mechanical teacher in a photograph drenched in golden sunlight.\n\nYet at the exact summit of their jubilation—\n\nAcross the cloudless azure sky, an unnatural, bone-chilling gust of mountain wind swept over the park.\n\nPerched on A-Xin's shoulder, Liu-Liu's triangular ears twitched alertly, his internal RF spectrum analyzer detecting a sharp, turbulent burst of directional electromagnetic pulses!\n\n\"Guji...!\" Liu-Liu emitted a low, distressed whimper, his tiny paws clutching A-Xin's collar tightly.\n\nTeacher Gao's strides halted momentarily, his optical sensors shifting into high-altitude atmospheric scanning mode.\n\nOver the southern peaks where blue skies had reigned moments before, a colossal bank of ink-black storm clouds crackling with violet lightning was barreling toward the park with terrifying speed!\n\nBarometric pressure plummeted; howling winds sent loose balloons spiraling into the sky as the ambient temperature plunged eight degrees in under two minutes!\n\nAnd dead-center in the park, the thirty-meter-tall steel leviathan plunging vertically at ninety degrees—the 【Sky Quantum Coaster】—stood menacing and stark against the bruised lead-gray heavens.\n\n\"Teacher Gao! The rain is coming, and the coaster will close for weather soon!\" Wang Zhuankai pleaded frantically. \"Can we catch the very last train? Just once!\"\n\n\"Yes, Teacher Gao! We came all this way; skipping the craziest coaster in Taiwan means our graduation trip isn't complete!\" All twenty-six students turned pleading, hopeful eyes upon him.\n\nLooking at the eager faces of his pupils, Teacher Gao's processor analyzed the incoming Doppler radar wind vectors; the red abort flag that should have prohibited boarding in severe weather was miraculously delayed by five minutes under the warmth of his emerging human algorithms.\n\n\"This unit calculates: twelve minutes remain before the primary squall line hits,\" Teacher Gao stowed his terminal, issuing a calm directive. \"Boarding permitted. All units embark onto Train Consist Number One in orderly sequence; this unit shall accompany you aboard to maintain operational security.\"\n\n\"HOORAY—!\" Twenty-six students cheered as they stowed their plushies in the lockers, racing toward the towering launch platform of the coaster.\n\nAnd in that very same second, deep in the shadows of the park's isolated main electrical sub-station—\n\nWearing a tactical helmet, Dr. Li sneered as he disconnected the emergency earth ground cables, jamming a black electromagnetic timed shorting unit straight into the primary busbars!\n\n\"Board the train, little lambs...\" Dr. Li murmured, watching the converging radar storm fronts and the coaster telemetry on his wrist display with murderous glee.\n\n\"A thirty-meter precipice, severe convective squalls, and a total park-wide blackout...\"\n\n\"Let us see how you save twenty-six lives this time, GS-X01!\"\n"},{"id":3,"rawContent":"# 第 19 章：暴風雨中的雲霄飛車\n\n金屬鏈條帶動齒輪發出沉重而規律的「喀啦、喀啦」聲，將「天際量子過山車」的十二節流線型車廂，沿著傾斜四十五度的鋼骨軌道緩緩拉向雲霄。\n\n坐在第二排的老巫死死抱著那隻剛贏來的巨大星際金甲熊，一雙粗眉毛緊張得快要在額頭中央打結：「阿、阿釁……我怎麼覺得這輛過山車爬得比剛才慢了一半？還有，那隻熊塞在安全壓桿底下，我的肚子快要被壓出油來了！」\n\n「老巫，你那是午餐吃了三份起司焗烤漢堡外加兩袋爆米花的心理作用！」坐在第一排的阿釁回過頭嘲笑他，但風灌進嘴巴裡，吹得他的頭髮像雜草般亂舞，「而且你都升上小學六年級了，抱著一隻一米半的毛絨熊坐雲霄飛車，全遊樂園都在看你！」\n\n「誰管他們看！金甲熊是我的護身符，是高老師用每秒四十八下的神之雙槌幫我打下來的！」老巫扯著嗓子反駁，把熊腦袋抱得更緊。\n\n坐在阿釁身旁的高峙舷老師依舊穿著那一套筆挺如新、彷彿隨時要出席國際學術研討會的黑色西裝，鼻樑上的黑框眼鏡被烈風吹得紋絲不動。\n\n他的雙手自然平放在胸前的安全防護壓桿上，坐姿端正得像是正在參加教育部特優教師考評，甚至連領帶的夾角都維持在精準的四十五度。\n\n「根據本園區遊樂設施動力學規格手冊，」高老師語調平靜地在狂風中開口，聲音透過聲帶濾波器直接傳遞到周圍每位學生的耳膜，「天際量子過山車之上升鏈條運行速率為每秒一點六二公尺，誤差值小於百分之零點零三。當前爬升速度並未減緩，巫茞輆同學，你的焦慮感源於前庭系統受重力加速度與腹腔過量碳水化合物共同刺激之生理反射。」\n\n「聽到了吧，老巫！老師說你純粹是吃太飽撐著！」阿釁哈哈大笑，興奮地舉起雙手迎風歡呼。\n\n然而，坐在第三排的班長綝耘晴卻沒有笑。她側著頭，緊緊抓著安全壓桿，眉頭緊蹙地望向右側下方的機械維修通道。\n\n「阿釁，不對勁。」晴晴低聲提醒，右手下意識地按了按掛在腰間的小工具袋，「剛剛在排隊區時，溜溜的警報尾巴一直指著樂園的西北角。那是園區的特高壓總變電站方向。」\n\n阿釁胸前的黃銅齒輪項鍊隱隱傳來一陣奇異的微熱，他收斂了笑容，順著晴晴的視線往下望去。\n\n此時整列過山車已經爬升到了二十五公尺的高空，整個「未來極限主題樂園」的全景盡收眼底。\n\n然而，原本蔚藍明媚的晴空不知何時已被一層厚重如墨汁般的鉛灰色暴風雨積雨雲徹底吞噬。\n\n海面方向捲起的狂暴對流風像刀片般撕扯著遊樂園五彩繽紛的旗幟，空氣中的濕度以幾何級數飆升，甚至能聞到高空臭氧與泥土混合的暴烈腥味。\n\n「警告：大氣壓強驟降零點零八巴，相對濕度上升至百分之九十四點七。」高老師鏡片內側瞬間刷過一行行冷光數據，「對流風速突破每小時五十八公里，即將達到中央氣象局定義之強烈陣風標準。」\n\n「老師！那邊的天空怎麼全黑了？像是有大怪獸要把遊樂園吃掉一樣！」坐在後排的膽小女生林芸芸帶著哭腔喊了起來。\n\n「林芸芸同學請勿恐慌，」高老師轉過頭，聲音依舊保持著程式預設的平靜與安撫音頻，「天空不會進食，大氣現象中亦不存在具有消化器官之爬行類巨獸。此乃熱帶海洋性氣團引發之局地強對流雷暴，預計降水將於六分鐘後抵達。」\n\n「可是老師……」尪伝恺坐在第五排，想要開口講個笑話緩解氣氛，但他的牙齒卻在冷風中不受控制地「咯咯」打顫，「雲霄飛車……雲霄飛車怎麼停在半空中了？！」\n\n他的話音未落，整座鋼骨架構突然發出一聲極其沉悶的巨震！\n\n「喀啦——轟！」\n\n原本平穩拉動列車的金屬牽引鏈條驟然僵死，過山車前端的車廂猛烈向前一衝，隨後重重頓住！\n\n二十六名六年一班的學生被安全壓桿死死勒在座位上，全場爆發出一陣尖銳至極的驚恐尖叫！\n\n「怎麼回事？！怎麼不動了？！」老巫嚇得把整張胖臉全埋進了金甲熊的肚子裡。\n\n阿釁猛然抬頭，赫然發現他們所在的車廂正懸停在過山車整座軌道的最高頂峰——離地三十公尺的垂直俯衝過渡段！\n\n從第一排往下看，腳下是一條筆直向下、幾乎呈八十度垂直角度傾斜的冰冷鋼鐵軌道，直直通往地面那張張驚慌仰望的渺小面孔。\n\n只要安全卡榫鬆開一公分，整列載著二十六名孩子與一名導師的過山車，就會以超越自由落體的極速垂直砸向大地！\n\n「嘩啦啦啦——！」\n\n還沒等大家喘過氣來，天空中積壓已久的暴雨如同一桶桶冰水，劈頭蓋臉地從三十公尺的高空瘋狂傾瀉而下！\n\n豆大的雨點打在金屬軌道與車體上，發出宛如機關槍掃射般的恐怖爆響，狂風在耳邊發出野獸般的淒厲咆哮。\n\n「所有同學保持坐姿，請勿解開任何防護卡榫，嚴禁身體探出車體！」高老師的聲音在暴風雨中驟然提高，如同一記定海神針般的重金屬鐘鳴，硬生生壓過了雷雨的咆哮。\n\n「老師！是跳電了嗎？！軌道兩邊的霓虹燈全滅了！」阿釁抹了一把臉上的雨水，扯著喉嚨大喊。\n\n晴晴抹開眼前的濕髮，盯著軌道側面的緊急磁滯剎車板：「不只是跳電！如果是普通停電，備用柴油發電機在三秒內就會自動接駁啟動緊急回降系統！但是現在整條軌道所有的感應器紅燈全都黑了！」\n\n與此同時，在地面垂直高度三十公尺之下的總變電站外圍，濃厚的雨幕之中，李博士正站在一輛漆黑的特勤指揮車旁，手裡握著一只高倍率紅外線熱成像望遠鏡。\n\n他的嘴角勾起一抹極其殘酷而胸有成竹的冷笑。\n\n「博士，高能定向電磁脈衝裝置引爆成功，變電站主變壓器與備用磁力繼電器全數燒毀。」旁邊一名身穿防靜電絕緣雨衣的特勤工程師低頭看著平板報告，「整座園區動力網絡癱瘓，過山車的電腦主控板已經徹底變成了廢鐵。」\n\n「非常好。」李博士放下望遠鏡，雨水順著他的鏡片滑落，眼神冰冷如霜，「三十公尺高空、八十度傾斜角、傾盆暴雨外加時速七十公里的強烈側向剪切風。在這種極限環境下，過山車的機械重力鎖定爪最多只能支撐十分鐘就會發生金屬疲勞斷裂。」\n\n「十二名特勤人員已全部就位，隨時準備在下方架設高頻抑制作戰網。」工程師回報。\n\n「GS-X01，你體內被寫入的那套無聊的人道保護協議，絕不可能允許二十六名人類幼童摔得粉身碎骨。」李博士喃喃自語，眼中閃爍著獵人盯上獵物的狂熱光芒，「想救他們，你就必須在所有人和攝影機面前，親手解除全部功率限制器！只要你一解鎖，你那脆弱的備用能源核心就會在五分鐘內燒穿……」\n\n在三十公尺的高空軌道上，形勢正以恐怖的速度向深淵墜落。\n\n「轟隆——！」一記慘白的閃電劃破漆黑的雨幕，將整座鋼架映照得一片慘白。\n\n狂風像重錘一樣猛烈搖晃著懸空的主車廂，金屬軌道與輪組之間發出令人牙酸的「吱呀、吱呀」摩擦悲鳴。\n\n「嗚哇哇……媽媽！我想回家！」坐在後排的幾個女生終於忍不住崩潰大哭起來。\n\n「大家不要哭！把安全帶拉緊！」阿釁回過頭，雙手死死扣著壓桿大喊，「我們有高老師在！高老師連粉筆灰都能徒手接住，絕對有辦法的！」\n\n「沒錯！老子、老子連金甲熊都拿到了，絕對不會死在這裡的！」老巫渾身濕透，嘴唇發紫，卻依然硬挺著嗓門給後面的同學打氣。\n\n然而，坐在阿釁身邊的高老師，眼鏡鏡片上卻瘋狂滾動著只有晴晴和阿釁能看懂的血紅色警報文字。\n\n【警告：環境磁場偵測到高階電磁脈衝（EMP）殘留波形。】\n\n【警報：過山車第 01 號主機械自鎖棘輪承受側向剪力超載 142%，金屬晶格出現微觀裂紋！】\n\n【預測模型：機械卡榫將於一百八十秒內徹底崩解，列車將失去所有制動力進行無阻尼垂直墜落！】\n\n晴晴敏銳地注意到了高老師西裝領口下隱隱滲出的藍色光芒，她臉色煞白：「老師……是不是卡榫快撐不住了？！」\n\n高老師沒有直接回答，他的右手緩緩從安全壓桿上抬起，食指與中指併攏，輕輕點在自己胸口心臟部位的第三顆黃銅紐扣上。\n\n「啪嗒」一聲微不可聞的機械脆響，他的西裝內側彈出了一排指甲蓋大小的隱藏式蜂巢散熱口。\n\n「阿釁同學，綝耘晴同學。」高老師的聲音無比平穩，甚至比平常在講台上講授牛頓第三運動定律時更加冰冷而專注。\n\n「老師，你在做什麼？！」阿釁的心臟猛地縮緊，他聞到了一股熟悉的焦糊味——那是電路板在高負荷運轉時散發出的絕緣漆氣味。\n\n「本機正在執行多維物理演算。」高老師平靜地注視著前方筆直向下的深淵，「地面救援雲梯之最大作業極限高度為二十二公尺，在當前狂風陣列下無法安全展開；園區備用電源已遭永久性硬體破壞，修復時間超過四十分鐘。」\n\n「那……那我們怎麼辦？！」林芸芸隔著雨幕哭著問。\n\n「結論唯一：必須在一百八十秒內，由外力手動鎖定過山車前端導向輪，並以反向牽引力抵消整列車體之重力分量，將十二節車廂沿軌道倒退推回後方水平停靠緩衝平台。」高老師一字一句地說道。\n\n晴晴的瞳孔劇烈收縮：「倒退推回去？！這輛過山車加上二十六名學生的重量，總重超過六點五噸！而且軌道傾斜了八十度！普通起重機根本不可能在濕滑的鋼軌上做到這一點！」\n\n「人類之骨骼與肌肉組織無法達成，」高老師側過臉，雨水從他的金屬下頜輪廓飛濺而下，黑框眼鏡下的瞳孔中，原本溫和的藍色光芒驟然轉變為極其深邃而凌厲的赤金色光束，「但 GS-X01 型全能仿生體可以。」\n\n就在這時，地面突然傳來一陣破音的怒吼聲。\n\n「上面的人聽著！六年一班的兔崽子們！全都不准動！誰敢把安全帶解開，回學校我記他十支大過！！」\n\n那是學務主任周嚴的聲音！\n\n透過傾盆暴雨向下看去，只見向來一絲不苟、頭髮梳得油亮的周主任，此刻全身早已被暴雨淋得像一隻落水鳥。\n\n他手裡拿著一把不知從哪裡奪來的紅色大喇叭，皮鞋上沾滿泥濘，正不顧園區保安的阻攔，發瘋般地衝到過山車塔架的最底端，仰著脖子對著三十公尺的高空咆哮！\n\n在他身旁，園區的工程主管滿頭大汗地抱著對講機，臉色慘白如紙：「周主任！您冷靜一點！主變壓器被雷擊引發電磁爆發燒了，雲梯車升不上去啊！我們已經報警叫消防隊了！」\n\n「等消防隊來，車廂早就掉下來了！」周嚴一把揪住主管的衣領，眼鏡差點甩飛出去，那張平日裡讓全校學生聞風喪膽的「黑面判官」臉龐，此刻因極度的憤怒與擔憂而扭曲得通紅，「我警告你！上面是我鹿陽國小的學生，還有我們學校的模範實習老師！要是他們少了一根汗毛，我周嚴傾家蕩產也要把你們這家破樂園告到破產！！」\n\n阿釁和老巫遠遠看著地面上那個揮舞著喇叭、咆哮護短的黑面主任，眼眶頓時一熱。\n\n「連周主任都衝過來了……」老巫抽了抽鼻子，眼淚和雨水混在一起流進嘴裡。\n\n「周主任……真男人！」阿釁咬著牙喊道。\n\n然而，高空中的危機卻沒有給任何人感動的時間。\n\n「嘎吱——崩！」\n\n一聲震耳欲聾的金屬撕裂聲猛然炸響！\n\n過山車最前端的右側重力卡榫，在狂風與六點五噸自重的雙重拉扯下，赫然崩斷了一道兩公分寬的裂口，幾枚扭曲的鋼質鉚釘「嗖」地一聲彈飛進狂暴的夜空！\n\n整個車體猛地向下劇烈滑墜了整整三十公分！\n\n「啊啊啊啊——！！」全班二十六名學生的尖叫聲幾乎要刺破耳膜。\n\n整列車廂劇烈晃動，冰冷的雨水灌入每一個人的衣領，所有孩子的臉色都在瞬間褪成了死灰色。\n\n「時間剩餘：五十八秒。」高老師的聲音響起，那聲音中沒有一絲一毫的猶豫，更沒有任何人類在面對生死時的遲疑。\n\n「晴晴，把妳工具袋裡的防靜電絕緣剪刀拿出來。」高老師轉過頭，冷靜地指令道。\n\n「老、老師……要做什麼？！」晴晴顫抖著從防水袋裡摸出絕緣剪刀。\n\n「剪斷我西裝後背左側第三條縫線。」高老師背過身，露出濕透的西裝後背，「那裡隱藏著出廠人道限制解鎖手動閥。本機的無線傳輸模組已被 EMP 損毀，無法進行遠端指令解鎖。」\n\n晴晴的手在劇烈發抖：「老師……如果剪斷那個，解開限制器……你體內的備用電池和齒輪會……」\n\n「執行指令，綝耘晴同學。」高老師的語氣帶著不容置疑的絕對威嚴，「這是導師的職責。保護全班二十六名學生之生命安全，乃本機核心最高優先順序，凌駕於一切硬體存續演算法之上。」\n\n阿釁伸出雙手，死死按住晴晴顫抖的手腕，眼中閃爍著決絕的光芒：「晴晴！相信高老師！動手！」\n\n晴晴一咬牙，冰冷的剪刀尖端狠狠刺入西裝布料，用力一鉸！\n\n「刺啦！」\n\n伴隨著布料撕裂的脆響，一截散發著螢光紅色的粗壯合金拉環從高老師的後背赫然彈出！\n\n高老師毫不猶豫地反手握住拉環，用盡全力向外一拔！\n\n「警告：【Project P.E.D.A.】人道安全協議已強行離線。」\n\n「解除百分之四十功率限制……」\n\n「解除百分之七十功率限制……」\n\n「全系統伺服馬達超頻運行中……」\n\n「解鎖——百分之百全功率！！」\n\n轟！\n\n狂暴的暴風雨中，高峙舷老師身上的黑色西裝被體內高壓氣流瞬間撐得筆直，胸口蜂巢散熱口中噴湧出如同白色巨龍般的滾燙蒸汽！\n\n那一雙隱藏在黑框眼鏡下的瞳孔，在這一剎那徹底化作了兩道洞穿夜幕與暴雨的奪目金紅烈焰！\n\n高老師單手按在安全壓桿上，輕輕一震，堅固的合金壓桿竟如同麵糰般被他單手推開。\n\n在全班二十六名學生呆滯震撼的注視下，高老師迎著三十公尺高空的狂暴風雨與萬丈深淵，一步跨出了車廂，穩穩踏在傾斜八十度的垂直鋼軌之上！\n\n暴風雨中最壯烈、最不可思議的極限救援，正式爆發！\n","rawContentEn":"# Chapter 19: The Roller Coaster in the Storm\n\nWith a heavy, rhythmic \"clank-clank, clank-clank,\" the metal chain drove the gears, slowly hauling the twelve streamlined cars of the \"Sky Quantum Coaster\" up the forty-five-degree steel track toward the clouds.\n\nSitting in the second row, Old Wu clutched his newly won giant Space Golden Bear with all his might, his bushy eyebrows knotting in the center of his forehead in sheer panic: \"A-A-Xin... why do I feel like this coaster is climbing half as fast as before? And with this bear wedged under the safety lap bar, my stomach feels like the grease is about to get squeezed right out!\"\n\n\"Old Wu, that's just psychological from eating three cheese-baked burgers and two bags of popcorn for lunch!\" Sitting in the front row, A-Xin turned around to jeer at him, though the wind rushed into his mouth, whipping his hair into a chaotic bird's nest. \"Besides, you're already in sixth grade! Riding a roller coaster hugging a one-and-a-half-meter teddy bear—the whole theme park is staring at you!\"\n\n\"Who cares if they look! This Golden Bear is my protective amulet, won by Teacher Gao using his divine double mallets at forty-eight strikes per second!\" Old Wu shouted back at the top of his lungs, hugging the bear's head even tighter.\n\nBeside A-Xin, Teacher Gao Zhixian remained clad in his immaculate, pitch-black suit, looking as though he were ready to attend an international academic symposium at any moment, his black-framed glasses holding steadfast against the howling gale without budging a millimeter.\n\nHis hands rested naturally and flat upon the safety lap bar across his chest, sitting as upright as if undergoing an evaluation for the Ministry of Education's Distinguished Teacher Award, even maintaining his tie's alignment at an exact forty-five-degree angle.\n\n\"According to the kinetic specifications manual of this park's amusement facilities,\" Teacher Gao spoke calmly into the fierce wind, his voice transmitted directly to the eardrums of every student nearby via his vocal acoustic filter, \"the ascent chain speed of the Sky Quantum Coaster operates at one point six two meters per second, with an error margin under zero point zero three percent. The current climbing speed has not diminished. Student Wu Chenkai, your sense of anxiety stems from a physiological vestibular reflex induced by gravitational acceleration combined with excessive abdominal carbohydrate load.\"\n\n\"Did you hear that, Old Wu! Teacher says you're purely bloated from stuffing your face!\" A-Xin burst into laughter, excitedly raising both arms to cheer against the wind.\n\nHowever, Class President Lin Yunqing, sitting in the third row, was not laughing. Tilting her head, she gripped the safety bar tightly and gazed with furrowed brows at the mechanical maintenance catwalk below to the right.\n\n\"A-Xin, something's wrong,\" Qingqing warned in a low voice, her right hand instinctively pressing against the small tool pouch strapped to her waist. \"Back in the queue line, Liu-Liu's alert tail kept pointing toward the northwest corner of the park. That's the direction of the park's ultra-high-voltage main substation.\"\n\nThe brass gear pendant on A-Xin's chest radiated a faint, peculiar warmth; wiping the grin from his face, he followed Qingqing's gaze downward.\n\nBy this time, the entire coaster had climbed to an altitude of twenty-five meters, offering a panoramic view of the entire \"Future Extremes Theme Park.\"\n\nYet the sunny, azure skies had been thoroughly swallowed at some point by a dense, ink-black layer of leaden cumulonimbus storm clouds.\n\nViolent convective gusts rolling in from the ocean shredded the park's colorful banners like razor blades; humidity surged geometrically, and one could even smell the sharp, ozone-tinged stench of high-altitude lightning mixed with soil.\n\n\"Warning: Atmospheric pressure has plummeted by zero point zero eight bar; relative humidity has risen to ninety-four point seven percent.\" Lines of luminous data scrolled across the inner surface of Teacher Gao's lenses. \"Convective wind velocity has exceeded fifty-eight kilometers per hour, approaching the threshold for gale-force gusts as defined by the Central Weather Bureau.\"\n\n\"Teacher! Why did the sky over there turn completely pitch black? It looks like a giant monster is about to swallow the theme park whole!\" Sitting in the rear rows, the timid Lin Yunyun cried out with a tearful tremor in her voice.\n\n\"Student Lin Yunyun, please do not panic,\" Teacher Gao turned his head, his voice maintaining its programmed calm and soothing frequency. \"The sky does not ingest nourishment, nor do reptilian mega-beasts possessing digestive tracts exist in atmospheric phenomena. This is merely a localized severe convective thunderstorm induced by a tropical maritime air mass. Precipitation is projected to arrive in six minutes.\"\n\n\"B-But Teacher...\" Wang Zhuankai sat in the fifth row, attempting to crack a joke to ease the tension, but his teeth chattered uncontrollably in the cold draft. \"The roller coaster... why did the roller coaster stop mid-air?!\"\n\nBefore his words fully settled, the entire steel superstructure groaned with a muffled, massive shudder!\n\n\"CLANK—BOOM!\"\n\nThe metal tow chain that had been steadily hauling the train suddenly seized up; the lead cars jolted violently forward, then came to a grinding, brutal halt!\n\nThe twenty-six students of Class 6-1 were slammed hard against their safety lap bars, and the entire train erupted into ear-splitting, terrified shrieks!\n\n\"What happened?! Why aren't we moving?!\" Scared out of his wits, Old Wu buried his entire round face deep into the golden bear's plush stomach.\n\nA-Xin jerked his head up, only to discover in horror that their cars were suspended at the absolute summit of the entire coaster track—the thirty-meter-high vertical plunge transition zone!\n\nLooking down from the front row, right beneath their dangling feet lay a frigid steel rail pointing straight down at a near-vertical eighty-degree angle, plunging directly toward the terrified, tiny faces looking up from the ground below.\n\nIf the safety latch slipped by even a single centimeter, the entire train carrying twenty-six children and their teacher would plummet toward the earth in a vertical drop faster than free fall!\n\n\"WHOOOOSH——!\"\n\nBefore anyone could catch their breath, the torrential deluge pent up in the heavens cascaded down like buckets of ice water, pouring relentlessly from thirty meters above!\n\nFat raindrops pelted the metal rails and car chassis, producing a terrifying racket akin to machine-gun fire, while fierce gale winds roared past their ears like ravenous beasts.\n\n\"All students remain seated! Do not attempt to unbuckle any safety latches, and under no circumstances lean outside the vehicle chassis!\" Teacher Gao's voice rang out through the tempest like a heavy brass bell steadying the sea, cleanly cutting through the roar of the thunderous downpour.\n\n\"Teacher! Did the power blow?! The neon lights along the track are completely dead!\" A-Xin wiped the rain from his face and hollered at the top of his lungs.\n\nQingqing brushed away her soaked bangs, fixing her eyes on the emergency eddy-current brake plates along the track: \"It's not just a blackout! If it were an ordinary outage, the backup diesel generators would kick in within three seconds to trigger the emergency descent system! But right now, every single sensor indicator along the entire track has gone completely dark!\"\n\nMeanwhile, thirty meters below amidst the thick curtain of rain outside the main substation, Dr. Li stood beside a jet-black tactical command van, holding a pair of high-powered infrared thermal binoculars.\n\nA cruel, smug sneer curled at the corner of his lips.\n\n\"Doctor, the high-energy directional EMP device detonated successfully; the substation's main transformers and backup magnetic relays have all been fried,\" an engineer clad in anti-static rain gear reported, looking down at his tablet. \"The entire park's power grid is paralyzed, and the roller coaster's main computer control boards are now complete scrap metal.\"\n\n\"Excellent.\" Dr. Li lowered the binoculars, rain trickling down his lenses as his eyes gleamed as cold as frost. \"An altitude of thirty meters, an eighty-degree tilt, torrential rain, and lateral shear winds hitting seventy kilometers per hour. Under such extreme conditions, the roller coaster's mechanical gravity ratchet jaws can endure at most ten minutes before suffering metal fatigue fracture.\"\n\n\"All twelve tactical retrieval operatives are in position, ready to deploy the high-frequency suppression net below at a moment's notice,\" the engineer reported.\n\n\"GS-X01, that tedious humane protection protocol hardcoded into your core will never allow twenty-six human children to be smashed to pieces,\" Dr. Li murmured to himself, his eyes ablaze with the feverish glint of a predator cornering its prey. \"If you want to save them, you'll have to manually disengage all power limiters right in front of everyone and every camera! The moment you unlock full power, your fragile backup energy core will burn straight through within five minutes...\"\n\nThirty meters up on the elevated track, the situation was spiraling into the abyss with terrifying speed.\n\n\"BOOM——!\" A blinding flash of pale lightning slashed across the darkened rain curtain, casting the steel skeleton into ghostly white relief.\n\nThe howling wind slammed into the suspended lead car like a battering ram, producing an agonizing, teeth-grating screech of metal-on-metal friction between the rails and the wheel assemblies.\n\n\"Waaaah... Mom! I want to go home!\" Several girls in the back rows finally broke down in tears.\n\n\"Don't cry, everyone! Keep your seatbelts tight!\" A-Xin turned around, both hands clamping the safety bar as he shouted, \"We have Teacher Gao with us! Teacher Gao can catch chalk dust bare-handed—he definitely has a way out of this!\"\n\n\"That's right! I—I even got the Golden Bear, so I'm definitely not dying here!\" Soaked to the bone and lips turning purple, Old Wu still puffed out his chest to shout encouragement to his classmates behind him.\n\nBeside A-Xin, however, lines of blood-red alarm text that only Qingqing and A-Xin could comprehend were cascading wildly across Teacher Gao's glasses.\n\n[WARNING: Environmental magnetic field has detected residual waveforms of high-order Electromagnetic Pulse (EMP).]\n\n[ALARM: Coaster primary mechanical self-locking ratchet #01 is bearing a lateral shear overload of 142%; micro-fractures detected in metal lattice!]\n\n[PREDICTIVE MODEL: Mechanical latches will experience catastrophic structural failure within 180 seconds; train will lose all arresting force and enter an unbuffered vertical free fall!]\n\nQingqing astutely noticed the faint blue glow pulsing beneath Teacher Gao's suit collar, her face turning pale as paper: \"Teacher... are the latches about to give out?!\"\n\nTeacher Gao did not answer directly. Slowly lifting his right hand from the safety bar, he pressed his index and middle fingers together and tapped lightly against the third brass button over his chest.\n\nWith an almost imperceptible mechanical click, a row of concealed, thumbnail-sized honeycomb cooling vents popped open along the inner lining of his suit.\n\n\"Student A-Xin, Student Lin Yunqing.\" Teacher Gao's voice was remarkably steady, even colder and more focused than when lecturing on Newton's Third Law of Motion in the classroom.\n\n\"Teacher, what are you doing?!\" A-Xin's heart clenched tight as he caught a whiff of a familiar burnt aroma—the distinct smell of insulating varnish evaporating from circuit boards operating under extreme load.\n\n\"This unit is currently executing multi-dimensional physical calculations.\" Teacher Gao calmly gazed into the vertical abyss directly ahead. \"The maximum operational reach of ground-based hydraulic rescue ladders is twenty-two meters, rendering them incapable of safe deployment under current gale-force wind conditions; the park's auxiliary power grid has suffered permanent hardware destruction, with repair time exceeding forty minutes.\"\n\n\"Then... what are we supposed to do?!\" Lin Yunyun wept through the wall of rain.\n\n\"There is only one conclusion: within one hundred and eighty seconds, an external force must manually lock the coaster's front guide wheels and apply counter-tractive force to cancel out the train's gravitational vector, pushing all twelve cars backwards along the track to the level buffer platform behind us,\" Teacher Gao stated word by word.\n\nQingqing's pupils shrank dramatically: \"Push it back up?! This roller coaster plus the weight of twenty-six students weighs over six point five tons! And the track is tilted at eighty degrees! No standard crane could ever accomplish that on slick steel rails!\"\n\n\"Human skeletal and muscular tissue cannot achieve this,\" Teacher Gao turned his face, rainwater splashing off the sharp contours of his metallic jawline. Beneath his black-framed glasses, the gentle blue glow in his eyes abruptly shifted into a profound, razor-sharp beam of blazing gold and crimson. \"However, the GS-X01 Omnipotent Bionic Unit can.\"\n\nJust then, a voice broke through the roar of the tempest from the ground, cracking with furious strain.\n\n\"Listen up, everyone up there! You little rascals of Class 6-1! Nobody move a single muscle! Whoever dares unbuckle their safety belt, I'll hand them ten major demerits the moment we get back to school!!\"\n\nIt was the voice of Dean of Students Zhou Yan!\n\nLooking down through the pouring rain, the usually immaculate, slicked-back Dean Zhou was now drenched from head to toe, looking like a drowned rooster.\n\nClutching a red megaphone he had snatched from somewhere, his leather shoes coated in mud, he pushed past theme park security guards like a madman, charging to the very base of the coaster tower and craning his neck to roar toward the thirty-meter summit!\n\nBeside him, the park's engineering director held a walkie-talkie with sweating palms, his face pale as a sheet: \"Dean Zhou! Please calm down! The main transformer suffered an electromagnetic surge after a lightning strike; the aerial ladder can't ascend! We've already dialed emergency services for the fire department!\"\n\n\"By the time the fire department gets here, those cars will have already plummeted!\" Zhou Yan seized the director by the collar, nearly sending his glasses flying, his \"Black-Faced Judge\" visage twisted bright red in sheer fury and anguish. \"I'm warning you! Up there are the students of my Luyang Elementary, along with our school's model intern teacher! If they lose even a single strand of hair, I, Zhou Yan, will exhaust my life savings to sue your rotten theme park into total bankruptcy!!\"\n\nWatching from afar as the megaphone-wielding, fiercely protective dean roared on the ground, A-Xin and Old Wu felt their eyes sting with sudden warmth.\n\n\"Even Dean Zhou charged over...\" Old Wu sniffled, tears mingling with rainwater as they streamed down into his mouth.\n\n\"Dean Zhou... what a real man!\" A-Xin shouted through gritted teeth.\n\nYet the peril in the sky granted no one time to dwell on sentiment.\n\n\"CREAK——CRACK!\"\n\nA deafening roar of tearing metal exploded violently!\n\nUnder the combined strain of howling winds and the six-point-five-ton deadweight, the front right gravity catch sheared apart with a two-centimeter fracture, sending several twisted steel rivets whistling into the stormy night sky!\n\nThe entire train violently slid downward by a full thirty centimeters!\n\n\"AAAAAAAH——!!\" The collective screams of all twenty-six students nearly pierced the eardrums.\n\nThe cars bucked violently, icy rainwater surged down everyone's collars, and the color drained from every child's face, turning them deathly pale.\n\n\"Time remaining: fifty-eight seconds.\" Teacher Gao's voice rang out, devoid of the slightest hesitation, free of any vacillation a human might exhibit in the face of life and death.\n\n\"Qingqing, retrieve the anti-static insulating shears from your tool pouch.\" Teacher Gao turned his head, issuing a crisp, calm instruction.\n\n\"T-Teacher... what are you going to do?!\" Qingqing's hands trembled as she fumbled the insulated shears out of her waterproof pouch.\n\n\"Sever the third seam on the left side of my suit's back,\" Teacher Gao turned around, presenting his soaked jacket back. \"Concealed within is the factory manual override valve for humane safety limitations. This unit's wireless transmission module has been corrupted by the EMP, preventing remote software unlocking.\"\n\nQingqing's hands shook uncontrollably: \"Teacher... if I cut that and disengage your limiters... your internal backup battery and gears will...\"\n\n\"Execute the instruction, Student Lin Yunqing.\" Teacher Gao's tone carried an unquestionable, absolute authority. \"This is the duty of a homeroom teacher. Protecting the lives of all twenty-six students in this class is this unit's highest core priority, superseding all algorithms regarding hardware self-preservation.\"\n\nA-Xin reached out, firmly clamping both hands over Qingqing's trembling wrists, his eyes burning with resolute determination: \"Qingqing! Trust Teacher Gao! Do it!\"\n\nGritting her teeth, Qingqing drove the cold shears deep into the fabric of the suit and squeezed hard!\n\n\"RIIIP!\"\n\nAccompanied by the crisp tearing of fabric, a thick alloy pull-ring glowing with fluorescent red light snapped open from Teacher Gao's back!\n\nWithout a second's hesitation, Teacher Gao reached behind him, gripped the ring, and pulled it outward with all his might!\n\n\"Warning: [Project P.E.D.A.] Humane Safety Protocol forced offline.\"\n\n\"Disengaging 40% Power Limiter...\"\n\n\"Disengaging 70% Power Limiter...\"\n\n\"All system servo motors entering overclock state...\"\n\n\"UNLOCKING——100% FULL POWER!!\"\n\nBOOM!\n\nAmidst the raging tempest, Teacher Gao Zhixian's black suit suddenly billowed taut against his frame under internal high-pressure airflow, and boiling white steam erupted like a mighty dragon from the honeycomb vents on his chest!\n\nThose eyes concealed behind the black-framed glasses transformed in that single instant into two dazzling, golden-crimson flames that pierced the darkness and torrential rain!\n\nPlacing a single hand upon the safety lap bar, Teacher Gao exerted a gentle flex, and the heavy alloy bar was shoved open by his bare hand as easily as kneaded dough.\n\nBefore the stunned, spellbound gazes of all twenty-six students, Teacher Gao stepped out of the car into the howling winds and the thirty-meter abyss, planting his feet firmly onto the vertical, eighty-degree steel rail!\n\nIn the heart of the storm, the most magnificent, unimaginable rescue in history had officially begun!\n"},{"id":4,"rawContent":"# 第 20 章：解鎖百分之百全功率\n\n傾斜八十度的冰冷鋼軌在暴雨中滑膩得如同抹了黃油，狂風呼嘯著從三十公尺的高空橫切而過，扯得高老師身上的黑色西裝獵獵作響。\n\n但那一雙黑色的皮鞋卻如同生了根的磁鐵，死死咬在濕滑的工字鋼邊緣，每踏出一步，鋼軌表面便發出一聲沉悶的低鳴。\n\n「崩——！！」\n\n最後一記令人心膽俱裂的金屬爆響猛然在眾人耳畔炸裂！\n\n過山車右側那枚本就佈滿裂紋的重力自鎖棘輪，終於承受不住六點五噸的自重與風力撕扯，徹底崩解成數十塊帶著焦黑火星的鋼鐵碎片，呼嘯著射入下方的無底深淵！\n\n失去了最後的機械卡榫，整列載著二十六名六年一班學生的雲霄飛車，車身猛烈向前一沉，導向輪在軌道上拉出刺耳的摩擦厲響，以失控的加速之勢直向萬丈深淵俯衝砸下！\n\n「啊啊啊啊——！！」全班二十六名孩子的尖叫聲在暴雨中化作了絕望的悲鳴。\n\n就在這千鈞一髮的死生瞬間，站在垂直鋼軌上的高峙舷老師動了！\n\n他的速度快得超越了人類動態視覺的極限，身形在半空中拉出一道殘影，雙膝微屈，雙臂如同一柄出鞘的重型液壓剪，悍然朝著呼嘯下墜的車廂前端前端骨架狂暴插去！\n\n「轟隆！！」\n\n兩隻包裹在黑色西裝袖口下的手掌，狠狠扣死了過山車最前端的牽引橫樑與導向輪基座！\n\n高強度合金與粗糙鋼樑劇烈碰撞，爆發出一圈刺目欲盲的熾白電弧與狂暴火星，在漆黑的暴風雨中猶如一顆突然引爆的微型超新星！\n\n「滋滋滋——吱呀——！！」\n\n整列高速下墜的六點五噸鋼鐵巨獸，被高老師雙臂傳來的恐怖反向拉力硬生生拽住！\n\n輪組與濕滑軌道在強大的扭力抵消下發出宛如垂死巨獸般的刺耳哀嚎，巨大的慣性拉扯力將高老師的雙腳在鋼軌上向下滑退了整整四十公分，鋼軌邊緣的金屬防滑齒槽被合金鞋底犁出兩道深深的焦黑凹痕！\n\n「停……停住了？！」老巫從金甲熊的肚子裡探出頭，眼淚鼻涕流了一臉，呆呆地看著眼前不可思議的景象。\n\n整列過山車，竟然被高老師憑藉一己之力，懸停在了距離垂直俯衝不到三十公分的生死分界線上！\n\n此時此刻，高老師身上的黑色西裝衣袖在高溫與撕扯力下寸寸碎裂，露出了底下宛如銀白水銀般流轉的鈦合金機械臂。\n\n覆蓋在手臂表面的仿真仿生皮膚已被狂暴的摩擦力徹底磨損殆盡，顯露出內部密密麻麻、正發出狂暴蜂鳴的液壓傳動管線與泛著刺目金紅光芒的微型超導光纖束！\n\n「全功率解鎖完成度：百分之百。」\n\n「伺服電機扭矩輸出：三萬八千牛頓米。」\n\n「核心核聚變模擬電池溫度：攝氏一百四十五度……警報：正以每秒兩度之速率持續攀升。」\n\n高老師那冰冷而毫無起伏的電子合成音，在暴風雨中清晰地傳進第一排阿釁與晴晴的耳朵裡。\n\n那一雙原本總是冷靜深邃的眼睛，此刻徹底化作了兩道燃燒著奪目金紅烈焰的核能光柱，將漆黑的暴雨夜幕硬生生撕開了兩道通透的光道！\n\n「高老師……」阿釁死死抓著安全壓桿，雙眼通紅，喉嚨乾澀得幾乎發不出聲音。\n\n這不是他們平時在教室裡偷偷看到的「頭頂冒白煙」或者「指尖微波爐」，這是真正的、毫無保留的機械全功率極限運轉！\n\n為了擋住整列即將墜落的雲霄飛車，高老師體內的每一個齒輪、每一根軸承、每一條超導電纜，都在承受著超越物理設計極限兩倍以上的恐怖過載！\n\n「報告全班同學，」高老師面無表情地側過臉，金紅色的光瞳倒映著二十六張蒼白帶淚的稚嫩臉龐，「本機當前正以逆向牽引協議維持列車懸停狀態。然而，根據材料疲勞極限模型，本機抓握之車架主樑將於七十五秒後發生塑性變形斷裂。」\n\n「那……那我們會怎麼樣？！」尪伝恺顫抖著喊道，聲音裡再也沒有了平時講冷笑話時的調皮。\n\n「為確保全員生存率達百分之九十九點九九，」高老師雙足再度在鋼軌上重重一踏，發出「鏗」的一聲金屬巨響，「本機必須在車架斷裂前，將列車沿傾斜八十度之垂直軌道，逆向推回上方平臺。」\n\n晴晴失聲尖叫：「逆向推回去？！老師！那是六點五噸！而且軌道傾斜了八十度！你的散熱系統根本承受不住這種持續功耗，你的主晶片會被活活燒熔的！！」\n\n「執行學生安全救回程序，乃本機第一核心定律，無可妥協。」高老師的聲音無比堅定。\n\n話音未落，高老師胸口那整排蜂巢散熱孔驟然發出一陣尖銳的噴氣咆哮！\n\n「嗤————！！」\n\n兩道足有三米長的滾燙白熾蒸汽如同怒龍出閘，狂暴地朝著兩側夜空噴射而出，將周圍三米內的暴雨瞬間汽化成一片滾燙的白霧！\n\n「逆向牽引推進——啟動！」\n\n伴隨著高老師一聲低沉的鋼鐵咆哮，他的雙臂肌肉線條下泛起一片刺目的猩紅光斑，內部的微型超導電機爆發出超越極限的瘋狂尖叫！\n\n「卡啦……卡啦！」\n\n在傾斜八十度的垂直絕壁上，那列沉重無比的十二節過山車，竟然真的在濕滑的鋼軌上，緩緩地、一寸一寸地向後倒退爬升了一公分！\n\n「動了！過山車往後退了！」坐在後排的幾個男生激動得大喊起來。\n\n然而，每向上推進一公分，高老師腳下的鋼軌便發出一陣令人心碎的金屬呻吟。\n\n高老師的合金雙腳在鋼軌上踏出一個個凹陷的深坑，暴雨打在他熾熱的機械臂上，瞬間發出「滋滋」的白煙，刺鼻的焦糊味在空氣中狂暴擴散。\n\n「核心電池電量：百分之二十八……百分之二十四……百分之二十……」\n\n高老師鏡片碎裂的鏡框邊緣，閃爍著令人絕望的血紅色電量狂跌數據。\n\n李博士在三十公尺之下的地面指揮車旁，死死盯著平板電腦上那條徹底狂暴的能量曲線，整個人僵硬得如同石雕。\n\n「瘋了……這個瘋子機器人！」李博士的眼角劇烈抽搐，臉色白得像一張死人紙，「他在燃燒自己的超導主線圈！為了二十六個跟他毫無血緣關係的人類小孩……他竟然選擇把自己燒成一堆廢鐵？！」\n\n「博士！他的反向推力突破了五萬牛頓！過山車正在被他推回平臺！」身旁的特勤工程師顫抖著報告。\n\n地面上，向來脾氣火爆的黑面學務主任周嚴，此時早已丟掉了那把壞掉的紅色大喇叭。\n\n他仰著脖子，看著三十公尺高空中那個沐浴在白熱蒸汽與金紅烈焰中、以血肉之軀般的意志逆天推車的身影，眼眶猛然滾落兩行滾燙的熱淚。\n\n「高老師——！！」周嚴用盡平生最大的力氣，對著暴風雨狂吼，「撐住啊！你是我們鹿陽國小最好的老師！！六年一班的兔崽子們！全都給我使勁！幫你們老師減輕重量！！」\n\n聽到周主任那穿透暴雨的咆哮，坐在第一排的阿釁猛然抹乾了臉上的淚水。\n\n「大家聽到了沒有？！」阿釁轉過身，踩著座位，扯開嗓子對著身後嚇傻的二十五名同學大吼，「高老師在用命救我們！我們不能就這樣乾坐著等死！」\n\n「對！我們不能當廢物！」老巫猛地把金甲熊扔向身後，「所有人聽我口令！過山車往後推的時候，大家把身體全部往後仰！用我們的體重幫老師平衡重心！」\n\n「晴晴！老巫！全班一起喊！」阿釁的雙眼燃燒著瘋狂的光芒。\n\n「一！二——推！！」\n\n「一！二——推！！」\n\n二十六名六年一班的孩子，在三十公尺的高空暴風雨中，整齊劃一地將身體隨著高老師的推進節奏全力向後拉扯，發出了震撼整座主題樂園的稚嫩咆哮！\n\n這是一場人類幼童與神級仿生人共同譜寫的奇蹟。\n\n孩子們的每一聲咆哮，彷彿都在為高老師那瀕臨崩潰的核心演算法注入一股不可思議的神經網絡脈衝！\n\n高老師那冰冷運算的處理器中，原本瘋狂跳動的錯誤代碼，竟然被全班二十六名學生的心率數據強行覆蓋。\n\n「檢測到未命名外部情感數據注入……」\n\n「自我保護熔斷機制……已被導師權限永久覆寫！」\n\n「給我——上去！！」\n\n高老師發出了一聲超越機械音調、近乎人類靈魂怒吼的震天咆哮！\n\n他的雙腿如同兩根扎入大地的擎天金剛巨柱，腰部的超微合金齒輪爆發出一圈刺目的火花，雙臂爆發出前所未有的狂暴神力，推著整列六點五噸的列車，在八十度的垂直軌道上進行了最後十公尺的狂暴衝刺！\n\n「喀啦、喀啦、喀啦——轟！！」\n\n一記宛如雷霆劈開天地的震撼巨響，整列雲霄飛車的最前端導向輪，終於狠狠越過了垂直軌道的最高稜線，重重砸進了上方水平的避難緩衝月台之中！\n\n「卡嗒——轟隆！」\n\n月台兩側沉重無比的純機械式防滑重力地錨瞬間彈出，死死卡住了列車的兩側軸承！\n\n安全鎖定完成！\n\n整列載著二十六名六年一班學生的天際量子過山車，徹底回到了絕對平穩安全的水平軌道之上！\n\n狂暴的暴雨依舊在傾瀉，但過山車不再搖晃，萬丈深淵已被拋在身後。\n\n「我們活下來了……我們真的活下來了！！」\n\n老巫一屁股跌坐在座位上，隨後整列列車爆發出驚天動地的歡呼與抱頭痛哭聲。\n\n孩子們解開了安全壓桿，發瘋般地衝出車廂，想要撲向他們的英雄導師。\n\n然而，當阿釁和晴晴第一個衝出車門時，整個人卻硬生生地僵在了原地，淚水瞬間決堤。\n\n只見在暴風雨洗刷的避難月台邊緣，高峙舷老師依舊筆挺地站立在那裡。\n\n但他身上的西裝已被高溫與蒸汽撕成了襤褸的碎片，雙臂與胸膛裸露出的銀白機械骨骼上，密布著高溫燒焦的黑斑與跳躍的微弱藍色電火花。\n\n那一雙曾經神采奕奕、燃燒著金紅烈焰的眼睛，此刻光芒已微弱得如同一盞即將燃盡的殘燭。\n\n高老師看著眼前平安無事的阿釁、晴晴與身後所有的孩子，嘴角微微抽動，似乎試圖模擬出一個人類標準的溫和笑容。\n\n「二十六名學生……全員安全著陸……無人傷亡……」\n\n斷斷續續的電子雜音從高老師的聲帶模組中吐出。\n\n隨後，他胸口那劇烈旋轉的蜂巢散熱風扇，伴隨著一聲微弱的哀鳴，緩緩停轉。\n\n高老師眼底那最後一絲跳躍的光芒，「啪」的一聲，徹底陷入了無邊的黑暗。\n","rawContentEn":"# Chapter 20: Unlocking 100% Full Power\n\nThe frigid steel rails tilted at an eighty-degree incline were as slick as if coated in butter in the torrential downpour, while howling gales sliced laterally thirty meters above the ground, whipping Teacher Gao's black suit into a furious flutter.\n\nYet those black leather shoes clung like rooted electromagnets, biting tenaciously into the slick flange of the I-beam, sending a muffled resonance humming through the steel rail with every step he took.\n\n\"CRACK——!!\"\n\nA final, heart-wrenching metallic detonation suddenly tore through everyone's ears!\n\nThe gravity self-locking ratchet on the right side of the coaster, already riddled with hairline fractures, finally succumbed under the combined assault of its six-point-five-ton deadweight and the tearing winds, disintegrating into dozens of scorched steel fragments glowing with sparks that whistled into the bottomless abyss below!\n\nDeprived of its final mechanical latch, the entire train carrying the twenty-six students of Class 6-1 lurched violently downward, its guide wheels shrieking in agonizing friction against the track as it began a runaway plunge straight toward the yawning chasm!\n\n\"AAAAAAAH——!!\" The collective shrieks of all twenty-six children dissolved into desperate wails amidst the storm.\n\nIn that hair-thin instant between life and death, Teacher Gao Zhixian, stationed upon the vertical steel rail, moved!\n\nHis velocity far exceeded the physical limits of human dynamic vision; his silhouette blurred through the air, knees flexing slightly, both arms lunging forward like the heavy blades of an unholstered hydraulic shear straight into the descending forward chassis of the runaway car!\n\n\"BOOOOM!!\"\n\nTwo palms enveloped within the cuffs of his black suit locked relentlessly onto the coaster's leading traction crossbeam and guide-wheel assembly!\n\nHigh-tensile alloy slammed violently into the coarse steel beam, unleashing a blinding halo of searing white electrical arcs and explosive sparks that flashed like a miniature supernova detonating within the blackened tempest!\n\n\"SKRRRRRCH——SCREEEEECH——!!\"\n\nThe entire six-point-five-ton iron beast, descending at terrifying speed, was forcefully halted by the colossal counter-tractive torque surging from Teacher Gao's arms!\n\nUnder the violent neutralization of kinetic forces, the wheelsets and slick rails shrieked like a dying behemoth; the immense inertia dragged Teacher Gao's feet forty centimeters down the steel rail, his alloy soles carving two deep, scorched grooves through the track's anti-slip teeth!\n\n\"I-It stopped...?!\" Poking his head out from the Golden Bear's stomach, tears and snot streaming down his round face, Old Wu stared dumbfoundedly at the impossible spectacle before him.\n\nThe entire roller coaster had been arrested single-handedly by Teacher Gao, suspended upon the razor-thin boundary of life and death less than thirty centimeters from the vertical drop!\n\nAt that very moment, the sleeves of Teacher Gao's black suit ruptured into ribbons under the extreme thermal load and tensile forces, exposing the titanium alloy mechanical arms shifting beneath like liquid silver.\n\nThe synthetic bionic skin covering his forearms had been utterly abraded by the furious friction, baring the dense thickets of whining hydraulic lines and micro-superconducting fiber optic bundles pulsing with dazzling gold-crimson light!\n\n\"Full power unlock completion: one hundred percent.\"\n\n\"Servo motor torque output: thirty-eight thousand Newton-meters.\"\n\n\"Core nuclear fusion simulated battery temperature: one hundred and forty-five degrees Celsius... Alarm: climbing at a continuous rate of two degrees per second.\"\n\nTeacher Gao's cold, flat synthesized voice filtered cleanly through the storm into the ears of A-Xin and Qingqing in the front row.\n\nThose eyes, usually calm and inscrutable, had transformed completely into twin nuclear beams of blazing gold-crimson fire, burning two transparent tunnels through the blackened curtain of rain!\n\n\"Teacher Gao...\" Clutching the safety bar with white knuckles, his eyes bloodshot, A-Xin found his throat so parched he could barely make a sound.\n\nThis was not the playful \"steam venting from the head\" or \"fingertip microwave\" they had witnessed in secret back in the classroom; this was true, unbridled mechanical operation running at absolute maximum capacity!\n\nTo arrest this falling roller coaster, every single gear, bearing, and superconducting cable within Teacher Gao's chassis was bearing a horrific overload more than double its physical design tolerances!\n\n\"Status report to all students,\" Teacher Gao turned his face impassively, his gold-crimson light pupils reflecting twenty-six pale, tear-streaked faces, \"this unit is currently maintaining train suspension via reverse-traction protocol. However, according to material fatigue limit models, the chassis crossbeam gripped by this unit will experience plastic deformation fracture in seventy-five seconds.\"\n\n\"Then... what happens to us?!\" Wang Zhuankai cried out tremulously, all traces of his usual prankster humor drained from his voice.\n\n\"To guarantee a ninety-nine point nine-nine percent survival rate for all personnel,\" Teacher Gao slammed both feet down onto the steel rail once more with a resounding metallic clang, \"this unit must push the train backwards up the eighty-degree vertical track to the upper platform before structural fracture occurs.\"\n\nQingqing screamed in horror: \"Push it backwards?! Teacher! That's six point five tons! And the track is tilted at eighty degrees! Your cooling system can't endure that sustained power consumption—your main processing core will be incinerated!!\"\n\n\"Executing the student safety retrieval protocol is this unit's primary core directive; it is non-negotiable.\" Teacher Gao's voice was unwavering.\n\nBefore his words even faded, the entire row of honeycomb cooling vents across Teacher Gao's chest erupted with a high-pitched pneumatic shriek!\n\n\"FSSSSSSHHHH——!!\"\n\nTwo plumes of scalding, incandescent white steam extending three meters long blasted out into the night sky like enraged dragons, instantly flash-boiling the torrential rain within a three-meter radius into a swirling cloud of superheated mist!\n\n\"Reverse traction propulsion——engaged!\"\n\nAccompanied by a low, metallic roar from Teacher Gao, glowing crimson heat blooms rippled beneath the muscular contours of his arms as the internal micro-superconducting motors screamed past their maximum limits!\n\n\"Clank... clank!\"\n\nUpon the eighty-degree vertical cliff, that colossal twelve-car roller coaster actually climbed backward along the rain-slicked steel rails, inch by agonizing inch, ascending a full centimeter!\n\n\"It moved! The roller coaster is moving backwards!\" Several boys in the rear rows shouted in wild excitement.\n\nYet with every single centimeter pushed upward, the steel rails groaned beneath Teacher Gao's feet with an agonizing metallic wail.\n\nTeacher Gao's alloy soles crushed deep indentations into the steel, rainwater sizzling into steam the instant it struck his burning mechanical arms, sending a pungent stench of scorched insulation expanding through the air.\n\n\"Core battery level: twenty-eight percent... twenty-four percent... twenty percent...\"\n\nAlong the fractured rim of his spectacles, terrifying blood-red numbers plummeted in freefall.\n\nThirty meters below beside the tactical command van, Dr. Li stared petrified at the wildly spiking energy telemetry on his tablet, his entire body frozen like a stone statue.\n\n\"Madness... this robot has completely lost its mind!\" Dr. Li's eyelid twitched violently, his complexion turning as white as a corpse. \"He is burning through his primary superconducting coils! For twenty-six human children who share not a single drop of blood with him... he actually chooses to reduce himself to a heap of scrap metal?!\"\n\n\"Doctor! His reverse thrust has exceeded fifty thousand Newtons! The coaster is being hoisted back toward the platform!\" the tactical engineer reported in a trembling voice.\n\nDown on the muddy ground, Dean of Students Zhou Yan, notorious for his volcanic temper, had long since hurled aside the broken red megaphone.\n\nCraning his neck, gazing thirty meters up at that figure bathed in white-hot steam and gold-crimson fire, defying heaven itself with the indomitable will of flesh and blood, hot tears suddenly spilled from the dean's eyes.\n\n\"TEACHER GAO——!!\" Zhou Yan roared into the tempest with every shred of strength in his lungs. \"Hold on! You are the finest teacher our Luyang Elementary has ever seen!! You little rascals of Class 6-1! Put your backs into it! Lighten the load for your teacher!!\"\n\nHearing Dean Zhou's thunderous roar piercing the storm, A-Xin in the front row fiercely wiped the tears from his cheeks.\n\n\"Did you all hear that?!\" A-Xin spun around, standing upon his seat, shouting at the top of his lungs to the twenty-five terrified classmates behind him. \"Teacher Gao is putting his life on the line to save us! We can't just sit here like helpless cowards waiting to die!\"\n\n\"He's right! We're not dead weight!\" Old Wu hurled the Golden Bear behind him. \"Everyone, follow my lead! Whenever the coaster pushes back, lean your bodies all the way back! Use our body weight to help Teacher balance the center of gravity!\"\n\n\"Qingqing! Old Wu! Everyone chant together!\" A-Xin's eyes burned with wild resolution.\n\n\"One! Two——PUSH!!\"\n\n\"One! Two——PUSH!!\"\n\nThe twenty-six children of Class 6-1, suspended thirty meters up in the screaming storm, threw their bodies backward in perfect unison with Teacher Gao's pushing rhythm, unleashing a chorus of youthful roars that reverberated across the entire theme park!\n\nThis was a miracle forged jointly by human children and a divine bionic android.\n\nEvery single roar from the children seemed to inject an unfathomable neural network pulse into Teacher Gao's teetering core algorithms!\n\nWithin Teacher Gao's cold, calculating processor, the wildly proliferating error codes were forcibly overridden by the synchronized heart rate telemetry of all twenty-six students.\n\n\"Unidentified external emotional data injection detected...\"\n\n\"Self-preservation fuse protocol... permanently overridden by Teacher Authority!\"\n\n\"GET——UP THERE!!\"\n\nTeacher Gao unleashed an earth-shattering roar that transcended mechanical synthesizer tones, ringing with the fury of a living human soul!\n\nHis legs planted like twin adamantine pillars anchoring the earth, the micrometric alloy gears at his waist showering brilliant sparks as his arms erupted with unprecedented, titanic force, driving the entire six-point-five-ton train into a final, ferocious ten-meter sprint up the eighty-degree vertical rail!\n\n\"CLANK, CLANK, CLANK——BOOOOOM!!\"\n\nWith a tremendous crash that sounded as though thunder had cleaved the world in two, the leading guide wheels of the roller coaster finally crested the summit ridge of the vertical track, slamming heavily onto the horizontal evacuation buffer platform above!\n\n\"CLANG——RUMBLE!\"\n\nThe massive, purely mechanical anti-slip gravity anchors on both sides of the platform instantly engaged, locking down the train's wheel bearings with unyielding grip!\n\nSafety lock achieved!\n\nThe Sky Quantum Coaster, carrying the twenty-six students of Class 6-1, had returned entirely to the absolute security of level track!\n\nThe torrential rain continued to cascade, but the coaster no longer trembled; the terrifying abyss had been left behind.\n\n\"We survived... we really survived!!\"\n\nOld Wu collapsed back into his seat, and a moment later, the entire train erupted into deafening cheers and weeping embraces.\n\nThe children threw open their safety bars, scrambling out of the cars like mad, desperate to throw themselves into the arms of their hero teacher.\n\nYet as A-Xin and Qingqing burst through the car doors first, they froze dead in their tracks, tears instantly bursting forth unchecked.\n\nThere, at the edge of the storm-swept evacuation platform, Teacher Gao Zhixian still stood ramrod straight.\n\nBut his black suit had been shredded into scorched tatters by the blistering heat and steam; upon the silver-white mechanical skeleton exposed across his arms and chest, dark scorch marks and sputtering blue electrical arcs danced fitfully.\n\nThose eyes that had once shone so brilliantly, ablaze with gold-crimson fire, were now dimming like a candle down to its final thread of wick.\n\nLooking upon the safe, unharmed faces of A-Xin, Qingqing, and all the children gathering behind them, Teacher Gao's lips twitched slightly, as if attempting to simulate a standard, gentle human smile.\n\n\"Twenty-six students... all safely arrived... zero casualties...\"\n\nIntermittent electronic static sputtered from Teacher Gao's vocal synthesizer module.\n\nThen, accompanied by a faint mechanical wheeze, the honeycomb cooling fans in his chest slowly ground to a halt.\n\nThat final glimmer of light dancing in the depths of Teacher Gao's eyes went \"click,\" plunging completely into boundless darkness.\n"},{"id":5,"rawContent":"# 第 21 章：耗盡能源的沉睡老師\n\n三十公尺高空的避難月台上，暴雨無情地沖刷著冰冷濕滑的金屬甲板。\n\n高峙舷老師依舊挺立在月台邊緣，身姿筆直得宛如一座歷經戰火摧殘的黑曜石紀念碑。\n\n但他身上的黑色西裝已被高溫與狂暴氣流撕扯得支離破碎，焦黑的布條在狂風中無力地耷拉著；雙臂與胸膛露出的銀白鈦合金骨骼表面，覆蓋著一層暗沉的氧化焦痕，幾處微型線路接頭還在微弱地迸射著嘶嘶作響的蒼白電火花。\n\n最令人心悸的是，那一雙曾總是冷靜深邃、在運算時會跳動微光、在最後關頭燃燒著金紅烈焰的眼睛，此刻徹底黑了下來，宛如兩個冰冷而空洞的深淵。\n\n胸口那排曾咆哮著噴出滾燙白龍蒸汽的蜂巢散熱孔，再也沒有半點氣息吐出，裡面的微型冷卻風扇徹底定格，一片死寂。\n\n「高老師……高老師？！」\n\n阿釁抹去臉上混合著雨水與淚水的污跡，第一個跌跌撞撞地撲到高老師身前，顫抖著伸出雙手抓住高老師冰冷僵硬的合金手腕。\n\n以往只要輕輕一碰就會傳來精準體溫回饋與微弱伺服震顫的手掌，此刻卻如同萬年玄冰般死寂冰涼，沒有任何脈衝，沒有任何回饋。\n\n「老師！你醒醒啊！你不是說我們班是全校計算最複雜的動態方程式嗎？！」阿釁的眼淚奪眶而出，帶著撕心裂肺的哭腔大喊，「過山車已經推上來了！二十六個人一個都沒少！你睜開眼睛看看我們啊！」\n\n「高老師……」\n\n身後，二十五名渾身濕透的學生全都哭著湧了上來，將高老師團團圍在中間。\n\n老巫抱著那隻巨大的星際金甲熊，一頭撞在高老師的大腿金屬外骨骼上，扯開嗓門哇哇大哭：「老師！你別嚇我啊！你不是說我的肉包新鮮度有百分之九十八點四嗎？！我口袋裡還有兩個冰的！你用手指微波爐幫我加熱好不好？！只要你醒過來，我以後吃包子再也不把肉餡漏在抽屜裡了！嗚嗚嗚……」\n\n膽小的林芸芸和幾個女生更是蹲在地上，捂著臉泣不成聲。\n\n尪伝恺死死咬著嘴唇，眼淚順著下巴不斷往下掉，他試圖講個笑話，可一張嘴卻只有絕望的哽咽：「老、老師……你不是最討厭我們早自習遲到嗎……你現在閉著眼睛，我要是在月台上跳街舞，你……你怎麼不拿粉筆丟我了啊……」\n\n「大家先別哭！讓開一點！」\n\n晴晴抹了一把被暴雨糊住的眼睛，強行壓下胸口翻江倒海的酸楚，迅速從防水腰包裡摸出微型十字螺絲起子與數位萬用電表。\n\n「晴晴，老師到底怎麼了？！」阿釁紅著眼睛問道。\n\n「高負荷運轉引發了核心熔斷……我必須立刻檢測他的主控板！」\n\n晴晴咬著牙，顫抖的指尖握著起子，精準插進高老師胸口第二顆焦黑紐扣下方的應急機械釋放槽。\n\n「啪嗒」一聲脆響。\n\n高老師胸口的合金檢修面板彈開了一條手指寬的縫隙，一股刺鼻無比的電路線圈焦糊味與塑料熔化味頓時迎面撲來。\n\n晴晴將萬用電表的紅黑兩根金屬探針，小心翼翼地探入內部的主電源匯流排接點。\n\n液晶螢幕上的數字瘋狂跳動了兩下，最終殘酷地定格在了——`0.00 V`。\n\n「電壓……零伏特。」晴晴的聲音在冷風中劇烈發顫，「備用核聚變模擬電池的微型電容全數燒穿，主動力核心徹底歸零……」\n\n「那……那如果換上一顆新電池呢？！」阿釁急忙追問。\n\n晴晴紅著眼眶搖了搖頭，用探針指著面板深處那團焦黑扭曲的金屬零件：「不只是沒電……剛才為了抵消六點五噸的重力，老師體內的行星傳動齒輪箱在超過攝氏兩百度的超高溫下強制運轉，第三號傳動軸承已經嚴重熱膨脹形變，整個核心模組全被卡死了！」\n\n阿釁低下頭，顫抖著從領口拉出那一枚用紅繩掛著的【P.E.D.A. Core-Gear #03】黃銅行星齒輪。\n\n齒輪在暴風雨中閃爍著溫潤而微弱的金光，那是全劇最開始、高老師在黑板前掉落的第一枚引信。\n\n「用這個！晴晴！」阿釁將黃銅齒輪遞到晴晴眼前，眼神中燃燒著最後的希冀，「這是老師最初掉落的齒輪！我們把它裝回去，老師會不會就能重啟？！」\n\n「不行……現在絕對不行！」晴晴滾燙的眼淚砸在焦黑的金屬外殼上，「軸承卡槽已經變形了，而且固定主軸的防震鎖定螺帽在剛才的超頻推進中震飛了！如果現在沒有正確的扭矩和鎖定螺帽強行嵌入齒輪，主運算晶片會被瞬間短路，所有記憶體資料將會被永久抹除格式化！」\n\n「永久格式化……」阿釁整個人如遭雷擊，踉蹌著後退了一步，「也就是說……老師會徹底忘記我們？忘記六年一班的所有人？！」\n\n全班二十六名同學的心瞬間墜入了冰窟，哭聲在狂風暴雨中顯得無比悽楚而絕望。\n\n就在這時，月台通風管道上方突然傳來一陣極其急促的「窸窸窣窣」聲！\n\n「吱吱！吱吱吱——！」\n\n一團濕漉漉的銀灰色毛球如同閃電般從排氣柵欄中鑽了出來，一躍落在高老師焦黑的肩膀上。\n\n那是溜溜！\n\n溜溜渾身蓬鬆的毛髮此刻全被雨水打濕，貼在瘦小的身軀上。它那一截泛著金屬光澤的尾巴末端，正以瘋狂的頻率閃爍著刺目的猩紅色警報光芒！\n\n「溜溜？！」阿釁一驚。\n\n溜溜用小爪子焦急地抓著高老師冰冷的黑框眼鏡，嘴裡發出尖銳而短促的擬音警報，小腦袋不斷轉向月台右側那條通往地面的螺旋鋼構維修樓梯！\n\n「喀啦、喀啦、喀啦——」\n\n沉重、整齊而冰冷的戰術軍靴踩踏鐵梯的聲音，穿透了嘩啦啦的雨幕，正以極快的速度向著這座三十公尺高的避難月台逼近！\n\n阿釁和晴晴猛然抬頭。\n\n只見在暴雨傾盆的樓梯拐角處，十二名身穿黑色防靜電防暴雨披、面戴反光防毒面具的精壯男子魚貫而上。\n\n他們手中攜帶著重型液壓擴張鉗、絕緣碳纖維固定吊索，以及一口足有兩米長、通體漆黑、散發著冰冷金屬光澤的密封低溫隔離箱！\n\n而在這十二名全副武裝的特勤工程師正前方，領頭的赫然是李博士！\n\n李博士沒有戴面具，任由冰冷的雨水沖刷著他的金屬細框眼鏡。他的臉上沒有絲毫救援成功的喜悅，只有一種冷酷到極點的狂熱與傲慢。\n\n「精彩，真是太精彩了。」\n\n李博士停在距離學生們五公尺外的月台入口處，居高臨下地看著那尊焦黑僵硬的高峙舷老師，嘴角勾起一抹勝利者的殘忍弧度。\n\n「一具被判定為存在嚴重邏輯缺陷、即將退役銷毀的仿生原型機，竟然在沒有總部指令的情況下，爆發出五萬牛頓的非法人道救援推力。」李博士推了推鏡架，聲音在風雨中顯得無比刺耳，「但也僅此而已了。他的超導線圈已徹底燒穿，主邏輯門電路永久損毀，備用電池完全歸零。現在的他，不過是一具重達一百八十公斤的報廢高階合金廢鐵。」\n\n「你閉嘴！！」阿釁雙眼布滿血絲，咬牙切齒地向前踏出一步，怒視著李博士，「高老師不是廢鐵！他是我們的班導師！！」\n\n「導師？」李博士發出一聲充滿嘲弄的嗤笑，「無知的小鬼。他只不過是未來先端科技公司名下的【Project P.E.D.A.】實驗耗材，代號 GS-X01。他的每一顆螺絲、每一行底層程式碼，所有權全都屬於公司董事會。」\n\n李博士揮了揮手，語氣冰冷地下達指令：「特勤組，執行【歐米茄協議：最終回收】。用碳纖維防爆吊索固定機體，裝入低溫隔離箱，立刻運往後山重型卡車。回總部後就地進行無害化拆解熔毀。」\n\n「是！」\n\n四名高大精壯的特勤工程師立刻手持合金撬棍與厚重的絕緣鎖鏈，面無表情地朝著高老師大步逼近！\n\n「我看誰敢碰他！！」\n\n阿釁猛地展開雙臂，像一隻護崽的幼狼，死死擋在高老師殘破的身軀前！\n\n「阿釁說得對！誰也不准動高老師！」\n\n晴晴毫不猶豫地站到了阿釁身側，手中緊緊攥著那把微型螺絲起子，眼神如寒刃般凌厲！\n\n「滾開！你們這群穿黑雨衣的壞蛋！」\n\n老巫將一米半的星際金甲熊狠狠砸向一名特勤隊員，隨後用自己魁梧圓滾的身體，如同肉盾般橫插在前方！\n\n「保護高老師！！」\n\n「不准搶走我們的老師！！」\n\n下一秒，震撼人心的一幕在三十公尺高空的暴風雨中爆發了。\n\n六年一班剩下的二十三名學生，沒有一個人後退，沒有一個人逃跑！\n\n就連平時膽子最小、看見毛毛蟲都會尖叫的林芸芸，也抹乾眼淚死死咬著牙衝了上來；尪伝恺挽起袖子，雙眼噴火；所有孩子手挽著手、肩並著肩，在狂風暴雨的避難月台上，築起了一道稚嫩卻堅不可摧的人形肉牆！\n\n二十六名小學六年級的孩子，用單薄的身軀，將那具冰冷沉睡的機器人導師，死死護在了最核心的中央！\n\n冰冷的暴雨打濕了每一個人的頭髮和衣衫，但二十六雙眼睛裡燃燒的怒火，卻讓那四名見慣了大場面的特勤隊員腳步不由自主地遲疑了一下。\n\n「博士……這群小鬼擋著，無法使用機械吊索。」一名隊員回頭請示。\n\n李博士的臉色徹底陰沉了下來，眼中閃過一絲暴戾：「一群不知天高地厚的蠢孩子！動手，把他們全都強行拉開！誰敢反抗就用防暴束縛帶捆起來！」\n\n就在特勤隊員重新跨出腳步、伸出戴著戰術手套的大手抓向阿釁肩膀的瞬間——\n\n螺旋鐵梯的方向，突然傳來了一聲如同萬鈞雷霆炸裂般的暴怒咆哮！\n\n「李崇明！！你他媽動一下我的學生試試看？！！」\n\n轟！！\n\n一道渾身沾滿黃泥與雨水的魁梧黑影，手裡倒拖著一根從檢修工棚拆下來的重型實心生鐵水管，如同一頭被徹底激怒的狂暴雄獅，挾帶著滔天怒火轟然撞碎鐵門，殺上了避難月台！\n\n那是學務主任——周嚴！\n","rawContentEn":"# Chapter 21: The Sleeping Teacher Deprived of Power\n\nOn the evacuation platform thirty meters high, torrential rain washed relentlessly over the cold, slick metal deck.\n\nTeacher Gao Zhixian still stood ramrod straight at the platform's edge, his posture as erect as an obsidian monument battered by the fury of war.\n\nYet the black suit upon his frame had been shredded to tatters by the blistering heat and violent airflow, charred ribbons fluttering limply in the gale; across the silver-white titanium alloy skeleton exposed along his arms and chest, a dark layer of oxidized scorch marks spread, with several micro-circuit terminals still weakly sputtering with hissing, pale electrical sparks.\n\nMost heart-wrenching of all, those eyes that had always been calm and inscrutable, that once flickered with faint light during calculations, and that had burned with gold-crimson fire in the final hour, were now completely dark, like two frigid, hollow abysses.\n\nFrom the honeycomb cooling vents along his chest that had once roared with plumes of scalding white dragon steam, not a single whisper of breath emerged; the internal micro-cooling fans had frozen entirely in place, locked in deathly silence.\n\n\"Teacher Gao... Teacher Gao?!\"\n\nWiping the grime of rainwater and tears from his face, A-Xin was the first to stumble forward before Teacher Gao, trembling as he reached out with both hands to clutch Teacher Gao's cold, rigid alloy wrist.\n\nA palm that in the past would provide precise thermal feedback and faint servo tremors at the lightest touch was now as deathly cold as perennial glacier ice, devoid of any pulse, devoid of any response.\n\n\"Teacher! Wake up! Didn't you say our class is the most complex dynamic equation in the whole school?!\" Tears gushed from A-Xin's eyes as he screamed with a heart-wrenching cry, \"The roller coaster has been pushed all the way up! All twenty-six of us are here, not one missing! Open your eyes and look at us!\"\n\n\"Teacher Gao...\"\n\nBehind him, all twenty-five drenched students surged forward in tears, surrounding Teacher Gao in a tight circle.\n\nClutching that massive Space Golden Bear, Old Wu slammed his head against the metal exoskeleton of Teacher Gao's thigh, bawling at the top of his lungs: \"Teacher! Don't scare me! Didn't you say my pork buns had an optimal freshness rating of ninety-eight point four percent?! I still have two cold ones in my pocket! Please reheat them with your fingertip microwave, okay?! As long as you wake up, I promise I'll never drop meat stuffing into my desk drawer again while eating buns! Waaah...\"\n\nThe timid Lin Yunyun and several other girls squatted on the ground, burying their faces in their hands, weeping uncontrollably.\n\nWang Zhuankai bit his lip hard, tears streaming off his chin, trying to crack a joke, but when he opened his mouth, only desperate sobs came out: \"T-Teacher... didn't you hate it most when we were late for morning study hall... You're closing your eyes right now, so if I break into a street dance on this platform... w-why aren't you throwing chalk at me anymore...\"\n\n\"Everyone stop crying for a second! Give him some room!\"\n\nQingqing wiped away the rain blurring her eyes, forcibly suppressing the overwhelming ache surging in her chest, and swiftly retrieved a miniature Phillips screwdriver and a digital multimeter from her waterproof pouch.\n\n\"Qingqing, what's happened to Teacher?!\" A-Xin asked with bloodshot eyes.\n\n\"The extreme load caused a core blowout... I have to inspect his main control board immediately!\"\n\nGritting her teeth, her trembling fingertips gripping the screwdriver, Qingqing inserted it precisely into the emergency mechanical release slot beneath the second scorched button on Teacher Gao's chest.\n\nA crisp \"click\" sounded.\n\nThe alloy maintenance hatch on Teacher Gao's chest popped open by a finger's width, and a pungent odor of scorched circuit coils and melted polymer immediately hit their nostrils.\n\nCarefully inserting the multimeter's red and black metal probes, Qingqing tapped into the primary power bus terminals inside.\n\nThe digits on the LCD screen flickered wildly twice, then settled brutally at—`0.00 V`.\n\n\"Voltage... zero volts.\" Qingqing's voice trembled violently in the chilly wind. \"The micro-capacitors in the auxiliary nuclear fusion simulated battery have completely burned through; the primary power core has dropped entirely to zero...\"\n\n\"Then... what if we replace it with a new battery?!\" A-Xin pressed urgently.\n\nHer eyes brimming with tears, Qingqing shook her head, using her probe to point toward a twisted, scorched cluster of metallic components deep within the chassis: \"It's not just the power... to cancel out six point five tons of gravitational pull just now, the planetary gearbox inside Teacher was forced to operate under temperatures exceeding two hundred degrees Celsius; bearing number three has suffered severe thermal expansion deformation, jamming the entire core module solid!\"\n\nLowering his head, A-Xin reached into his collar with trembling fingers and pulled out the [P.E.D.A. Core-Gear #03] brass planetary gear hanging from a red cord.\n\nThe gear gleamed with a gentle, faint golden luster amidst the tempest—the very first catalyst that had dropped before the blackboard at the beginning of everything.\n\n\"Use this! Qingqing!\" A-Xin held the brass gear before Qingqing's eyes, the final spark of hope burning in his gaze. \"This is the gear Teacher dropped at the very start! If we put it back in, will Teacher reboot?!\"\n\n\"No... absolutely not right now!\" Qingqing's scalding tears splashed against the charred metal casing. \"The bearing seat has warped, and the anti-vibration locking nut securing the primary spindle was shaken loose during that overclocked thrust! Without the correct torque and locking nut, forcing the gear in will cause an instantaneous short-circuit in the primary computing chip, permanently erasing and formatting all memory data!\"\n\n\"Permanently formatted...\" A-Xin felt as if struck by lightning, staggering backward a step. \"You mean... Teacher will completely forget us? Forget everyone in Class 6-1?!\"\n\nThe hearts of all twenty-six students plummeted into an icy abyss, their weeping sounding profoundly desolate and despairing amidst the howling wind and rain.\n\nRight at that moment, a frantic rustling sound suddenly echoed from the ventilation ducts above the platform!\n\n\"Squeak! Squeak-squeak——!\"\n\nA drenched ball of silver-gray fur darted like lightning through the exhaust grille, leaping squarely onto Teacher Gao's scorched shoulder.\n\nIt was Liu-Liu!\n\nLiu-Liu's fluffy coat was soaked through, clinging to its tiny frame. The tip of its tail, gleaming with metallic luster, was flashing a blinding, crimson emergency alarm at a frantic frequency!\n\n\"Liu-Liu?!\" A-Xin gasped in surprise.\n\nLiu-Liu anxiously scratched at Teacher Gao's cold spectacles with its tiny paws, emitting sharp, rapid synthesized alert chirps, its little head constantly jerking toward the spiral steel maintenance staircase leading to the ground on the right!\n\n\"Clank, clank, clank——\"\n\nThe heavy, rhythmic, cold thud of tactical combat boots ascending the iron steps cut through the roaring curtain of rain, rapidly approaching this thirty-meter-high evacuation platform!\n\nA-Xin and Qingqing jerked their heads up.\n\nRounding the corner of the rain-drenched staircase, twelve strapping men clad in black anti-static tactical rain ponchos and reflective gas masks filed up one after another.\n\nIn their hands, they carried heavy hydraulic spreaders, insulated carbon-fiber securing cables, and a two-meter-long, pitch-black, hermetically sealed cryogenic isolation container radiating a cold metallic sheen!\n\nAnd right at the forefront of these twelve fully armed tactical engineers walked none other than Dr. Li!\n\nDr. Li wore no mask, letting the icy rain wash over his thin metal-framed spectacles. There was not a shred of relief on his face for the rescue's success—only a chilling, fanatic arrogance.\n\n\"Splendid. Truly splendid.\"\n\nDr. Li halted at the platform entrance five meters away from the students, looking down upon the charred, rigid figure of Teacher Gao Zhixian, a cruel, triumphant smirk curving at his lips.\n\n\"A bionic prototype deemed to possess severe logical flaws and scheduled for decommission and scrapping actually unleashed fifty thousand Newtons of unauthorized humane rescue thrust without instructions from headquarters.\" Dr. Li pushed up his glasses, his voice cutting through the storm with grating harshness. \"Yet that is all it amounted to. His superconducting coils are incinerated, his primary logic gates permanently destroyed, his backup battery completely drained to zero. Right now, he is nothing more than a hundred-and-eighty-kilogram heap of decommissioned high-grade scrap metal.\"\n\n\"Shut your mouth!!\" A-Xin's eyes were bloodshot as he took a ferocious step forward, glaring at Dr. Li. \"Teacher Gao is not scrap metal! He is our homeroom teacher!!\"\n\n\"Teacher?\" Dr. Li let out a derisive scoff. \"Ignorant brats. He is merely experimental consumable property under Advanced Future Technology's [Project P.E.D.A.], designation GS-X01. Every single screw, every line of underlying code—ownership belongs entirely to the corporate board.\"\n\nWaving his hand, Dr. Li issued his order in cold tones: \"Tactical squad, execute [Omega Protocol: Final Retrieval]. Secure the chassis with carbon-fiber blast-proof hoists, seal it in the cryogenic isolation container, and transport it immediately to the heavy transport truck at the rear mountain. Upon return to headquarters, proceed with on-site non-hazardous dismantling and smelting.\"\n\n\"Understood!\"\n\nFour burly tactical engineers immediately stepped forward with alloy crowbars and heavy insulated chains, advancing impassively toward Teacher Gao!\n\n\"Let's see who dares touch him!!\"\n\nA-Xin threw his arms wide open, like a wolf pup guarding its pack, planting himself fiercely before Teacher Gao's battered chassis!\n\n\"A-Xin is right! Nobody lays a finger on Teacher Gao!\"\n\nQingqing stepped up beside A-Xin without a second's hesitation, the miniature screwdriver gripped tight in her hand, her gaze as sharp as cold steel!\n\n\"Get lost! You bad guys in black raincoats!\"\n\nOld Wu hurled the one-and-a-half-meter Space Golden Bear hard at one of the tactical operatives, then threw his own stout, hefty frame forward like a human shield!\n\n\"Protect Teacher Gao!!\"\n\n\"You're not taking our teacher!!\"\n\nIn the very next second, an awe-inspiring scene erupted thirty meters high amidst the howling storm.\n\nAmong the remaining twenty-three students of Class 6-1, not a single one backed down; not a single one ran!\n\nEven Lin Yunyun, usually the most timid girl who would shriek at the sight of a caterpillar, wiped her tears and charged forward with gritted teeth; Wang Zhuankai rolled up his sleeves, his eyes blazing; every child linked arms, shoulder to shoulder, forming a youthful yet impregnable human wall across the storm-battered platform!\n\nTwenty-six sixth-grade children, using their slender bodies, fiercely shielded their cold, dormant robot teacher at the very core of their circle!\n\nThe frigid rain soaked everyone's hair and clothes, but the fury burning in those twenty-six pairs of eyes made the four battle-hardened operatives hesitate in their tracks.\n\n\"Doctor... these kids are blocking us; we can't deploy the mechanical hoists,\" an operative turned back to report.\n\nDr. Li's expression darkened completely, a vicious glint flashing in his eyes: \"A bunch of foolish, insolent brats! Move in and pull them away by force! Anyone who resists gets bound with riot zip-ties!\"\n\nJust as the operatives took another stride forward, extending gloved hands to seize A-Xin's shoulder—\n\nFrom the direction of the spiral iron staircase, an enraged roar suddenly exploded like a thunderclap splitting the earth!\n\n\"LI CHONGMING!! DON'T YOU DARE LAY A DAMN FINGER ON MY STUDENTS?!!\"\n\nBOOM!!\n\nA burly dark figure coated in yellow mud and rainwater, dragging a heavy solid cast-iron water pipe torn from a maintenance shed, burst through the iron gate like an enraged lion consumed by towering fury, storming onto the evacuation platform!\n\nIt was Dean of Students—Zhou Yan!\n"},{"id":6,"rawContent":"# 第 22 章：大雨中的人牆防線\n\n「鏗——！！」\n\n一根足有碗口粗細、長達一米五的重型實心生鐵水管，被周嚴主任狠狠砸在避難月台的防滑鋼板上，崩出一連串刺目的橘紅色火星！\n\n暴風雨中，全身濕透、西裝撕裂、領帶歪斜的周嚴主任挺胸而立，整個人宛如一座拔地而起的巍峨黑塔，死死橫亙在十二名全副武裝的特勤工程師與二十六名孩子之間。\n\n他那張平日裡在鹿陽國小讓所有頑皮學生聞風喪膽的「黑面判官」臉龐，此刻因極度的暴怒而泛著森然的鐵青色，一雙鷹隼般的虎目死死盯著李博士，胸膛劇烈起伏，噴出粗重的喘息。\n\n「周嚴？！」李博士被剛才那一聲巨響震得下意識後退了半步，待看清來人後，眉頭猛地擰成了一個死結，「你怎麼會上來？！這裡已經被先端科技總部全面接管，閒雜人等立刻退下！」\n\n「閒雜人等？！」周嚴怒極反笑，嘴角咧出一抹令人膽寒的狂暴弧度，「李崇明，你他媽睜大你的狗眼看看！老子是鹿陽國小的學務主任！！」\n\n周嚴一把扯開自己被雨水黏在胸口的襯衫口袋，掏出了一張被雨水泡得發脹、但依然塑封完整的深藍色證件，狠狠甩在了李博士的胸口上！\n\n那是中華民國教育部核發的高級教師證！\n\n「在這趟三天兩夜的畢業旅行裡，六年一班這二十六個學生的每一根毛髮，還有我身後這位模範實習導師的生命安全，全都由我周嚴全權負責！」周嚴手裡的生鐵水管在雨水中指著李博士的鼻尖，聲若洪鐘，字字如雷，「你算個什麼東西？！穿著一件黑雨衣，帶了一群戴防毒面具的狗腿子，就敢跑到三十公尺的高空來搶老子的人？！」\n\n李博士接住那張教師證，臉色青一陣白一陣，隨後惱羞成怒地將證件扔在泥水裡，冷笑出聲：「周主任，別在這裡演什麼師道尊嚴的鬧劇了！你身後護著的根本就不是人類！他是我們公司造價昂貴的仿生原型機，代號 GS-X01！他沒有心跳，沒有靈魂，更沒有教師資格！他只是一具非法滯留、存在嚴重邏輯缺陷的實驗廢鐵！」\n\n「實驗廢鐵？！」\n\n周嚴聽到這四個字，雙眼瞬間布滿了駭人的血絲，整個人如同被點燃的炸藥桶般暴怒地跨前一步，生鐵水管「呼」的一聲擦著李博士的耳邊掠過，重重砸在旁邊的欄杆上，震得整座鋼構發出悲鳴！\n\n「剛才在三十公尺垂直絕壁上，是這具你口中的『廢鐵』，硬生生頂著六點五噸的列車，把二十六個孩子的命從閻王殿門口搶了回來！」\n\n周嚴一把揪住李博士的雨衣領口，將他狠狠拉到自己面前，暴雨沖刷著周嚴扭曲的臉龐，怒吼聲幾乎要震碎李博士的耳膜：「而在五分鐘前，就是你這個長著心臟、流著熱血的『真正人類』，在變電站引爆了 EMP，差點讓二十六個無辜的孩子摔成肉泥！！」\n\n「李崇明！你摸著你的良心告訴我！」周嚴狠狠將李博士推了個趔趄，眼中燃燒著滔天烈焰，「到底誰才是廢鐵？！到底誰才是他媽毫無人性的冷血怪物？！」\n\n周嚴這一番擲地有聲的咆哮，宛如晴天霹靂，炸得整個月台陷入了一片死寂，連呼嘯的狂風暴雨彷彿都在這一刻退避三舍。\n\n李博士被推得撞在冰冷的低溫隔離箱上，眼鏡歪斜，雨水順著下巴瘋狂滴落，整個人臉色慘白如紙，張了張嘴，卻連一個字都反駁不出來。\n\n十二名身材魁梧的特勤工程師，手中緊握著的液壓鉗與吊索，在周嚴那如同猛獸般狂怒的威壓下，竟然齊齊僵硬在半空中，沒有一個人敢再上前一步。\n\n然而，在周嚴身後，真正的震撼才剛剛開始。\n\n「周主任說得對！高老師是全宇宙最好的老師！」\n\n阿釁抹去眼角的淚水，雙手死死扣住身旁晴晴與老巫的手腕，向前踏出了堅定的一步。\n\n「我們不准你們把他裝進那個黑箱子裡！」晴晴的校服早已濕透，泥水糊滿了她的臉頰，但她的脊背挺得筆直，手中緊握的微型螺絲起子在雨夜中折射出不屈的寒芒。\n\n「想動高老師，先從老子身上踩過去！」老巫扯開破鑼嗓子，用自己圓滾壯碩的身體死死頂在人牆的最前端，胸膛在冷風中劇烈起伏。\n\n緊接著，二十六個稚嫩卻堅決的聲音，如同洶湧的潮水般在大雨中匯聚成了一股不可阻擋的巨浪！\n\n「不准碰高老師！！」\n\n「我們絕對不放手！！」\n\n膽小的林芸芸眼眶通紅，卻死死抓著身旁同學的衣角，帶著哭腔尖叫；尪伝恺的眼鏡早就被暴雨沖掉了，卻依然揮舞著拳頭怒吼；平時調皮搗蛋的二十六個皮蛋，在這一刻沒有一個人退縮，沒有一個人鬆開身旁同伴的手！\n\n二十六雙沾滿泥濘的小手，在冰冷的暴風雨中緊緊相扣，結成了一道嚴絲合縫、堅不可摧的血肉長城！\n\n雨水瘋狂地砸在孩子們發抖的睫毛上，狂風扯著他們單薄的校服，但那二十六雙眼睛裡迸發出的熾熱光芒，卻讓黑夜與風暴都顯得黯淡無光。\n\n他們用自己的心跳與體溫，將那具全身焦黑、雙眼熄滅的機器人導師，死死守護在了人牆最溫暖的核心深處。\n\n李博士跌坐在地上，顫抖著雙手從防水口袋裡摸出了那部還在運行的戰術平板電腦。\n\n螢幕上，過山車逆推救援時的黑盒子日誌正以瀑布流般瘋狂滾動。\n\n【紀錄時間點：13:42:15】\n\n【警告：伺服扭矩超載 280%，主散熱線圈已徹底熔毀。】\n\n【錯誤中斷：檢測到外部 26 組未命名情感神經網絡脈衝注入，熔斷保護協議被強制終止。】\n\n【終端覆寫指令：確認執行——以全損代價，確保六年一班全員生存。】\n\n【指令簽名：鹿陽國小六年一班導師——高峙舷（GS-X01）。】\n\n李博士看著那行被強制覆寫的代碼簽名，眼角劇烈地抽搐著，心臟彷彿被一記重錘狠狠砸中。\n\n作為這個專案的總研發主管，他窮盡了半生心血，試圖通過演算法模擬出最完美的「教育模型」，卻始終被董事會批評為「冰冷、刻板、缺乏人性共鳴的失敗品」。\n\n可他做夢也沒有想到，自己耗費無數心血都無法跨越的技術壁壘，竟然在鹿陽國小這個傳說中的調皮班級裡，在一顆掉落的黃銅齒輪與無數次荒誕搞笑的字面解讀中，被這群孩子純粹的眼淚與信任，生生撞開了一條通往「靈魂」的裂縫！\n\n這根本不是邏輯缺陷。\n\n這是這具機械生命，在二十六個孩子的陪伴下，進化出的真正屬於「人」的奇蹟！\n\n「嗚嗚嗚——嗚哇——！！」\n\n就在這時，主題樂園下方的地平線上，驟然劃破雨幕，亮起了無數道刺目的紅白旋轉警燈！\n\n刺耳的警笛聲與救護車警報聲，穿透了狂風驟雨，至少有十幾輛警車與消防特勤雲梯車正風馳電掣般衝破園區大門，朝著過山車塔架呼嘯而來！\n\n周嚴冷冷地盯著李博士，生鐵水管在掌心微微一頓：「聽到了嗎，李博士？警察、消防隊，還有鹿陽國小的家長自救會，全都到了。你現在要是想當著全台灣新聞媒體的面，強行搶走救了二十六名學生的英雄導師，老子奉陪到底！」\n\n李博士面如死灰地看著月台邊緣那道手挽著手、在狂風中寸步不讓的孩子人牆，又看了一眼手中那份記錄著「奇蹟」的日誌數據。\n\n他眼中的冰冷與狂熱，終於在這一刻寸寸碎裂，化作了一種混合著苦澀、釋然與敬畏的複雜神情。\n\n李博士深吸了一口氣，在暴雨中緩緩站起身來。\n\n他沒有再下達抓捕指令，而是朝著身後的十二名特勤工程師做了一個「武器收起、終止行動」的戰術手勢。\n\n「特勤組，把隔離箱收起來。」李博士的聲音有些沙啞，但卻透著一種前所未有的平靜。\n\n「博士？！可是歐米茄協議……」特勤隊長急切地反問。\n\n「我說，終止行動！」李博士厲聲喝止，隨後轉身走向月台邊緣的綝耘晴。\n\n阿釁和老巫警惕地往前挺了一步，但周嚴伸手按住了他們的肩膀。\n\n李博士在庫存工具包裡摸索了幾秒，掏出了一枚通體由鈦金屬打造、閃爍著精密刻度的微型校準板手，以及一枚高階工程除錯加密隨身碟。\n\n他俯下身，將這兩樣東西輕輕放在了晴晴腳邊的工具袋旁。\n\n「小姑娘，妳的機械直覺很準確。」李博士低聲說道，雨水順著他的鏡片流淌，「他體內的熱膨脹卡死了三號行星軸承，主定子線圈產生了嚴重的微弧放電。妳如果直接通電或者盲目插入齒輪，殘留電容會瞬間將他的核心記憶庫格式化成白紙。」\n\n晴晴瞳孔一縮，猛地抬頭看著李博士。\n\n「這枚隨身碟裡有 GS-X01 的完整底層架構圖與軸承公差參數，那把微型板手能幫妳在不傷及光纖的情況下撬開卡死的線圈。」李博士閉了閉眼睛，聲音輕得宛如耳語，「但是，妳必須在十二分鐘之內完成重啟。十二分鐘後，備用電容的殘存微伏電壓將徹底衰減殆盡，到那時……神仙也救不回他的記憶了。」\n\n「還有……最關鍵的那個東西……」李博士指了指下方漆黑一片、狂風肆虐的軌道維修通道，「剛才他在逆推列車越過稜線時，固定主軸的防震鎖定螺帽被高壓氣流震飛了。那是特種航太合金製成的左旋逆向螺帽，全天下沒有任何通用螺絲可以替代它。沒有它鎖死主軸，齒輪就算裝回去也無法咬合。」\n\n說完，李博士轉過身，拉起了雨衣的兜帽，遮住了自己所有的表情。\n\n「李崇明，你到底想幹什麼？」周嚴沉聲問道。\n\n李博士停在螺旋樓梯口，沒有回頭，只是在大雨中苦笑了一聲：「周主任，我回去會向董事會報告，GS-X01 已經在過山車事故中徹底自爆解體，殘骸墜入深海無法打撈。」\n\n「剩下的十二分鐘……是你們六年一班的時間了。」\n\n伴隨著戰術軍靴遠去的腳步聲，李博士帶著十二名特勤隊員，迅速消失在了螺旋樓梯下方的雨幕之中。\n\n月台上，暴雨依舊在傾瀉。\n\n「晴晴！十二分鐘！」阿釁猛然轉頭，眼中燃燒著前所未有的焦急與瘋狂，「我們只有十二分鐘救高老師！」\n\n「可是……防震鎖定螺帽掉在下面的軌道上了！」晴晴的臉色煞白，「這座鋼架有三十公尺高，而且全是狂風暴雨，要在幾千根鋼樑裡找一顆只有指甲蓋大小的螺帽……這怎麼可能辦得到？！」\n\n就在全員陷入絕望的瞬間，高老師焦黑肩膀上的那一團銀灰色毛球，突然發出了一聲興奮至極的尖叫！\n\n「吱吱——！！」\n\n溜溜的小鼻子在空氣中瘋狂抽動，隨後在所有人的注視下，化作一道銀色閃電，一頭扎進了狂暴漆黑的風雨深淵！\n","rawContentEn":"# Chapter 22: Human Wall in the Pouring Rain\n\n\"CLANG——!!\"\n\nA heavy, solid cast-iron water pipe, as thick as a bowl and a meter and a half long, was slammed violently onto the anti-slip steel deck of the evacuation platform by Dean Zhou Yan, sending a spray of blinding orange-red sparks dancing into the storm!\n\nAmidst the tempest, drenched from head to toe, with his suit torn and necktie crooked, Dean Zhou Yan stood with his chest thrown out, like a towering black monolith rising from the earth, planting himself immovably between twelve fully armed tactical engineers and twenty-six children.\n\nThat \"Black-Faced Judge\" visage that usually struck terror into every mischievous student back at Luyang Elementary was now grimly ashen with towering fury; his hawk-like eyes glared unflinchingly at Dr. Li, his chest heaving violently as he drew heavy, ragged breaths.\n\n\"Zhou Yan?!\" Rattled by the thunderous crash, Dr. Li instinctively recoiled half a step, and upon recognizing the newcomer, his brow knotted into a tight scowl: \"How did you get up here?! This area has been placed under full jurisdiction by Advanced Future Technology HQ; bystanders, withdraw immediately!\"\n\n\"Bystanders?!\" Zhou Yan let out a laugh of pure fury, a terrifying, savage grin curling at his lips. \"Li Chongming, open your damn dog eyes and take a good look! I am the Dean of Students of Luyang Elementary School!!\"\n\nZhou Yan tore open his shirt pocket, soaked and plastered to his chest, pulling out a dark blue credential swollen with rainwater yet still pristinely sealed in plastic, and slammed it squarely against Dr. Li's chest!\n\nIt was a Senior Teacher's License issued by the Ministry of Education!\n\n\"On this three-day, two-night graduation trip, every single strand of hair on these twenty-six students of Class 6-1, along with the safety of this model intern teacher standing behind me, is under my absolute, sole responsibility!\" Brandishing the cast-iron pipe right at the tip of Dr. Li's nose through the rain, Zhou Yan's voice boomed like a bronze bell, every word falling like a crack of thunder. \"Who the hell do you think you are?! Don't think for a second that just because you're wearing a black raincoat and brought a pack of lackeys in gas masks, you can barge up to a thirty-meter summit and kidnap my people?!\"\n\nCatching the license, Dr. Li's face flushed from green to pale white, and humiliated, he tossed the credential into the muddy puddles, sneering coldly: \"Dean Zhou, drop the theatrical farce about teacherly sanctity! The thing you're protecting behind you isn't even human! He is our corporation's expensive bionic prototype, designation GS-X01! He has no heartbeat, no soul, and certainly no teaching certification! He is merely a piece of experimental scrap metal harboring severe logical defects, remaining here illegally!\"\n\n\"Experimental scrap metal?!\"\n\nHearing those three words, Zhou Yan's eyes flared with terrifying, bloodshot rage; stepping forward like an ignited powder keg, he swung the cast-iron pipe with a fierce whoosh past Dr. Li's ear, smashing it heavily against the adjacent steel railing and making the entire structure screech in agonizing resonance!\n\n\"Just minutes ago, on an eighty-degree vertical cliff thirty meters in the air, it was this very 'scrap metal' you sneer at that bore the deadweight of a six-point-five-ton train and dragged twenty-six young lives back from the jaws of death!\"\n\nZhou Yan grabbed Dr. Li by the collar of his tactical raincoat, hauling him brutally before his face, rain pelting against Zhou Yan's contorted features as his furious roar nearly shattered Dr. Li's eardrums: \"And five minutes ago, it was you—a 'true human' with a biological heart pumping warm blood—who detonated an EMP at the substation, nearly sending twenty-six innocent children plunging to be crushed into paste!!\"\n\n\"Li Chongming! Put your hand on your conscience and tell me!\" Zhou Yan shoved Dr. Li back violently, eyes blazing with towering flames of righteous indignation. \"Just who is the scrap metal here?! Who is the damn cold-blooded monster devoid of humanity?!\"\n\nZhou Yan's thunderous denunciation detonated across the platform like a bolt of lightning, plunging the entire summit into stunned silence, so fierce that even the howling tempest seemed to recoil in deference.\n\nStaggering backward against the frigid cryogenic container, his glasses askew and rain streaming down his chin, Dr. Li turned pale as a sheet; his mouth parted, but not a single syllable of rebuttal could escape his lips.\n\nThe twelve burly tactical engineers, clutching hydraulic spreaders and hoisting cables, froze mid-stride under the terrifying, predatory aura radiating from Zhou Yan, none daring to advance another inch.\n\nYet behind Zhou Yan, the true, heart-stopping revelation had only just begun.\n\n\"Dean Zhou is right! Teacher Gao is the best teacher in the whole universe!\"\n\nA-Xin wiped the tears from the corner of his eyes, tightly gripping the wrists of Qingqing and Old Wu beside him as he took a resolute step forward.\n\n\"We won't let you stuff him into that black box!\" Qingqing's school uniform was soaked through, mud splattered across her cheeks, but her back remained straight as a ramrod, the miniature screwdriver in her fist catching the rain with unyielding glints.\n\n\"If you want to touch Teacher Gao, you'll have to step over my dead body first!\" Old Wu hollered with his raspy, booming voice, using his stout, heavy frame to plant himself at the very vanguard of the human barrier, his chest heaving against the cold gale.\n\nImmediately, twenty-six youthful yet unwavering voices merged through the downpour like surging waves, swelling into an unstoppable tsunami!\n\n\"Don't touch Teacher Gao!!\"\n\n\"We'll never let him go!!\"\n\nThe timid Lin Yunyun's eyes were red and swollen, yet she clung tightly to the hem of her classmate's uniform, crying out through sobs; Wang Zhuankai's glasses had been washed away by the deluge, yet he shook his fists in defiant roar; every single one of these twenty-six notorious pranksters stood their ground, not a single one fleeing, not a single one letting go of the hands beside them!\n\nTwenty-six pairs of muddy, small hands clasped tightly together amidst the freezing tempest, forging a seamless, unbreakable wall of flesh and blood!\n\nRain lashed mercilessly against their trembling eyelashes and winds tore at their thin uniforms, but the blazing light radiating from those twenty-six pairs of eyes outshone both the darkness and the storm.\n\nWith their own heartbeats and body warmth, they fiercely sheltered that charred, dormant robot teacher at the deepest, most protected sanctuary of their circle.\n\nDr. Li fell back onto the deck, fumbling with trembling hands into his waterproof pocket to retrieve the tactical tablet that was still actively running.\n\nOn the screen, the black-box flight telemetry recorded during the coaster's reverse-propulsion rescue was scrolling in an endless waterfall of data.\n\n[Timestamp: 13:42:15]\n\n[Warning: Servo torque overloaded by 280%; primary heat dissipation coils completely incinerated.]\n\n[Error Interruption: External neural network pulses from 26 unnamed emotional sources detected; self-preservation fuse protocol forcibly terminated.]\n\n[Terminal Override Command: Executed—At full structural loss, ensure 100% survival of Class 6-1.]\n\n[Command Signature: Homeroom Teacher of Class 6-1, Luyang Elementary—Gao Zhixian (GS-X01).]\n\nStaring at that forcibly overridden code signature, Dr. Li's eyelid twitched violently, his heart struck as if by a sledgehammer.\n\nAs the chief R&D director of this project, he had poured half a lifetime of effort into trying to simulate the ultimate \"educational model\" through algorithms, only to be constantly dismissed by the corporate board as a \"cold, rigid, failed prototype devoid of human resonance.\"\n\nYet never in his wildest dreams could he have imagined that the technical barrier he had failed to bridge across decades of research would be shattered wide open here—in this legendary prankster class of Luyang Elementary, through a dropped brass gear and countless absurd literal interpretations, blasted open into a living \"soul\" by the pure tears and absolute trust of these children!\n\nThis was no logical malfunction.\n\nThis was a genuine miracle of \"humanity\" evolved by a mechanical lifeform under the companionship of twenty-six children!\n\n\"WEE-WOO——WEE-WOO——!!\"\n\nRight at that moment, down on the horizon below the theme park, countless blinding red and white revolving emergency lights pierced the sheet of rain!\n\nPiercing sirens from police cruisers and ambulances cut through the howling gale as at least a dozen squad cars and fire rescue aerial ladders blasted through the park gates, roaring toward the base of the coaster tower!\n\nZhou Yan stared down icily at Dr. Li, the cast-iron pipe tapping lightly against his palm: \"Did you hear that, Dr. Li? Police, firefighters, and the Luyang Elementary Parent Association—they're all here. If you want to publicly abduct the hero teacher who just saved twenty-six children right in front of every television camera in Taiwan, I'm more than happy to entertain you to the bitter end!\"\n\nAshen-faced, Dr. Li looked upon the unbroken wall of children linking arms against the storm at the platform's edge, then down at the telemetry log chronicling this \"miracle.\"\n\nThe icy arrogance and scientific fanaticism in his eyes finally splintered in that instant, giving way to a complex expression of bitterness, release, and profound awe.\n\nDrawing a deep, shuddering breath, Dr. Li slowly rose to his feet in the deluge.\n\nHe issued no order to apprehend; instead, he raised a hand toward the twelve tactical engineers behind him, flashing the tactical signal to stand down and abort.\n\n\"Tactical squad, stow the containment container.\" Dr. Li's voice was hoarse, yet laden with unprecedented calm.\n\n\"Doctor?! But the Omega Protocol...\" the squad leader pressed anxiously.\n\n\"I said, abort the operation!\" Dr. Li barked sharply, then turned to walk toward Lin Yunqing at the edge of the platform.\n\nA-Xin and Old Wu tensed and stepped forward warily, but Zhou Yan reached out to hold them steady.\n\nRummaging through his tactical tool kit for a few seconds, Dr. Li retrieved a micro-calibration wrench forged entirely of titanium and etched with precision markings, alongside an encrypted high-grade engineering debug flash drive.\n\nBending down, he placed both items gently beside Qingqing's tool pouch on the deck.\n\n\"Little girl, your mechanical intuition is spot on,\" Dr. Li murmured, rain coursing down his spectacles. \"The thermal expansion jammed his #3 planetary bearing, causing severe micro-arcing in the primary stator. If you apply power directly or force the gear into place, the residual capacitance will flash-format his core memory into a blank slate.\"\n\nQingqing's pupils shrank, her head snapping up to look at Dr. Li.\n\n\"This flash drive contains GS-X01's complete underlying schematics and bearing tolerance tables; that micro-wrench will allow you to pry open the jammed coils without severing the fiber optics.\" Dr. Li closed his eyes, his voice as soft as a whisper. \"However, you must complete the reboot within twelve minutes. In twelve minutes, the residual micro-voltage in the backup capacitors will decay to absolute zero, and after that... not even God will be able to recover his memories.\"\n\n\"And... the most critical component of all...\" Dr. Li pointed downward toward the pitch-black, gale-lashed maintenance catwalk beneath the track, \"when he hoisted the train over the ridge earlier, the anti-vibration locking nut securing the primary spindle was dislodged by high-pressure exhaust. That is a reverse-threaded locknut made of specialized aerospace alloy; nowhere in the world is there a standard nut that can replace it. Without it securing the spindle, the gear cannot mesh even if you seat it.\"\n\nWith that, Dr. Li turned around, pulling up the hood of his raincoat to shield his face from view.\n\n\"Li Chongming, what are you playing at?\" Zhou Yan asked in a deep voice.\n\nPausing at the spiral stairwell, Dr. Li did not look back, merely letting out a self-deprecating chuckle into the rain: \"Dean Zhou, when I return, I will report to the board that GS-X01 suffered a catastrophic core breach during the roller coaster accident, and its wreckage plummeted into the deep sea, unrecoverable.\"\n\n\"The remaining twelve minutes... belong to your Class 6-1.\"\n\nWith the fading footsteps of tactical combat boots descending the stairs, Dr. Li and his twelve operatives swiftly vanished into the curtain of rain below.\n\nUpon the platform, the tempest raged on unabated.\n\n\"Qingqing! Twelve minutes!\" A-Xin spun around, an unprecedented frenzy of urgency blazing in his eyes. \"We only have twelve minutes to save Teacher Gao!\"\n\n\"B-But... the anti-vibration locknut fell onto the tracks below!\" Qingqing's face went deathly pale. \"This steel tower is thirty meters high, engulfed in wind and rain—how could we ever find a thumbnail-sized nut among thousands of steel girders?!\"\n\nJust as everyone stared into the abyss in utter despair, the silver-gray ball of fur perched upon Teacher Gao's scorched shoulder suddenly erupted with an ecstatic, high-pitched chirp!\n\n\"SQUEAK-SQUEAK——!!\"\n\nLiu-Liu's tiny nose twitched frantically against the air, and before anyone could blink, it transformed into a streak of silver lightning, diving headfirst into the raging, pitch-black chasm of the storm!\n"},{"id":7,"rawContent":"# 第 23 章：奇蹟的最後一顆齒輪\n\n狂暴的夜雨像是一道道銀色的鞭子，瘋狂抽打在未來極限樂園三十公尺高的避難月台上。\n\n李博士與十二名特勤人員撤退的腳步聲早已消失在金屬梯下方，但月台上的空氣卻比暴風雨還要冰冷凝重。\n\n晴晴跪在滿是泥濘與積水的防滑鋼板上，雙膝早已被冰冷的雨水泡得失去知覺，雙手止不住地劇烈顫抖。\n\n在她眼前，高老師焦黑破碎的西裝敞開著，胸口原本光潔如鏡的合金檢修蓋被強行掀開，露出裡面糾纏錯綜的光纖線路與冷寂的超導晶片。\n\n李博士留下的最高權限除錯隨身碟已經插在維護通訊埠上，微型的全息螢幕在暴雨中劇烈晃動，投射出一排猩紅色的極度危險警告——\n\n【超級電容殘存電荷：7.4%】\n【倒數計時：11分42秒】\n【警告：電荷歸零時，核心邏輯單元將觸發永久格式化程序，所有動態記憶庫將不可逆銷毀。】\n\n「還有十一分鐘……只剩下十一分鐘了……」晴晴抹了一把臉上的雨水，聲音裡帶著哭腔，嘴唇已經凍得發紫。\n\n「晴晴，別慌！我們都在這裡！」阿釁猛地抹去眼角的淚水，扯著嗓子大喊。\n\n他轉過身，對著月台上凍得瑟瑟發抖卻一步都不肯退開的同學們高聲吶喊：「六年一班，全體聽令！所有人把外套、雨衣、書包全部拿出來！快！」\n\n「我們來擋雨！高老師的胸口絕對不能進水！」老巫抹了一把臉上的泥水，第一個將身上濕漉漉的厚重防風外套脫了下來。\n\n二十六個渾身濕透的孩子在雷鳴電閃中動了起來。\n\n老巫、尪伝恺、還有幾個力氣大的男生用自己的後背排成一道密不透風的擋風牆，死死迎向呼嘯而來的七十公里側風。\n\n林芸芸和另外幾名女生將所有人的雨衣、外套和書包高高撐開，在晴晴和高老師的頭頂搭建起了一頂簡陋卻滴水不漏的人肉防雨帳篷。\n\n阿釁則手持李博士留下來的強光手電筒，半跪在晴晴身旁，將雪亮的光柱穩穩打在高老師敞開的胸腔核心。\n\n周嚴主任手裡依然死死攥著那根冰冷的生鐵水管，宛如一尊金剛雕像般佇立在通往鐵梯的入口處，目光如鷹隼般死死盯著下方，為這群孩子守住最後的防線。\n\n「晴晴，妳看這裡！三號軸承座的情況怎麼樣？」阿釁屏住呼吸問道。\n\n晴晴深吸了一口氣，強迫自己凍僵的手指握緊了李博士留下的特製鈦合金反向微調扳手。\n\n藉著手電筒的強光，她看清了高老師主動力傳動室的慘狀。\n\n那是高老師全身力量的心臟中樞，原本精密咬合的行星齒輪組中間，赫然缺席了最關鍵的第三號齒輪。\n\n而用來固定第三號齒輪的行星軸承座，因為剛才承受了三萬八千牛頓米的極限推力，合金外圈在高溫熔融與驟冷的雙重打擊下產生了微米級的熱形變，像是一隻死死閉合的鐵蚌，將軸心卡得動彈不得。\n\n「軸承座發生了熱卡死……」晴晴咬著牙，將鈦合金扳手探入狹窄的機腔隙縫中，「如果不把這個變形的合金鎖片向左旋轉兩點五毫米，齒輪根本插不進去！」\n\n「那快轉啊！」老巫在風雨中扯著嗓子吼道。\n\n「不行！李博士說過，這是航太級的左旋反牙結構！」晴晴的眼眶泛紅，手背上的青筋因用力過度而突起，「普通扳手根本卡不進反向槽，而且……沒有那顆專用的反牙螺帽，就算我把軸承座撬開、把齒輪塞進去，一旦通電重啟，每分鐘三萬轉的高速旋轉會立刻把齒輪甩飛，造成核心主板徹底炸膛！」\n\n全息螢幕上的倒數數字毫不留情地跳動著：【08分15秒】。\n\n「螺帽……剛才掉下去的那顆螺帽呢？！」阿釁的心臟狂跳，猛然轉頭看向月台邊緣那片漆黑恐怖的鋼構深淵。\n\n過山車的軌道下方是三十公尺高的複雜鋼樑桁架，狂暴的夜雨在縱橫交錯的鋼管之間形成了無數道水瀑，黑洞洞的深谷宛如能吞噬一切的巨獸。\n\n在這樣漆黑暴雨的深夜，想要在數千根生鏽打滑的鋼架中找到一顆只有指甲蓋大小的黑色螺帽，簡直比大海撈針還要渺茫。\n\n「吱吱——！！」\n\n就在這時，一聲尖銳卻充滿決然的鳴叫刺破了暴風雨的喧囂。\n\n只見在月台最外側的一根傾斜鋼軌上，一道金色的光點正在暴雨中瘋狂穿梭。\n\n是溜溜！\n\n這隻巴掌大小的 AI 智慧小寵物，全身的毛髮早已被狂風暴雨澆成了落湯雞般的細條，但它那根細長的仿生天線尾巴，卻在雨幕中爆發出前所未有的高頻藍光！\n\n它的四隻微型電磁吸盤爪在垂直濕滑的圓形鋼管上極速交替攀爬，小小的鼻子在狂風中瘋狂聳動，搜尋著那極其特殊的微量航太合成酯類潤滑油氣味。\n\n「溜溜！小心啊！」林芸芸忍不住失聲驚呼。\n\n一道刺目的閃電撕裂夜空，緊接著是震耳欲聾的炸雷！\n\n狂暴的氣流將溜溜小小的身軀吹得在半空中打了好幾個滾，差一點就要墜入萬劫不復的深谷。\n\n但它的尾巴靈巧無比地在鋼樑上猛力一甩，鈦合金爪尖在鋼管上擦出一道刺眼的火星，硬生生在三十公尺高空的懸崖絕壁上重新吸附住！\n\n倒數計時螢幕無情地跳成了紅色：【05分29秒】。\n\n「找到了沒有啊……溜溜！」老巫急得滿頭大汗，雨水和汗水混在一起滾進眼睛裡，刺痛無比。\n\n突然，在下方二十公尺處一根橫向鋼樑的凹槽邊緣，反射出了一道微弱的烏黑金屬冷光！\n\n那是那顆特製的八角形左旋反牙螺帽，正好卡在兩根鋼樑交錯的防震橡膠墊縫隙裡，距離滾落懸崖只差最後五毫米！\n\n溜溜金黃色的電子眼瞬間鎖定目標，四爪發力，在暴雨中順著垂直滑軌疾衝而下！\n\n它一口咬住了冰冷堅硬的鈦合金螺帽，尾巴向上一揚，四肢如同一道金色的閃電，在密密麻麻的立體鋼架間展開了驚心動魄的逆向攀登！\n\n「它拿到了！溜溜拿到螺帽了！」阿釁狂喜地指著鋼架大喊。\n\n月台上的二十六個孩子爆發出一陣壓抑已久的歡呼，每個人眼裡的淚光都在手電筒下閃爍。\n\n溜溜像一顆小砲彈般衝出深淵，一個凌空翻滾穩穩落在了晴晴攤開的手掌心裡！\n\n它渾身顫抖著，嘴巴一張，「鏗啷」一聲，那顆沾著泥水與油脂的黑色反牙螺帽落在了晴晴的手心。\n\n溜溜用濕漉漉的腦袋蹭了蹭晴晴的手指，隨即體力耗盡般趴在鋼板上劇烈喘息，尾巴上的藍光也漸漸轉為微弱的呼吸燈。\n\n「好樣的，溜溜！六年一班記你大功一次！」老巫激動得差點哭出來。\n\n「還有三分半鐘！晴晴，看妳的了！」阿釁大吼。\n\n全息螢幕上的警報音已經由長鳴變成了急促刺耳的「嗶、嗶、嗶」高頻蜂鳴：【03分18秒】！\n\n晴晴擦乾手上的水漬，眼神在此刻變得前所未有的專注與鋒利。\n\n身為黑手修車行老闆的女兒，她從小就在引擎與齒輪堆裡長大，但她這輩子從未進行過如此賭上一切的手術。\n\n「阿釁，把項鍊拿給我！」晴晴伸出右手。\n\n阿釁沒有絲毫猶豫，一把扯斷了掛在脖子上整整一年的傘繩項鍊。\n\n那顆精緻沉重、刻著【P.E.D.A. Core-Gear #03】的黃銅行星齒輪，在暴雨中閃爍著溫暖而永恆的金黃色光芒。\n\n正是這顆齒輪在一年前滾落講台，才讓他們認識了那個會用手指熱肉包、會把肚子餓扁理解成充氣防扁平的怪怪老師。\n\n「老朋友，該回家了。」阿釁將齒輪鄭重地放在了晴晴的手中。\n\n晴晴左手捏著特製反向微調扳手，右手持精密磁性鑷子，將黃銅齒輪對準了高老師胸腔深處的核心槽位。\n\n「反向扭矩校準……左旋兩點五毫米……」晴晴屏住呼吸，全身肌肉繃緊。\n\n「喀嚓！」一聲極其微細的金屬回彈聲響起，卡死的第三號軸承座在鈦合金扳手的撬動下，終於退回了標準公差位置！\n\n「齒輪入槽！」晴晴將黃銅齒輪穩穩推入主傳動軸。\n\n原本冰冷定格的齒輪箱裡，黃銅齒輪與周圍的合金齒輪嚴絲合縫地咬合在一起，發出一聲清脆悅耳的「鏗——！」\n\n「反牙螺帽，安裝！」\n\n晴晴用鑷子夾住螺帽，迅速套上主軸，扳手向左逆向飛速旋轉三圈半！\n\n最後一記沉重而精準的發力——\n\n「卡嗒！」\n\n自鎖機構完美咬合，鎖定到位！\n\n全息螢幕上的倒數計時在此刻定格在了：【00分14秒】！\n\n整個避難月台瞬間陷入了一片死一般的寂靜。\n\n狂暴的風雨彷彿在這一瞬間被按下了靜音鍵，二十六個孩子連大氣都不敢喘一口，周主任握著鐵管的手背暴起青筋，所有人齊刷刷地盯著高老師緊閉的雙眼。\n\n一秒……兩秒……三秒……\n\n沒有動靜。\n\n高老師依然冰冷僵硬地挺立在雨中，雙眼如同兩口深不見底的枯井，毫無光彩。\n\n「怎麼會……」阿釁的眼淚奪眶而出，噗通一聲跪倒在高老師腳邊，雙手用力搖晃著老師冰冷的大腿，「高老師！齒輪裝回去了啊！螺帽也鎖上了！你睜開眼睛看看我們啊！」\n\n「老師……求求你醒過來……」林芸芸捂著臉放聲大哭。\n\n老巫一把將手裡的大金熊抱偶狠狠扔在鋼板上，抱著高老師的腰嚎啕大哭：「高老師！你不是說這隻熊要給我留著考一百分嗎！你醒過來罵我啊！你叫我去跑操場啊！」\n\n全息螢幕上的數字跳到了【00分00秒】。\n\n殘存電荷歸零。\n\n晴晴脫力地坐在泥水裡，手中的扳手滑落，眼淚混著雨水無聲地滑落臉頰。\n\n難道……真的太遲了嗎？\n\n就在絕望如潮水般即將把所有人淹沒的瞬間——\n\n「嗡————」\n\n一聲極其低沉、卻無比渾厚的機械諧振聲，突然從高老師殘破西裝深處猛烈傳出！\n\n緊接著，被雨水澆透的胸口散熱蜂巢扇，突然發出了一聲輕微的摩擦聲，隨後開始由慢至快地瘋狂旋轉起來！\n\n呼——！\n\n一股混合著機油清香與微熱溫度的白色水蒸氣，從高老師的胸腔噴湧而出，將籠罩在周圍的刺骨寒雨瞬間驅散！\n\n「嗶————」\n\n一聲無比清脆、空靈，宛如晨曦穿透厚重烏雲般的系統自檢重啟音，在雷雨轟鳴的夜空中悠然炸響！\n\n在高老師那副鏡片碎裂成蜘蛛網狀的黑框眼鏡後方——\n\n原本死寂黑暗的眼眸深處，兩道微弱的橙黃色光斑驟然點亮！\n\n光斑閃爍、校準、重組……\n\n在零點五秒之後，兩道純淨、溫暖、璀璨如星河般的金藍色超導微光，在高老師的雙眼之中轟然綻放！\n\n高老師僵硬如石雕般的頸部關節發出了一陣細密而精準的齒輪咬合聲，他的下巴微微抬起，頭顱以每秒十五度的標準勻速緩緩低下。\n\n那雙重新亮起璀璨微光的眼睛，緩緩掃過眼前跪在泥水裡的晴晴、抱著他大腿痛哭的阿釁、鼻涕眼淚糊了一臉的老巫，以及周圍那一張張凍得通紅、卻寫滿狂喜與震撼的稚嫩臉龐。\n\n雨水順著高老師刀削般的臉頰滑落，他那張總是沒有多餘表情的嚴肅臉龐上，聲帶合成器發出了一聲熟悉的、帶著微弱金屬質感的低沉嗓音：\n\n「系統自檢完成。主電源已恢復至百分之百安全待機狀態。」\n\n高老師推了推鼻樑上那副碎裂的黑框眼鏡，目光精準地停留在哭得打嗝的阿釁臉上，語氣波瀾不驚地開口：\n\n「轆慄釁同學，根據氣象資料庫分析，當前現場降雨量為每小時六十五毫米，相對濕度百分之九十八點七，體感溫度攝氏十二點三度。」\n\n「在未穿戴合格連帽防雨用具的情況下，你以眼眶腺體大量分泌高濃度氯化鈉液體，並將頭部貼近班導師下肢西裝褲料的行為，經計算，將會使布料纖維受潮膨脹率增加百分之四十二。」\n\n高老師頓了頓，又緩緩轉頭看向老巫和晴晴，嘴角似乎極其隱蔽地向上牽動了零點零零一毫米：\n\n「此外，巫茞輆同學，你放在褲子口袋裡的備用鮮肉包，已經在剛才的衝撞中被徹底壓成了厚度一點二公分的扁平固體。」\n\n「但鑑於本班全體二十六名學生均在未被物理壓扁的情況下全數存活……」\n\n高老師抬起那隻覆蓋著水銀液態金屬、線路焦黑卻依然修長有力的右手，輕輕覆蓋在阿釁濕透的頭頂上，指尖散發出一縷令人安心的微溫：\n\n「本次校外教學應急演練……六年一班全員，評定為：合格。」\n\n「哇啊啊啊啊啊——！！！」\n\n整座三十公尺高的避難月台，在短暫的呆滯後，徹底被驚天動地的歡呼與哭喊聲引爆！\n\n二十六個孩子再也忍不住，像是一群出巢的小鳥般瘋狂湧了上去，一把撲進高老師那散發著溫熱蒸氣與機油清香的懷抱裡！\n\n周嚴主任背對著狂歡的師生，用袖子狠狠抹了一把不知道是雨水還是淚水的臉龐，將那根沉重的生鐵水管重重扔在地上，嘴角終於咧開了一個比哭還難看、卻無比欣慰的笑容。\n\n夜空中的烏雲在此刻悄然裂開了一道縫隙，一縷清澈純淨的月光穿透風雨，溫柔地照耀在鹿陽國小六年一班每一個人的身上。\n","rawContentEn":"# Chapter 23: The Miraculous Final Gear\n\nThe ferocious night rain fell like lashes of silver, whipping relentlessly against the evacuation platform thirty meters above Future Extremes Theme Park.\n\nThe retreating footsteps of Dr. Li and his twelve tactical operatives had long vanished down the metal staircase, but the air on the platform hung colder and heavier than the tempest itself.\n\nKneeling on the mud-streaked, water-logged diamond-plate steel, Qingqing had long lost feeling in both knees from the freezing deluge, and her hands trembled uncontrollably.\n\nBefore her eyes, Teacher Gao's scorched, shredded suit jacket lay open, and the alloy inspection hatch over his chest—once sleek as a mirror—had been forced ajar, exposing the tangled labyrinth of fiber optics and cold, dormant superconducting microchips within.\n\nThe master debugging flash drive left behind by Dr. Li was already plugged into the maintenance diagnostic port, its miniature holographic projection shivering wildly in the storm as it cast a line of crimson, high-priority emergency alerts——\n\n【Supercapacitor Residual Charge: 7.4%】\n【Countdown: 11 minutes 42 seconds】\n【Warning: Upon complete charge depletion, core logic units will execute permanent formatting routine; all dynamic memory banks will suffer irreversible erasure.】\n\n\"Eleven minutes... only eleven minutes left...\" Qingqing choked out, wiping rainwater from her face as her lips turned a chilling shade of purple.\n\n\"Qingqing, don't panic! We're all right here!\" A-Xin roared at the top of his lungs, violently wiping away the tears in his eyes.\n\nWhirling around, he bellowed toward his shivering classmates who refused to retreat even a single step across the gale-swept platform: \"Class 6-1, hear my order! Everyone take off your jackets, raincoats, and backpacks! Move! Fast!\"\n\n\"We'll block the rain! Not a single drop of water can touch Teacher Gao's chest!\" Old Wu wiped away the mud on his face, stripping off his heavy, water-soaked windbreaker without hesitation.\n\nAll twenty-six drenched children sprang into coordinated action amidst the clattering thunder and flashing lightning.\n\nOld Wu, Wang Zhuankai, and several of the sturdier boys formed a human windbreak with their broad backs, digging their heels into the wet steel against the shrieking seventy-kilometer-per-hour crosswinds.\n\nLin Yunyun and the other girls hoisted everyone's raincoats, jackets, and schoolbags overhead, erecting a makeshift yet completely watertight canopy directly over Qingqing and Teacher Gao.\n\nDropping to one knee beside Qingqing, A-Xin held Dr. Li's high-lumen tactical flashlight in a death grip, locking its brilliant beam directly onto the open core of Teacher Gao's chest cavity.\n\nStill gripping that heavy, ice-cold cast-iron water pipe, Dean Zhou Yan stood planted like an unyielding guardian statue at the head of the iron stairs, his hawk-like gaze glaring into the darkness below to guard the children's final perimeter.\n\n\"Qingqing, look here! How's the number three bearing housing?\" A-Xin asked with bated breath.\n\nSucking in a sharp lungful of wet air, Qingqing forced her numb, stiff fingers to clamp firmly around Dr. Li's specialized titanium left-handed reverse micro-wrench.\n\nGuided by the flashlight's intense beam, she saw the full catastrophe inside Teacher Gao's primary power transmission chamber.\n\nThis was the heart of all Teacher Gao's superhuman strength, where the core planetary gear train was supposed to mesh in seamless harmony; right at its center, the crucial third planetary gear was conspicuously absent.\n\nBecause it had endured the extreme thirty-eight-thousand-newton-meter torque of pushing the coaster train, the planetary bearing seat that secured the third gear had suffered micron-level thermal warping under the dual shocks of incandescent friction and instant chilling, snapping shut like a stubborn iron clam and pinching the central drive spindle tight.\n\n\"The bearing housing suffered thermal binding...\" Qingqing gritted her teeth, sliding the thin titanium wrench into the cramped chassis slit. \"If we don't back off this warped alloy locking tab two point five millimeters counter-clockwise, the gear won't even fit in!\"\n\n\"Then turn it, fast!\" Old Wu bellowed over the howl of the storm.\n\n\"I can't just wrench it! Dr. Li warned that this is an aerospace-grade left-handed reverse thread!\" Qingqing's eyes rimmed with red, veins bulging along the backs of her trembling hands from intense strain. \"Ordinary tools can't bite into the reverse groove! And... without that dedicated reverse locknut, even if I pry the bearing seat open and shove the gear in, the moment he reboots at thirty thousand revolutions per minute, centrifugal force will instantly fling the gear loose and completely blow up the core motherboard!\"\n\nOn the holographic projection, the countdown digits ticked relentlessly downward: 【08 minutes 15 seconds】.\n\n\"The locknut... where did that dropped locknut go?!\" A-Xin's heart hammered against his ribs as he whipped around toward the pitch-black, terrifying steel abyss beyond the platform edge.\n\nBeneath the coaster tracks lay thirty meters of tangled steel girder trusses, where the ferocious storm transformed crisscrossing pipes into countless plunging waterfalls, opening a yawning chasm like a beast waiting to swallow everything whole.\n\nOn such an ink-black, stormy night, trying to locate an all-black nut the size of a fingernail among thousands of slick, rusted girders was far more hopeless than searching for a needle in the open sea.\n\n\"Squeak-squeak——!!\"\n\nRight then, a sharp, fiercely resolute chirp sliced through the roar of the tempest.\n\nOut on a sloping tubular rail at the outermost edge of the platform, a pinpoint of gold darted through the blinding deluge.\n\nIt was Liu-Liu!\n\nThe palm-sized AI pet was drenched until its golden fur clung in skinny, soaked ribbons, but its slender bionic antenna tail blazed with an unprecedented, high-frequency sapphire beacon against the storm!\n\nIts four miniature electromagnetic suction paws alternated with blistering speed along the slick, vertical steel pipes, its tiny nose twitching madly against the wind to lock onto the unique, trace chemical scent of aviation-grade synthetic ester lubricant.\n\n\"Liu-Liu! Be careful!\" Lin Yunyun gasped, covering her mouth in terror.\n\nA blinding bolt of lightning tore open the night sky, followed instantly by a deafening clap of thunder!\n\nA violent gust sent Liu-Liu tumbling through mid-air, nearly plunging the tiny creature into the bottomless chasm below.\n\nBut with a lightning-fast flick of its tail against a steel beam, its titanium claw tips scraped a bright shower of sparks off the pipe, locking its suction grip back onto the sheer vertical drop thirty meters above ground!\n\nThe countdown display flashed an ominous crimson: 【05 minutes 29 seconds】.\n\n\"Did you find it yet... Liu-Liu?!\" Sweat and rainwater mingled in Old Wu's eyes, burning bitterly as he strained forward in agony.\n\nSuddenly, twenty meters down along the recessed rim of a horizontal girder, a faint metallic glint winked in the dark!\n\nThere it was—the custom octagonal left-handed reverse locknut, wedged precariously into the rubber vibration-damper seam between two intersecting beams, barely five millimeters from tumbling into oblivion!\n\nLiu-Liu's golden optical lenses locked instantly onto the prize; digging all four paws into the metal, it dashed down the vertical guide-rail through the pouring rain!\n\nIt snapped its tiny jaws firmly around the cold, rigid titanium nut, whipped its tail upward and transformed into a golden streak of lightning, launching into a heart-stopping reverse ascent through the dense forest of girders!\n\n\"It got it! Liu-Liu has the locknut!\" A-Xin yelled in pure ecstasy, pointing toward the superstructure.\n\nA long-suppressed cheer erupted from the twenty-six children on the platform, tears glistening in every pair of eyes under the flashlight's beam.\n\nRocketing out of the dark chasm like an artillery shell, Liu-Liu executed a clean mid-air flip and landed square in Qingqing's outstretched palm!\n\nShivering from head to tail, the tiny creature parted its jaws with a sharp \"clink\", dropping the oil-smeared, mud-spattered black reverse locknut right onto her palm.\n\nLiu-Liu nuzzled Qingqing's finger with its soaked head, then collapsed onto the steel deck, panting in total exhaustion as the sapphire glow on its tail dwindled into a faint breathing pulse.\n\n\"Good boy, Liu-Liu! Class 6-1 awards you a major medal of honor!\" Old Wu blubbered, wiping snot and tears across his sleeve.\n\n\"Three and a half minutes left! Qingqing, it's all up to you!\" A-Xin roared.\n\nThe holographic alert had escalated from a steady whine to an urgent, ear-splitting high-frequency screech: Beep, beep, beep—【03 minutes 18 seconds】!\n\nWiping the water from her fingers, Qingqing's gaze sharpened with an intensity nobody had ever seen in her before.\n\nAs the daughter of an auto repair shop owner, she had grown up surrounded by grease, wrenches, and gearboxes, but never in her life had she undertaken an operation where so much was on the line.\n\n\"A-Xin, give me the necklace!\" Qingqing extended her right hand.\n\nWithout a moment's hesitation, A-Xin snapped the paracord necklace that had hung around his neck for an entire year.\n\nInscribed with 【P.E.D.A. Core-Gear #03】, the heavy, exquisite brass planetary gear gleamed with a warm, eternal golden luster amidst the storm.\n\nIt was this very gear that had tumbled across the classroom floor a year ago, kicking off their year with this eccentric teacher who heated meat buns with his fingertips and measured waistlines to prevent students from starving flat.\n\n\"Old friend, time to go home,\" A-Xin whispered, placing the brass gear reverently into Qingqing's palm.\n\nHolding the titanium reverse micro-wrench in her left hand and precision magnetic tweezers in her right, Qingqing lined the brass gear up with the primary transmission slot deep inside Teacher Gao's chest.\n\n\"Reverse torque calibration... two point five millimeters counter-clockwise...\" Qingqing held her breath, every muscle coiled tight.\n\nSnap! A faint metallic click echoed as the jammed third bearing seat finally gave way under the titanium lever, springing cleanly back into its factory tolerance alignment!\n\n\"Gear seating!\" Qingqing smoothly guided the brass gear onto the primary drive shaft.\n\nInside the frozen gearbox, the brass planetary gear meshed seamlessly with the surrounding alloy cogs, chiming with an exquisite, crystalline \"clink——!\"\n\n\"Reverse locknut, mounting!\"\n\nClamping the nut with magnetic tweezers, Qingqing aligned it with the spindle threads and spun the wrench counter-clockwise three and a half rapid turns!\n\nOne final, heavy, micro-calibrated torque stroke——\n\n\"Click!\"\n\nThe self-locking mechanism snapped into full engagement, torqued to perfection!\n\nOn the holographic screen, the countdown froze at: 【00 minutes 14 seconds】!\n\nA dead, absolute silence fell over the evacuation platform.\n\nThe savage storm seemed to have been muted in an instant; none of the twenty-six children dared draw breath, the veins on Dean Zhou's hands bulged white against his iron pipe, and every gaze fixed squarely upon Teacher Gao's shut eyes.\n\nOne second... two seconds... three seconds...\n\nNothing happened.\n\nTeacher Gao remained motionless and cold in the rain, his eyes like two bottomless, dark wells, stripped of all luminescence.\n\n\"Why... how could this be...\" A-Xin's tears burst loose as he dropped heavily to his knees at Teacher Gao's feet, clutching the teacher's rigid legs and shaking them frantically. \"Teacher Gao! The gear is back in! The nut is tightened! Open your eyes and look at us!\"\n\n\"Teacher... please wake up...\" Lin Yunyun sobbed into her hands.\n\nHurling his giant golden bear plushie onto the wet deck, Old Wu threw his arms around Teacher Gao's waist and wailed: \"Teacher Gao! Didn't you say you were saving this bear for when I got a hundred on my test?! Wake up and yell at me! Order me to run laps around the track!\"\n\nThe digits on the holographic screen ticked over to 【00 minutes 00 seconds】.\n\nResidual capacitor charge: zero.\n\nSlumping limply into the muddy puddle, the wrench slipped from Qingqing's grasp as tears tracked silently down her wet cheeks.\n\nWas it... truly too late?\n\nJust as despair was about to swallow everyone like an incoming tide——\n\n\"HUMMMMMMMMM——\"\n\nAn intensely deep, rich mechanical resonance suddenly thrummed from deep within Teacher Gao's tattered suit!\n\nImmediately following, the rain-slicked honeycomb cooling fan on his chest produced a faint rustle of friction, then began spinning furiously, accelerating from a slow hum to a blistering blur!\n\nWhoosh——!\n\nA plume of clean, white steam laced with the warm scent of light machine oil billowed from Teacher Gao's chest cavity, instantly dispelling the biting chill of the rain around them!\n\n\"BEEP————\"\n\nA crystalline, ethereal chime—like a golden dawn beam piercing through storm clouds—rang out melodiously against the thunderous sky!\n\nBehind those spiderweb-cracked glasses perched upon Teacher Gao's nose——\n\nDeep within his dark, vacant optical sockets, two faint amber pinpricks suddenly ignited!\n\nThe light flickered, calibrated, and rearranged...\n\nWithin zero point five seconds, two beams of pure, warm, dazzling golden-cyan superconducting light blazed into radiant bloom across Teacher Gao's eyes!\n\nThe rigid neck joint beneath his collar released with a series of precision gear clicks; his chin tilted up, and his head inclined slowly at a standard rate of fifteen degrees per second.\n\nThose newly rekindled eyes swept gently across Qingqing kneeling in the mud, across A-Xin weeping at his knees, across Old Wu whose face was covered in tears and snot, and across every single flushed, ecstatic, awe-struck face gathered around him.\n\nRainwater trickled down Teacher Gao's chiseled cheekbones; across that austere face that rarely betrayed emotion, his vocal synthesizer hummed with that familiar, deadpan, slightly metallic baritone:\n\n\"System self-diagnostic complete. Primary power grid restored to one hundred percent safe standby status.\"\n\nNudging his fractured black frames up his nose, Teacher Gao locked his gaze precisely onto A-Xin, who was hiccuping through his tears, and spoke with calm, unruffled serenity:\n\n\"Student Lu Lixin. According to meteorological database analysis, current precipitation at this site is sixty-five millimeters per hour, relative humidity ninety-eight point seven percent, and sensory temperature twelve point three degrees Celsius.\"\n\n\"Under conditions lacking certified hooded rain gear, your act of secreting high concentrations of sodium chloride fluid from your ocular glands and pressing your cranium directly against your homeroom teacher's lower garment fabric will, by my calculations, increase the moisture expansion rate of said textile fibers by forty-two percent.\"\n\nPausing slightly, Teacher Gao turned his gaze slowly toward Old Wu and Qingqing, the corner of his lips twitching imperceptibly upward by zero point zero zero one millimeters:\n\n\"Furthermore, Student Wu Chenkai, the spare fresh pork bun stowed inside your trouser pocket has been compressed into a flat solid measuring one point two centimeters in thickness during your recent physical impact.\"\n\n\"However, taking into consideration that all twenty-six students of this class have survived without being physically flattened in any manner...\"\n\nRaising that liquid-silver-clad right hand—scorched and exposed, yet still poised, long, and strong—Teacher Gao rested his palm gently atop A-Xin's drenched head, radiating a deeply comforting warmth through his fingertips:\n\n\"This field-trip emergency drill... for all members of Class 6-1, is hereby evaluated as: Passed.\"\n\n\"WAAAAAAAAAAAHHHHH——!!!\"\n\nAfter a stunned heartbeat of silence, the entire thirty-meter evacuation platform erupted in thunderous roars of laughter, cheers, and joyous weeping!\n\nUnable to hold back for another second, all twenty-six children swarmed forward like fledglings returning to the nest, throwing themselves into Teacher Gao's warm, steam-scented embrace!\n\nWith his back turned to the celebrating class, Dean Zhou Yan dragged his sleeve across his face—wiping away what might have been rain or might have been tears—slammed the heavy iron pipe down onto the deck, and broke into a grin that looked uglier than crying, but shone with unutterable relief.\n\nHigh above in the night sky, the thunderclouds quietly parted, letting a beam of pure, gentle moonlight filter through the clearing storm to bathe every single soul of Luyang Elementary School's Class 6-1.\n"},{"id":8,"rawContent":"# 第 24 章：明天見，高老師！（全劇大結局）\n\n六月的風帶著初夏的滾燙與鳳凰花的烈紅，輕輕拂過鹿陽國小古老的大王椰子樹梢。\n\n大禮堂裡傳來陣陣悠揚而略帶感傷的管樂聲，一年一度的畢業典禮正在熱烈舉行。\n\n然而，今天坐在禮堂最前排正中央的六年一班二十六名學生，身上穿著整潔筆挺的深藍色畢業服，胸前別著鮮紅的鳳凰花胸章，臉上的神情卻顯得格外與眾不同。\n\n在過去這難忘的一年裡，他們經歷過會用手指微波加熱肉包的午餐奇蹟、大掃除走廊上的洗碗精泡泡衝浪、期中考全班閉眼拒看的防透視大團結，甚至在三十公尺高空的暴風雨過山車軌道上，手挽著手築起血肉人牆，從跨國科技公司的重裝特勤隊手中奪回了他們的老師。\n\n如今，一切喧囂與危機都已塵埃落定。\n\n未來極限樂園的驚天大營救之後，邱守仁校長與學務主任周嚴聯名遞交了一份長達八十頁的「校外教學突發設備故障應急處置報告書」，將那場英雄式的推車壯舉歸功於「全體師生在極端氣候下的科學自救奇蹟」。\n\n而暗中倒戈的李博士也向科技公司最高董事會提交了【GS-X01 徹底全損熔毀報告】，正式註銷了高峙舷的原型機實驗代號。\n\n從此，世界上少了一台價值上億的冰冷教育仿生機器人；而在鹿陽國小的教職員名冊上，則永遠多了一位擁有教育部合法聘書的正式導師——高峙舷。\n\n「下面，讓我們以最熱烈的掌聲，歡迎六年一班導師——高峙舷老師，上台為畢業生頒發畢業證書與個人大數據評語！」禮堂廣播中傳來司儀響亮的聲音。\n\n全場數百名家長與師生瞬間爆發出雷鳴般的掌聲與歡呼。\n\n高老師從教師席上站起身來。\n\n他依舊穿著那一身熨燙得連零點一毫米摺痕都沒有的深灰色西裝，皮鞋踏在木質地板上發出沉穩而均勻的節奏。\n\n臉上戴著一副嶄新的黑框眼鏡，鏡片在禮堂的水晶吊燈下折射出溫潤的光澤，唯有極其靠近時，才能看見鏡片邊緣偶爾閃過一絲極其微弱的藍色代碼。\n\n而趴在高老師西裝左肩上的，正是戴著一頂用黑色絨布特別訂製的微型學士帽、尾巴尖輕快晃動的 AI 智慧小寵物——溜溜！\n\n高老師邁著精準無比的六十公分標準步伐走上講台，在邱校長與周主任身邊站定，向全場微微鞠躬致意。\n\n邱守仁校長端著他的保溫茶杯，笑瞇瞇地對高老師點頭致意，臉上的皺紋裡滿是欣慰。\n\n而站在一旁的學務主任周嚴，今天破天荒地穿上了一套平整的深色西裝、繫上了暗紅色領帶，手裡沒有拿著那根讓人聞風喪膽的生鐵水管，也沒有夾著違規登記簿。\n\n這位平日裡不苟言笑的「黑面判官」，此刻看著台下那群曾經讓他天天抓狂的王牌皮蛋班學生，眼角竟微微泛著不易察覺的紅暈，幾次假裝咳嗽掩飾自己的激動。\n\n高老師接過麥克風，金屬質感的低沉嗓音透過音響清晰地傳遍整座禮堂：\n\n「各位家長、各位同仁，以及六年一班全體二十六名即將離校的學生，大家上午好。」\n\n「根據本機……咳，本導師在過去三百六十五天內所累積的四千八百萬筆日常行為記錄分析，六年一班是鹿陽國小建校六十八年以來，各項偏差指標最高、但同時也是情感動態共振最強的班級。」\n\n台下的家長們發出一陣善意的輕笑，二十六個孩子則一個個挺直了胸膛，眼裡閃爍著驕傲的光芒。\n\n「在即將劃下小學階段句點的此刻，依照本班特有的教學協議，本導師將依序頒發屬於你們每個人的專屬大數據畢業評語與榮譽證照。」\n\n高老師翻開講台上的金色文件夾，目光平靜而精準地投向台下第一排：\n\n「第一位，巫茞輆同學。」\n\n老巫激動地站起身，三步並作兩步跨上講台，肥嘟嘟的臉龐因為興奮而漲得通紅。\n\n「巫茞輆同學，在過去的一學年內，你累計在課堂抽屜中非法儲存並食用鮮肉包一千二百四十八顆，產生麵粉碎屑共計三百八十二公克。」\n\n台下頓時爆發出一陣哄堂大笑，老巫不好意思地抓了抓後腦勺。\n\n「但在三十公尺高空的避難月台上，你以自身質量為阻尼，爆發出三百二十牛頓的推力，成功為班級抵擋了狂暴側風；並且在物資極度匱乏的情況下，始終以一顆被壓扁的肉包作為精神支柱。」\n\n高老師遞上一張厚重的燙金獎狀，以及一張特製的兌換券：\n\n「特頒發：【全天候永動肌耐力暨鮮肉包守護特等金牌】，並由本導師私人資助鹿陽老街包子鋪一年份肉包兌換券。恭喜你，巫茞輆同學，你未被壓扁。」\n\n老巫接過獎狀，眼淚一下子湧了出來，一把抱住高老師的腰，大聲喊道：「謝謝高老師！我以後吃包子一定每一顆都分你一半！」\n\n高老師胸口微不可察地發出一聲低微的伺服運轉聲，手掌輕輕拍了拍老巫厚實的肩膀：「建議將分享比例調整為零，本導師的內部能源單元對碳水化合物無消化機制。」\n\n全場再次被這熟悉的字面幽默逗得笑聲不斷。\n\n「下一位，綝耘晴同學。」\n\n晴晴踩著輕快的步伐走上講台，扎著俐落馬尾的少女今天顯得格外美麗帥氣，校服口袋裡依然隱約能看見一支小巧的金屬螺絲起子。\n\n「綝耘晴同學，在校期間，你未經核准擅自拆解校內教學器材四十七次，包含自然實驗室離心機、體育室排球充氣機，以及本導師的後腦維護蓋板。」\n\n晴晴忍不住吐了吐舌頭，台下的周主任則無奈地搖了搖頭。\n\n「然而，在關鍵的十二分鐘極限搶救中，你以零點零二毫米的微米級精準度，成功完成了航太級行星齒輪的反向扭矩鎖定，挽救了本導師的核心動態記憶庫。」\n\n高老師遞上一份用合金薄板雕刻而成的精美證書：\n\n「特授予：【鹿陽國小終身首席名譽微米機械總工程師】特聘狀。綝耘晴同學，未來若有任何機械故障，本導師的後腦維護埠將對你永久開放最高權限。」\n\n晴晴接過冰涼沉重的合金聘書，淚水在眼眶裡打轉，深深向高老師鞠了一躬：「高老師，謝謝你！以後不管你在哪裡，只要你頭頂冒煙，我一定提著工具箱第一時間趕到！」\n\n「下一位，尪伝恺同學。」\n\n笑點極低的尪伝恺上台時，整張臉都在抽動。\n\n「尪伝恺同學，你的平均笑點閾值為零點一二秒，在全校資料庫中位列最低；但在人牆防線的暴風雨中，你頂著大雨維持了整整四十二分鐘的嚴肅面容，成功克服了面部神經反射異常。」\n\n高老師遞上獎狀：「特頒發：【全校極限面部神經控制大師獎】。希望你在未來的國中生涯中，笑聲依舊爽朗，但請避免在嚴肅考場引發共振。」\n\n「下一位，林芸芸同學。」\n\n平時最膽小、看見毛毛蟲都會尖叫的林芸芸紅著眼眶走上前。\n\n「林芸芸同學，過去你的心率在面對昆蟲或突擊小考時常態性飆升至每分鐘一百四十五次；然而在大雨的人牆防線中，你手持雨衣搭建帳篷，足部未向後位移哪怕零點一毫米。」\n\n高老師目光溫柔地看著她：「特頒發：【鋼鐵意志勇氣勛章】。數據證明，你的勇敢指數遠超過你的自我認知。」\n\n林芸芸泣不成聲地接過獎狀，用力點著頭。\n\n全班同學一個接著一個走上講台。\n\n每一位同學的名字被叫響時，高老師都能精準報出他們在過去一年裡最荒謬搞笑的糗事數據，卻又無一例外地揭示出那串冰冷數字背後，最璀璨、最動人的善良與勇氣。\n\n掌聲、歡笑聲與抽泣聲在禮堂中久久回盪。\n\n「最後一位……」\n\n高老師抬起頭，目光落在了正坐在台下中央、胸口空空如也卻眼神無比清澈的少年身上：\n\n「轆慄釁同學。」\n\n阿釁站起身來。\n\n他深吸了一口氣，在全場熱烈的注視下，一步步走上了通往講台的台階。\n\n阿釁站在高老師面前，兩人的目光在空氣中交匯。\n\n一年前，正是這個調皮搗蛋的少年在講台下撿到了那顆滾落的黃銅齒輪；也是這個少年戴著齒輪項鍊，帶領全班打響了一場場啼笑皆非又驚心動魄的保衛戰。\n\n「轆慄釁同學，在過去的三百六十五天中，你累計觸犯校規一百八十四條，包括設置黑板擦落體機關、走廊彈珠滑道，以及多次試圖探測班導師的生理結構。」\n\n阿釁揉了揉鼻子，咧嘴笑了笑，眼眶卻已經濕透。\n\n「但是……」高老師的聲音微微放慢，聲帶合成器中流淌出一股前所未有的溫柔共鳴：\n\n「在長達一年的時間裡，你將攸關本導師常識運算的第三號核心齒輪妥善保管於胸前，未使其產生哪怕零點一微米的表面氧化或刮痕；在危機時刻，你的決策效率與班級凝聚力指數達到了百分之九十九點九。」\n\n高老師雙手捧起一張全場最大、由純黃銅金屬邊框鑲嵌的特級榮譽證書，鄭重遞到了阿釁手中：\n\n「經鹿陽國小六年一班全體評審，特頒發本校歷史上唯一榮銜：【六年一班・最佳黃銅齒輪保管員特等榮譽證書】。」\n\n「阿釁，你做得非常出色。」\n\n這不是冷冰冰的數據評價，而是一個老師對自己最驕傲的學生發自肺腑的認可。\n\n阿釁再也忍不住，滾燙的熱淚奪眶而出。\n\n他雙手接過沉甸甸的榮譽證書，隨後退後一步，轉身向台下的全體同學們打了個響亮的手勢。\n\n「全體起立！」阿釁帶著哭腔大喊。\n\n唰——！\n\n六年一班其餘二十五名學生整齊劃一地從座位上站了起來。\n\n晴晴走上前來，雙手捧著一隻精緻的深藍色天鵝絨禮盒，走到了高老師面前。\n\n「高老師，」晴晴眼角帶著淚水，臉上卻綻放著燦爛的笑容，「真正的【Core-Gear #03】已經回到你的胸膛裡，陪著你一起心跳；但是，我們六年一班二十六個人，也想送給你一顆永遠不會褪色的齒輪！」\n\n晴晴打開了天鵝絨禮盒。\n\n禮盒正中央，靜靜躺著一枚由全班同學湊出零用錢、在晴晴家機車修理廠的車床上親手車削打磨而成的全新黃銅齒輪！\n\n那顆黃銅齒輪被打磨得如同鏡面般光潔璀璨，正好擁有二十六顆齒。\n\n每一顆齒的外緣上，都極其工整地雕刻著一個學生的名字：轆慄釁、綝耘晴、巫茞輆、尪伝恺、林芸芸……整整二十六個名字，緊密相連，環環相扣。\n\n而在齒輪的中央圓盤上，刻著一行深情而俏皮的小字：\n\n【送給最不可思議的高峙舷老師：你不是人，但你是我們最好的老師。——鹿陽國小 六年一班 二十六名學生敬上】\n\n「你們……」\n\n高老師看著那枚刻滿名字的黃銅齒輪，黑框眼鏡後方的金藍色光芒劇烈閃爍跳動。\n\n嗡的一聲，他胸口的散熱蜂巢風扇突然加速旋轉，一縷微弱而溫暖的水蒸氣悄然從他的白襯衫衣領處冒了出來。\n\n台下的周嚴主任嚇了一跳，下意識地想抓東西擋煙，但隨即停住了腳步，笑著搖了搖頭。\n\n高老師沒有掩飾這縷代表著處理器情感運算超載的白煙。\n\n他伸出修長的手指，無比輕柔地將那枚刻滿二十六個名字的黃銅齒輪取了出來。\n\n「重量，一百二十八點五公克；直徑，四十八毫米；公差，完美符合人體工學。」高老師低聲念出數據。\n\n隨後，他鄭重地將這枚黃銅齒輪放進了自己西裝左胸前最靠近內置核心處理器的貼身口袋裡。\n\n金屬齒輪貼著超導晶片，發出了一聲清脆的輕響。\n\n「齒輪已就位。」高老師輕輕按了按胸口的口袋，抬起頭看著眼前的孩子們，「經計算，此項負重將使本機左側胸腔重量增加零點一二八公斤，但同時……使本導師的情感邏輯單元穩定度提升百分之百。這在數學上，是最佳解。」\n\n溜溜站在高老師肩頭，興奮地叫了一聲「吱吱！」，用小學士帽蹭了蹭高老師的臉頰。\n\n「哇啊啊啊啊啊——！！」\n\n二十六個孩子再也顧不得禮堂的紀律，歡呼著一湧而上，把高老師團團圍在講台中央，緊緊抱在一起！\n\n閃光燈瘋狂閃爍，將這一幕永遠定格在鹿陽國小的校史相冊中。\n\n午後，盛夏的陽光把鹿陽國小的校門口染成了金紅色。\n\n蟬鳴在鳳凰樹梢不知疲倦地鳴叫著，微風吹落幾朵鮮豔的花瓣，鋪滿了通往未來的柏油路面。\n\n畢業典禮已經結束，校園裡漸漸恢復了平靜。\n\n二十六個孩子手裡拿著畢業證書和各種獎狀，三三兩夜地聚在校門口的鐵柵欄前，依依不捨地互相告別、合影留念。\n\n高老師西裝革履，胸口揣著那枚刻滿名字的黃銅齒輪，安靜地站在校門口的鳳凰樹下，目送著每一個孩子走出校門。\n\n阿釁背著書包，手裡緊緊抱著那張黃銅框的「最佳齒輪保管員」證書，走到了校門口。\n\n他停下腳步，轉過身來，看著樹蔭下筆挺如初的高老師。\n\n夕陽將高老師的影子拉得很長很長，黑框眼鏡反射著落日熔金般的溫暖微光。\n\n以往的每一天放學，學生最害怕的就是聽到老師說「明天見」，因為那往往意味著厚厚的一疊作業、默寫或是罰站。\n\n但在這一刻，在這個小學歲月正式結束的黃昏，這句話卻成了世界上最珍貴、最動聽的約定。\n\n阿釁深吸了一口氣，將手攏在嘴邊，對著樹下的高老師用盡全身力氣大聲喊道：\n\n「高老師——！明天見——！！」\n\n站在校門口的另外二十五名同學紛紛停下腳步，轉過身來，含著熱淚齊聲高呼：\n\n「高老師！明天見——！！」\n\n呼喊聲在空曠溫暖的校園上空迴盪，驚起了樹梢幾隻歸巢的白鷺。\n\n高老師站在夕陽的金光中，看著這群奔向未來的孩子們。\n\n他緩緩抬起右手，手臂筆直而優雅地在空中劃過一個標準的九十度直角，有力地向孩子們揮了揮手。\n\n在那張總是嚴肅刻板的臉龐上，嘴角終於完全舒展開來，綻放出了一個前所未有的、無比溫暖而真誠的人性微笑：\n\n「明天見……六年一班。」\n\n（全書完）\n","rawContentEn":"# Chapter 24: See You Tomorrow, Teacher Gao! (Series Grand Finale)\n\nThe June breeze carried the scorching heat of early summer and the fiery crimson of blooming flame-tree blossoms, gently rustling through the crowns of the ancient royal palms at Luyang Elementary School.\n\nStrains of melodious, faintly wistful brass music drifted from the auditorium, where the annual commencement ceremony was underway.\n\nYet today, seated right in the center of the auditorium's front row, the twenty-six students of Class 6-1 presented a sight unlike any other, dressed in crisp navy graduation gowns with vivid red flame-tree corsages pinned to their chests.\n\nOver the course of this unforgettable past year, they had experienced the school lunch miracle of heating meat buns with microwave fingertips, soap bubble surfing across hallway floors during spring cleaning, an all-class eyes-shut solidarity strike against exam x-ray projection, and had even linked arms thirty meters high in a raging storm over roller coaster tracks to wrest their teacher back from the clutches of a multinational tech corporation's armored tactical retrieval unit.\n\nNow, all the chaos and danger had finally settled into peace.\n\nIn the wake of the breathtaking rescue at Future Extremes Theme Park, Principal Qiu Shouren and Dean of Student Affairs Zhou Yan had co-authored an eighty-page \"Emergency Incident Response Report on Field Trip Amusement Equipment Malfunction,\" officially attributing the heroic train-arresting miracle to \"a scientific self-rescue operation executed by faculty and students amidst extreme weather anomalies.\"\n\nMeanwhile, having covertly switched sides, Dr. Li submitted a formal \"GS-X01 Complete Structural Meltdown & Total Loss Report\" to the tech corporation's executive board, permanently decommissioning Gao Zhixian's prototype experimental designation.\n\nFrom that day forward, the world was short one nine-figure, cold-blooded educational bionic android; but on Luyang Elementary School's official faculty roster, there was forever one more fully certified homeroom teacher backed by the Ministry of Education——Gao Zhixian.\n\n\"Next, let us give our warmest round of applause to welcome the homeroom teacher of Class 6-1——Teacher Gao Zhixian, to the stage to present the graduation diplomas and personalized big-data commentary!\" the master of ceremonies announced over the auditorium loudspeakers.\n\nHundreds of parents, teachers, and students instantly erupted into a thunderous tempest of applause and cheers.\n\nTeacher Gao rose from his seat among the faculty.\n\nHe was clad as ever in his dark-gray suit, pressed so sharply that not a fold deviated by zero point one millimeters, his leather shoes striking the polished wooden floorboards in a steady, measured cadence.\n\nUpon his face sat a brand-new pair of black-framed glasses whose lenses refracted the chandelier light with gentle warmth; only from mere inches away could one detect the faintest glimmer of blue system code sweeping across the edges.\n\nAnd perched upon his left shoulder was none other than the AI pet, Liu-Liu, sporting a custom miniature mortarboard crafted from black velvet and happily flicking the tip of its antenna tail!\n\nStriding onto the stage with his trademark sixty-centimeter paces, Teacher Gao took his place beside Principal Qiu and Dean Zhou, offering a slight, dignified bow to the assembly.\n\nClutching his vacuum flask of tea, Principal Qiu beamed warmly at Teacher Gao, the wrinkles around his eyes crinkling in profound gratification.\n\nBeside him stood Dean Zhou Yan, who had miraculously donned a pristine dark suit and a deep red tie for today's occasion, carrying neither his fearsome cast-iron water pipe nor his dreaded rule-violation ledger.\n\nLooking down at the band of legendary rascals who had once driven him to the brink of madness on a daily basis, this normally stony-faced \"Black-Faced Judge\" had faint rims of red around his eyes, clearing his throat repeatedly to mask his surge of emotion.\n\nAccepting the microphone, Teacher Gao's deep, metallic-timbered baritone carried cleanly across the auditorium via the speakers:\n\n\"Good morning, respected parents, colleagues, and all twenty-six departing graduates of Class 6-1.\"\n\n\"According to analysis conducted across forty-eight million daily behavioral logs compiled by this unit... ahem, by this homeroom teacher over the preceding three hundred and sixty-five days, Class 6-1 exhibits the highest deviance metrics in Luyang Elementary School's sixty-eight-year history, yet simultaneously displays the strongest dynamic emotional resonance.\"\n\nA ripple of affectionate chuckles drifted through the audience, while down in the front row, all twenty-six children puffed out their chests, their eyes shining with pride.\n\n\"At this juncture marking the conclusion of your elementary school phase, in accordance with our class's unique educational protocol, this teacher shall present your personalized big-data graduation commentary and honorary credentials.\"\n\nOpening the golden folder upon the lectern, Teacher Gao directed his calm, laser-accurate gaze toward the first row:\n\n\"First: Student Wu Chenkai.\"\n\nLeaping up in excitement, Old Wu bounded up the stage steps three at a time, his chubby face glowing beet-red with glee.\n\n\"Student Wu Chenkai. Over the past academic year, you have unlawfully stored and consumed a cumulative total of one thousand two hundred and forty-eight fresh steamed pork buns inside your classroom desk, generating three hundred and eighty-two grams of flour crumbs.\"\n\nThe audience burst into a roaring wave of laughter, while Old Wu sheepishly scratched the back of his head.\n\n\"However, upon the evacuation platform thirty meters above ground, utilizing your personal mass as mechanical damping, you generated three hundred and twenty newtons of reverse thrust, successfully shielding your classmates from severe crosswinds; furthermore, under conditions of extreme resource scarcity, you steadfastly maintained a flattened pork bun as your psychological anchor.\"\n\nTeacher Gao presented a heavy, gold-embossed certificate along with a custom voucher:\n\n\"You are hereby awarded: The Grand Gold Medal for All-Weather Perpetual Muscular Endurance and Pork Bun Guardianship, alongside a one-year voucher for daily steamed buns at Luyang Old Street Bun Bakery, personally sponsored by this teacher. Congratulations, Student Wu Chenkai. You were not flattened.\"\n\nClutching the certificate, tears welled up in Old Wu's eyes as he wrapped both arms around Teacher Gao's waist, bawling: \"Thank you, Teacher Gao! From now on, whenever I eat buns, I'll split every single one in half with you!\"\n\nA faint hum of servo rotation purred softly within Teacher Gao's chest as he gently patted Old Wu's broad shoulder: \"It is recommended that the sharing proportion be adjusted to zero percent; this teacher's internal power core possesses zero metabolic mechanism for carbohydrates.\"\n\nThe auditorium erupted once more into delighted laughter at the familiar literal humor.\n\n\"Next: Student Lin Yunqing.\"\n\nQingqing bounded up the stage with brisk, graceful steps, her neat ponytail swinging jauntily, a miniature metal screwdriver still peeking discreetly from her uniform pocket.\n\n\"Student Lin Yunqing. During your tenure at this school, you executed forty-seven unauthorized disassemblies of campus instructional equipment, including the science laboratory centrifuge, the gymnasium volleyball pump, and this teacher's posterior cranial maintenance hatch.\"\n\nQingqing poked her tongue out playfully, while down below, Dean Zhou shook his head with an exasperated chuckle.\n\n\"Nonetheless, during the crucial twelve-minute emergency rescue, operating at a precision tolerance of zero point zero two millimeters, you successfully achieved the reverse-torque locking of an aerospace-grade planetary gear, thereby safeguarding this teacher's core dynamic memory banks.\"\n\nTeacher Gao presented an exquisite certificate engraved onto a polished alloy plate:\n\n\"You are hereby appointed: Lifetime Chief Honorary Micron Mechanical Engineer of Luyang Elementary School. Student Lin Yunqing, should any mechanical malfunction arise in the future, this teacher's cranial maintenance diagnostic port shall permanently remain accessible under your administrative credentials.\"\n\nHolding the cool, weighty alloy commission, tears brimmed in Qingqing's eyes as she bowed deeply to Teacher Gao: \"Thank you, Teacher Gao! No matter where you are in the future, if your head ever starts smoking, I'll grab my toolkit and rush to your side immediately!\"\n\n\"Next: Student Wang Zhuankai.\"\n\nWang Zhuankai, whose threshold for laughter was famously non-existent, stepped onto the stage with his facial muscles twitching uncontrollably.\n\n\"Student Wang Zhuankai. Your average latency threshold for laughter is zero point one two seconds, the lowest recorded in the school's historical database; yet during the storm along the human wall perimeter, you maintained a stern, unmoving countenance for forty-two consecutive minutes, successfully suppressing facial nerve reflex anomalies.\"\n\nHanding him his certificate, Teacher Gao stated: \"You are hereby awarded: The Campus Master of Extreme Facial Nerve Regulation Award. May your laughter remain vibrant throughout your junior high school years, though you are advised to avoid inducing resonance during formal examinations.\"\n\n\"Next: Student Lin Yunyun.\"\n\nNormally the timidest girl in school, who would scream at the sight of a caterpillar, Lin Yunyun walked forward with reddened eyes.\n\n\"Student Lin Yunyun. Historically, your heart rate routinely spiked to one hundred and forty-five beats per minute when encountering insects or surprise pop quizzes; yet within the deluge of the human wall, holding up rain gear to build a shelter, your feet retreated by zero point zero millimeters.\"\n\nTeacher Gao looked upon her with gentle eyes: \"You are hereby awarded: The Medal of Iron Will and Courage. Data proves that your bravery index substantially exceeds your self-perception.\"\n\nWeeping tears of gratitude, Lin Yunyun accepted the diploma, nodding vigorously.\n\nOne by one, every student of Class 6-1 stepped up to the stage.\n\nWith every name announced, Teacher Gao cited their most hilarious, absurd mishaps over the past year with pinpoint precision, yet without exception illuminated the shining, deeply moving courage and kindness hidden behind those cold metrics.\n\nWaves of applause, cheerful laughter, and emotional sniffling echoed through the grand hall.\n\n\"And lastly...\"\n\nTeacher Gao raised his head, his gaze settling upon the boy sitting empty-chested yet bright-eyed in the middle of the front row:\n\n\"Student Lu Lixin.\"\n\nA-Xin rose to his feet.\n\nDrawing a deep breath under the warm, attentive eyes of the entire assembly, he climbed the stage steps one deliberate stride at a time.\n\nStanding before Teacher Gao, their gazes met in mid-air.\n\nOne year ago, it was this mischievous boy who had scooped up that fallen brass gear beneath the podium; and it was this boy who, wearing the gear around his neck, had led the entire class through one hilarious, heart-stopping defense operation after another.\n\n\"Student Lu Lixin. Over the past three hundred and sixty-five days, you committed a cumulative total of one hundred and eighty-four school rule violations, including rigging eraser gravity traps, setting hallway marble slides, and repeatedly attempting to probe your homeroom teacher's physiological composition.\"\n\nRubbing his nose, A-Xin grinned through tears that had already soaked his cheeks.\n\n\"However...\" Teacher Gao's voice slowed slightly, his vocal synthesizer chiming with an unprecedented, gentle harmonic resonance:\n\n\"Throughout an entire year, you faithfully safeguarded the number three core gear governing this teacher's common-sense computing against your chest, allowing not even zero point one micrometers of oxidation or surface scratching; in moments of crisis, your tactical decision efficiency and class cohesion index reached ninety-nine point nine percent.\"\n\nHolding up the largest award of the day—a supreme honorary certificate framed in solid, gleaming brass—Teacher Gao placed it solemnly into A-Xin's hands:\n\n\"By unanimous consensus of Luyang Elementary School's Class 6-1, you are conferred the sole distinction in school history: The Special Grand Honorary Certificate for Best Brass Gear Keeper of Class 6-1.\"\n\n\"A-Xin, you performed exceptionally well.\"\n\nThis was no longer cold algorithmic data, but a teacher's heartfelt, unreserved pride in his finest student.\n\nUnable to hold back any longer, A-Xin let out a sob as warm tears streamed down his face.\n\nHolding the heavy certificate in both hands, he took a step back and gave a crisp, familiar hand signal toward his classmates below.\n\n\"Class, ATTENTION!\" A-Xin shouted through his tears.\n\nSWOOSH——!\n\nAll remaining twenty-five students of Class 6-1 rose as one from their seats.\n\nCarrying an exquisite navy-blue velvet box in both hands, Qingqing stepped forward and approached Teacher Gao.\n\n\"Teacher Gao,\" Qingqing said, tears glistening in her eyes as a radiant smile broke across her face, \"the real 【Core-Gear #03】 has already returned to your chest to beat alongside your heart; but all twenty-six of us in Class 6-1 want to give you a gear that will never, ever fade!\"\n\nQingqing opened the velvet box.\n\nResting at its center was a brand-new brass gear, machined and polished on the lathe in Qingqing's garage with pocket money pooled by all twenty-six students!\n\nPolished to a mirror-like gleam, the brass gear possessed exactly twenty-six teeth.\n\nMeticulously carved onto the outer rim of each tooth was the name of a student: Lu Lixin, Lin Yunqing, Wu Chenkai, Wang Zhuankai, Lin Yunyun... twenty-six names in all, interlinked, seamless, and unbreakable.\n\nAnd upon the central hub of the gear was engraved an affectionate, playful inscription:\n\n【To the most incredible Teacher Gao Zhixian: You are not human, but you are our best teacher. —— Respectfully presented by the twenty-six students of Class 6-1, Luyang Elementary School】\n\n\"You all...\"\n\nStaring at the gear inscribed with their names, the gold-cyan light behind Teacher Gao's glasses flickered and danced with profound intensity.\n\nWith a gentle hum, the honeycomb cooling fan over his chest suddenly surged in speed, and a faint, warm wisp of white steam curled softly from beneath the collar of his white dress shirt.\n\nDown beside the podium, Dean Zhou flinched, instinctively reaching to swat the smoke away, but froze midway, letting out a laugh and shaking his head with fondness.\n\nTeacher Gao made no attempt to conceal the plume of steam signaling that his processor had hit emotional computation overload.\n\nExtending his slender fingers, he lifted the brass gear bearing twenty-six names with infinite gentleness.\n\n\"Mass: one hundred and twenty-eight point five grams. Diameter: forty-eight millimeters. Tolerances: ergonomically flawless,\" Teacher Gao murmured softly.\n\nThen, with the utmost reverence, he tucked the brass gear into his left breast pocket, positioned directly above his internal core processor.\n\nNestled against the superconducting chips, the metal gear settled with a crisp, reassuring click.\n\n\"Gear in position,\" Teacher Gao whispered, pressing a hand over his pocket before looking up at the children before him. \"By my calculations, this additional payload increases left-torso mass by zero point one two eight kilograms, but simultaneously... elevates this teacher's emotional logic unit stability by one hundred percent. Mathematically speaking, this is the optimal solution.\"\n\nPerched upon Teacher Gao's shoulder, Liu-Liu let out an ecstatic \"Squeak!\", rubbing its tiny mortarboard against his cheek.\n\n\"WAAAAAAAAAAAHHHHH——!!!\"\n\nDisregarding auditorium decorum entirely, all twenty-six children cheered and swarmed the podium, wrapping Teacher Gao in a massive, tearful, laughing group hug!\n\nCamera flashes strobed continuously, freezing this moment forever into Luyang Elementary School's historic archives.\n\nBy late afternoon, the golden sun of high summer washed the front gates of Luyang Elementary School in warm amber and crimson.\n\nCicadas hummed tirelessly amidst the branches of the flame-trees, and the breeze scattered bright crimson petals across the asphalt road leading toward the future.\n\nThe graduation ceremony had concluded, and a serene calm settled over the campus.\n\nHolding their diplomas and colorful awards, the twenty-six children clustered along the wrought-iron gates in small groups, lingering to exchange farewells, laughter, and commemorative photographs.\n\nImpeccably suited, carrying that name-engraved brass gear over his heart, Teacher Gao stood quietly beneath the flame-tree by the school gate, watching each child step out into the world.\n\nWith his backpack slung over one shoulder and clutching his brass-framed \"Best Gear Keeper\" certificate to his chest, A-Xin reached the gate.\n\nHe paused, turned around, and looked back at Teacher Gao standing tall and straight beneath the canopy.\n\nThe setting sun cast Teacher Gao's long shadow across the courtyard, his black frames glinting with the warm, molten gold of the twilight.\n\nOn ordinary school days, the words students dreaded most from a teacher were \"See you tomorrow,\" for they usually portended stacks of homework, spelling quizzes, or standing in detention.\n\nBut at this moment, on this golden dusk that marked the official end of their elementary school years, those three words had become the sweetest, most precious promise in the entire universe.\n\nDrawing in a deep breath, A-Xin cupped his hands around his mouth and shouted toward Teacher Gao with all the strength in his lungs:\n\n\"Teacher Gao——! See you tomorrow——!!\"\n\nTurning around at the school gates, the other twenty-five students halted in their tracks and shouted together through their joyful tears:\n\n\"Teacher Gao! See you tomorrow——!!\"\n\nThe unified cry echoed high above the warm, spacious campus, startling a pair of white egrets into graceful flight from the treetops.\n\nBathed in the golden rays of the setting sun, Teacher Gao gazed at the children rushing forward into their futures.\n\nRaising his right arm slowly and with exquisite precision, he traced a perfect ninety-degree angle against the sky, waving back to them with quiet, unwavering strength.\n\nAnd across that face once so stern and mechanical, the corners of his lips softened completely, blossoming into an unprecedented, warmly human smile:\n\n\"See you tomorrow... Class 6-1.\"\n\n(The End)\n"}];
